<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Irhuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Irhuka aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Irhuka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Irh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Isarhe iyiki Ize iyi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Irhuka</para>
  <para style="mt2">aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Irhuka</para>
  <para style="ip">Irhuka unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Unga awu utsen abi Uyahuda na awu urhikita ikɛi. Unga ikɛi asi iwea ra angwɛ̃ imesu Uyesu ru nyaka abika atsɛng abvur akɔɔ abika adzowe Isarhe Uyesu, bɔr utsar uwekpɔ ugɛ unga agbopunga nggu angwɛ̃ imesu Uyesu abɔɔ (12). Iwe ugɛɛ atsɛng ubvur ha ru uteu Uroma. Atsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ru Utiyofirhu bɔr Isarhe ha iwe iyi ubɛn unera.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur Irhuka irherha arherhe ri itsi Uyesu igɛ unga awu uner uwuku ufɔrh abi Uisrairha nu upfunga kishoo. Ubvur uwurɛ utirhi nggu Isarhe iyi anggɔm iyi imar Uyesu ni imasha nggu Isarhe iyi anggɔm iyi ififũ Uyesu ra afã. Ri Isarhe ha, Irhuka adɛyiwa umɛn ighongkɔ akarhãrhã nggu abika awe ru idamɛn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ísarhe iyɔɔ, awu ubvur uwurɛ ukpekũ umgbɔ utsɛng, undzumunga awe ra arherhe aki <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1-2">1—2</ref></char> nggu arherhe aki <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9-19">9—19</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur uwurɛ urherha arherhe akarhãrhã ri itsi ifɛn-Num, Ipfu Isarsatangge, nu ítseryɛ aka atsɛrh aka atɔ̃we Uyesu ri itsernga, nu ikɛi ikpũ atorhkɛ Unum aka adɛyiwe abi upfung utsɛku unga aka atsũwe arhimmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imar nu useng Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima nu Uyesu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1.5—2.52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itser Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ubɔtisima Uyesu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">3.21-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Atoku Uyesu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">3.23-38</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iviviri Uyesu ra arhum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itser Uyesu ru Ugarhirhi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14—9.50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyesu abɔre Ugarhirhi na azĩa Urusharhima <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51—19.27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Usati Uyesu ukpu imaatak ru Urusharhima <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19.28—23.56</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isisok Uyesu ra akpe, nu idzidzekanga, nu ikɛi ififũnga ra afã <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24.1-53</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Irhuka atsɛnge Utiyofirhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ aka atsu amɛnmbɔ atsɛng isarhe abinkɛ aka atsuafɛr ru umɛn. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Atsɛng abinkɛ umɛn iki igũ ra angwĩ abika anyã abin hã ra asumbɔ ri inggbaashia na awe agãrhã isarhe Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Nggee, a uteiya Utiyofirhu, umum iki ingwɛ̃dzɛn ni irhisa abina kishoo aka atirhi ri inggbaashia, umum inyã azea ikɛi umum itsɛnga ungo agbɛgbɛra. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Ngge itsú ungo uma uhwɛng idzidzɛrhe abinkɛ umbɔ aka amesuwa ungo.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔm imar Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Ri ivang Uhiridu aka awu uyɛrhe Uyahudiya, uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num nuwɔ agburh Uzakariya, awe ru ukpui Uabija. Utsɛ̃nga Uarhisabatu ikɛi awu unang Uharuna. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Uzakariya nggu Uarhisabatu arhika ra asu Unum, adɔsi Ikpem Uteijee kishoo asi igbambɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Bɔr umbɔ ashimbɔ nu ungwɛ̃, ubinkutsu Uarhisabatu awu ukpirh, umbɔ ikivarhambɔ aka akɔ̃mbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ivanga niyɔ ukpui ukpumbɔ Uzakariya awe ri itser, nu Uzakariya atɔ̃ itser iyi uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num ra asu Unum. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ru nyaka umbɔ aki itang avii asɛng abika adzowe idɛm-Num, umbɔ asɛng Uzakariya azĩ akpĩĩ abin isung ri Iya Uteijee. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ivang iyiki ikpĩĩ abin isung hã iki iwe, anera abika adzowe igɔng ru Unum akɔng ru awiya anu ifɛn-Num.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser Uteijee ha akapɛɛng ra asunga, idɛ̃ɛ̃ udiku ubok ugha ubeu isung hã. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Ivang Uzakariya aka anyã unga, unga agbipa, iwei ifɛr unga. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Bɔr ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uzakariya, niba ugũo iwei, aka agũmbɔ ifɛn-Numngo. Utsɛ̃ngo Uarhisabatu awuri imara ungo uwɛkutsa, ungo utar itsoknga igburh Uyohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Unga awuri iwu ubin anggɔm nu itɛnamɛn ru ungo, imarnga iwuri itsu anera arhɛrhɛ agɔm anggɔm. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Unga awuri iwu uner ukugɔng ra asu Uteijee. Awu ufang unga asi íhwaa adɛ nu abin aka atsu afĩrhã, awuri itsuke unga Ipfu Isarsatangge ri imarnga. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ ru Uisrairha unga awuri idzipa umbɔ azĩ ru Uteijee Unummbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Unga awuri inggbaashia azĩ ru Uteijee ha, ri ijee ipfu ru nyaki iyi Uirhiya, awuri itsu amɛn atei adzipa awe nggu angwɛ̃mbɔ na adzipa abi iker itsi umbɔ adɔsi itsoi abika arhurhika na atsu anera agbishi isiseimbɔ nggu Uteijee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Uzakariya arhusu ipfu itser-Num hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ikorhu uguse ni ihwɛng rimi hã? Umumwi iki ikɔ̃mum, nu imɛk utsɛ̃mum iyɛ iki irhɛirhɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umum Ujibrairhu. Umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu Unum, awu unga adena umum ĩba irherha arherhe nggu ungo ni idɛyiwa ungo isarhe iyiki ize iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Ungo ucɛrɛ, unu ukutata usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ urherhungo arherhe utsɛku unumkpi akɛrɛ ha aka ikorhe, ubinkutsu ungo ushiɔ ru imangmang ru irhɛm arherhamum, arherha ha awuri iweke ri ivangyɛ ngge iki imɛ̃ ngge iwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Ri ivang hã, anera aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzɛu Uzakariya adzeidzeu ri ididãrhãnga ri Iya-Num. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Unga aka adzeka, unga afɔr irherha arherhe adaka nggu umbɔ. Umbɔ adiki ihwihwɛng agɛ anyãã irhi ri Iya-Num, ubinkutsu unga akpurha akũ aboka akorhu utsara na afɔr irhirherhe adaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Ivang itsernga iki imaa, unga abvui azĩã ri iya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Inum hã iki imaa, utsɛ̃nga Uarhisabatu adzur anaa, afɛ̃ɛ̃ atɔ̃ɔ̃ asei ri iya, anera asi ihwɛngmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Uarhisabatu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee akorhuwa umum rimi. Ri inumyɛ unga aka amutuwa umum na atsũwã atsak ru umum ra asu anera!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔm imar Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Anaa Uarhisabatu awu ru ufɛ̃ uwu utɔ̃ĩ, Unum adene ipfu itser-Num Ujibrairhu izĩ uteu Unazarat ra abĩ Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Azĩ ru unakugbĩrhĩ anasi ihwɛngnga ukutsa aka awu ukarh unerwi aka agburh Uyusuf, unang Udauda. Itsok unakugbĩrhĩ hã igburh Umaryamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã izĩ igɔr unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ighwe ungo unamata ukugɔng, Uteijee awu nggu ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Amɛn Umaryamu agũ ighong akarhãrhã ru urhɛm ighwe ha, na akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ awu use ighwea iwe rimi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Bɔr ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;A Umaryamu, niba ugũa iwei. Unum unga amutuwa ungo. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Ungo uwuri ikɔ̃ anaa umar ungwɛ̃, nu utar itsoknga igburh Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Unga awuri iwu ukugɔng na awuri iyisa unga Ungwɛ̃ Nggaa Uwuku Ugɔng. Unum Uteijee awuri idzowuka unga anang isei iyɛrhe utɛnga Udauda, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>nu unga awuri iwu uyɛrhe iya Uyakubu ugbagbaa, iyɛrhanga isi ímaangge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Umaryamu arhusu ipfu itser-Num hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ifɛrha ha ikorhi iguse ni iwe? Umum uwi inasi ihwɛng ukutsa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ipfu Isarsatangge iwuri icipuwa ru ungo, nu ijee iyi Nggaa Uwuku Ugɔng itsira uzirhzĩnga nu ungo. Ngge itsú usarkasar ungwɛ̃ hã ungo uku imar awuri iyisa unga Ungwɛ̃ Unum. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Nggayɛ unapumbi Uarhisabatu awu ra anaa uwɛkutsa afɛ̃ɛ̃ utɔ̃ĩ nggu ikɔ̃nernga, umbɔ iki iyisa unga ukpirh. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Ubin usi ínangkpɔ Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Umaryamu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu ugãrhũ Uteijee. Uneke ifɛrha ha iwe ru umum ru nyaka ungo uku ugɔr.&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã ibɔrukungge unga.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Umaryamu azĩ iyepu Uarhisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ivang hã Umaryamu asok iki ifefetem azĩã ri igũ abĩ Uyahudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Unga atsĩ ri iya Uzakariya na aghwe Uarhisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Uarhisabatu aka agũ ighwe Umaryamu, irheng ungwɛ̃ iso iniir ra ananga. Uarhisabatu awu nggu Ipfu Isarsatangge. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Unga atsu ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwe ru idorh ru akatsɛrh, nu idorh iwe nggu ungwɛ̃wi ungo iki imar! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Awu use utsu umum ikpo umata rimi, uyisa Uteijeemum asok aba ru umum? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki igũ irhak ighwengo ra atomum, irheng ungwɛ̃ ra anaamum iso idɛ̃ɛ̃ anggɔm. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Idorh iwe nggu unga, aka awe ru imangmang agɛ arherhu Uteijee aka arherhe nggu unga awuri itsuafɛrke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubom Umaryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Umaryamu agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Ipfumum ikpoi Uteijee ha,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>nu ipfumum igɔmanggɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">Unum aka awu uwuku ufɔrh umum,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>unga aka ayita umum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">utsũwũ ugãrhãnga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Utirhi icɛrɛ undana kishoo awuri iyisa umum uner idorh,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>ubinkutsu Uner Igɔng hã aka akorhe abin akagɔng ru umum.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Itsoknga isarsatake.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Atorhnga atɛ̃rhã ru undana kishoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">ra abika agũ iwei unga.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Unga aka akũ aboknga akorhi ifɛrhɛ iyiki igɔng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Unga aka asituwe abi aberi itsi ri ifɛrhkɔmbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Unga aka acipuwe ayɛrhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ra anang iseimbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">na aberuwe abika arhɛrhi itsi afafã.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Unga aka atsu abi imerh ashuurmbɔ nggu abin aka aze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">na adene abi ubin nggu abok akatãrhã.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Unga aka ayikuwe ugãrhãnga Uisrairha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">na acorhuwe<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Uibrahim nu anangnga ugbagbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">ru nyaka unga aka arherhe nggu atokamɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Umaryamu asei nggu Uarhisabatu ayoka afɛ̃ɛ̃ ataar na adɔrha abvui azĩ ri iya.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imar Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Ivang Uarhisabatu aka imar, unga amar uwɛkutsa. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Andɔkanga nu abi iyambɔ agũ ugɛ Uteijee acorhuwe unga akarhãrhã, umbɔ agɔm anggɔm nggu unga.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ru unum ukpu utɔrɔk umbɔ aka aba isorhuwe ungwɛ̃ɛ̃, na abee itare itsok utɛnga ru unga ugɛ Uzakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>bɔr uyisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ! Awuri iyisi itsoknga Uyohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi ashimbi nu unera ru ikarmbi aka awe ru itsok ikɛrɛ ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ akũ abok akorhu utsara nu utesa abee ihwɛng utesa awuri itar itsok ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ igburh ungaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ adzowe ubin itsɛng, nu anera kishoo adzeidzeu unga aka atsɛng, &lt;&lt;Itsoka igburh Uyohana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Kanying angwĩnga ayanga urhɛmnga ugarhe nu unga atirhunga arherhe na akpoi Unum. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Iwei ifɛr umbɔ, ikɛi umbɔ atsĩmbɔ irherha arherhe ha amaa inanga kishoo ra abĩ ampfũwã Uyahudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Ubɛn unera aka igũ arherhe ha, unga akaifɛrhkɔ na arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃wi awuri iwe agusenga?&gt;&gt; Ubinkutsu ubok Uteijee uwe nggu unga.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubom Uzakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Utɛ ungwɛ̃ hã Uzakariya awu nggu Ipfu Isarsatangge na asɔm Arherhu-Num agɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>&lt;&lt;Umɛn ikpoi Uteijee, Unum uwu Uisrairha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Ubinkutsu unga aka iba ibvure anernga.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Unga aka aberunga utsom ififɔrh ru umɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ri iya ugãrhãnga Udauda,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>ru nyaka unga aka arherhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">ra angwĩ asarkasar abika asɔm Arherhu-Numnga ishaisha.<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Afɔrh umɛn ru ubok anggamtsakmɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nu kishoo abika akpɛ̃na umɛn.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Adɛyiwe atorhnga ra atokamɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na ayitu usarkasar ibibemuwenga.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Uyirhkpi unga aka ayirhe utɛmɛn Uibrahim,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>unga aka ifɔrh umɛn ru ubok anggamtsakmɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">na atsu umɛn isi ígũmɛn iwei itɔ̃ itsernga,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>ri isisar nu irhirhika ra asunga ri inummɛn kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>&lt;&lt;Ungo ungwɛ̃mum, awuri iyisa ungo uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">uwu Nggaa Uwuku Ugɔng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Ubinkutsu ungo uwuri igbaashia uzĩ ugbishuwe utsĩndĩ Uteijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">unga adɔrha aba.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Ungo uwuri idzowe anernga ihwihwɛng ififɔrh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ri itsũwe arhimmbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Ubinkutsu atorh Unum aka adzaa umɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">unga atsu irhirhang ishaa unum iwuri idzeka afã iba ru umɛn,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>izĩ irhange abika awe ru uzĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nu abika awe ru uzirhzĩ akpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">na adarh umɛn izãrhã nu utsĩndĩ uwuku udɔɔr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Uyohana aseng aba awu akerketawɔ ri ipfu, na aseisa arhum utsɛku unumkpi unga aka adzek ra asu abi Uisrairha.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Imar Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Umat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ri inum hã Ukaisar Uaugustu atsu umbɔ avarhi irhɛ anera ra abĩ Uroma ru upfunga. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Uvarhe ukpu inggbaashia nukpɔ ri ivang Ukiriniyu aka awu ugomna ra abĩ Usuriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Anera kishoo asok azĩmbɔ iteumbɔ nu umbɔ atsɛng umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Nggee Uyusuf iganga adzeku uteu Unazarat ru Ugarhirhi azĩ Uyahudiya, azĩã Ubaitarhami uteu Udauda, ubinkutsu unga awu unang Udauda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Unga azĩ umɔ umbɔ atsɛng unga nggu Umaryamu, ukarhnga aka awu ra anaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka awu umɔ, ivang iyiki imar ungwɛ̃ iwengge. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Unga amar ukã ungwɛ̃nga, uwɛkutsa. Unga abɛrh unga ra atorho na angwɛ̃we unga ru ukhukhɔɔ, ubinkutsu umbɔ asi ikpombɔ ubã anang inũ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi idzɛu nu ípfu itser-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ra abĩ hã abi idzɛu rabɔ ri idɛɛ iyɔɔ, anu idzɛu ídɔimbɔ ru untsuuka. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ipfu itser Uteijee akapɛɛng ru umbɔ, ikpikpoi Uteijee irhange umbɔ, iwei ifɛr umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Bɔr ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr umbɔ igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba agũmbi iwei. Umum ikũwã umbi isarhe iyiki izeyɛ iki ikowe anera kishoo anggɔm akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Irherɛ ru uteu Udauda aka amarambɔ uwuku ufɔrh umbi, unga awu Ukiristo Uteijee. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Utsar ukpirɛ, umbi awuri inyãmbi irheng ungwɛ̃ iki ibɛrh ra atorho na angwɛ̃we unga ru ukhukhɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Kanying ikpui ípfu itser-Num irhɛirhɛ, ngge aka apɛng nggu ipfu itser-Num hã akpoi Unum na agɔr agɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>&lt;&lt;Akpoi Unum afafã ra afã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">nu ididɔɔr ru upfung iwe nggu abirabɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Unum aka amutuwe umbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Ivang ikpui ípfu itser-Num hã iki ibɔre umbɔ ni ifũngge ra afã, abi idzɛu ha agɔr adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn izĩmɛn Ubaitarhami izĩ inyãni ubinkpi uku ukorhe Uteijee aka adɛyiwa ukpɔ ru umɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Nggee umbɔ asok ififitem azĩmbɔ azĩ anyã Umaryamu nggu Uyusuf, nu irheng ungwɛ̃ iki inũ ru ukhukhɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Umbɔ aka anyã unga, umbɔ asɔme anera ubinkpi umbɔ aka adɛyiwe umbɔ ri itsi ungwɛ̃ hã, <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>nu kishoo abika agũ adzeidzeu ru ubinkpi abika idzɛu idɔi ha aka arherhe nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Bɔr Umaryamu angwɛ̃ ifɛrha ha kishoo na akaifɛrhkɔ ake ra amɛnnga. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Abi idzɛu ha abvui azĩ na akpoi Unum ra abina kishoo umbɔ aka agũ na anyã, awu ru nyaka umbɔ aka adɛyiwe umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adzowe Uyesu ri Iya-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Unum ukpu utɔrɔk uku uba uwe, ivang umbɔ iki isorhuwe unga usorhe, umbɔ atar itsoka igburh Uyesu, itsok iki ipfu itser-Num hã iki irherhe umbɔ adɔrha akɔ̃ ananga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Urha 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Irh 1.31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Ivang iyiki isorhuwe inyãwã iki iba itsuifɛr, ru nyaka ngge iki iwe ru Íkpem Umusa, Uyusuf nggu Umaryamu akũna unga azĩmbɔ Urusharhima umbɔ adzowe irheng ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ ru Uteijee, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>ru nyaka umbɔ aka atsɛng ri Íkpem Uteijee ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn ukã ungwɛ̃ uwuku utsa, awuri itsũ unga awu uwu Uteijee.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Idzi 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ikɛi na adzowe idɛm-Num, ru nyaka ngge iki iwe ri Íkpem Uteijee, &lt;&lt;Anurhɛu iya avaa, use angwɛ̃ anurhɛu avaa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Urha 12.8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ri ivang hã unera nuwɔ ru Urusharhima itsoka igburh Usimiyon. Awu uner uwuku urhika, agũ iwei Unum na adzɛu abee inyã ififɔrh Uisrairha, awu nggu Ipfu Isarsatangge ri itsinga. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Ipfu Isarsatangge iki isɔmukũngge unga igɛ, unga asi íkpea utsɛku unga aka inyã Ukiristo uwu Uteijee. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Ipfu-Num ikũna unga izĩngge ru ufɔm Iya-Num. Ivang utesa nggu uyisa Uyesu aka akũna unga aba nu umbɔ akorhuwe ubinkpi agbeyambɔ aka agɔr ri Íkpem Umusa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Usimiyon ayɛi unga ra aboka na akpoi Unum agɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>&lt;&lt;A Uteijee uner ijee kishoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ru nyaka ungo uku urherhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">uneke ugãrhãngo azĩ uku utɔɔ icɛ, ru nyaka ungo uku ubemuwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ubinkutsu asumum anyãke ififɔrhngo,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>iyiriyɛ ungo uku ugbisha ra asu anera kishoo,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>irhirhang irhang idɛyiwe atsen abi Uyahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">nu ikpikpoi ra anerngo abi Uisrairha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Uyisa nu utesa adzeidzeu ubinkpi Usimiyon aka arherhe ri itsinga. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Mɔcɛ Usimiyon atsuke idorh ru umbɔ na agɔr Umaryamu, uyisunga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃ uwurɛ, unga awuri ikũ igbigba nu isisok anera arhɛrhɛ ri Uisrairha, na awuri iwu utsar ukpuku ukpukpɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Ngge itsú ifɛrhkɔ amɛn anera arhɛrhɛ iwuri idzekangge ra awiya. Ikɛi ungo uwuri igũo ighong ru nyaki ikon iki itar ikpuingo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Umɔ̃ ikɛi utsɛrh uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uhanatu, unapa Ufanuyirha unang Uasher. Aka akɔ̃ɔ̃ akarhãrhã, apfuna asei nggu utsaka imɛka utɔɔva nu utsaka ashia. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Mɔcɛ unga awu utsɛ̃rhãpfu ri imɛka isɔka utɔrɔk nu imɛka inaa. Unga asi isoka ri Iya-Num, nu utsuu na atenum akpurha adɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpem igha ubin na adzowe igɔng nu ifɛn-Num. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Asok abanga ru umbɔ ri ivang hã, unga atar uwɛɛ ru Unum, na arherha arherhe ri itsi ungwɛ̃ hã nggu kishoo abika adzɛu unum ukpuku ufɔrh Urusharhima.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Umbɔ aka amaa abina kishoo aki Íkpem Uteijee, umbɔ apfuri azĩmbɔ utepumbɔ Unazarat ru Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ aseng na aker, na awu nggu itsoi, nu imimutu Unum iwe nggu unga.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ungwɛ̃ hã Uyesu ri Iya-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Ubɛn amɛka utesa nggu uyisa aka isaka azĩ Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Unga aka awu imɛka usɔkdũmɛn umbɔ akũna unga azĩmbɔ irhowa ha ru nyaka agbeyambɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Irhowa ha iki imaa, umbɔ apfuri azĩmbɔ usoi, ungwɛ̃ hã Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ unga ra andzing ru Urusharhima, utesa nu uyisa amɔrmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Akaifɛrhkɔ agɛ awu nggu umbɔ, na azɛ̃rhã amaambɔ unuma unying. Na atirhi irhisa unga ra abimbɔ nu awɛrhambɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Umbɔ aka asi inyãmbɔ unga, umbɔ abvui azĩmbɔ Urusharhima anumbɔ irhisa unga. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Amaambɔ inuma itaar na adɔrha anyã unga ru ufɔm Iya-Num, asei nggu abika amesuwe, anu igosha umbɔ na anu irhusa umbɔ arherhe. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ubɛn unera aka igũ unga akpurha adzeidzeu ri ihwihwɛngnga nu idzipa arherhanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Ivang utesa nggu uyisa aka anyã unga, umbɔ agũ idzeu akarhãrhã. Uyisa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A ungwɛ̃mum, awu use utsu ungo ukorhuwa umɛn rimi? Unyã utɛngo nggu umum iki isham asumɛn ibeea ungo, ikɛi amɛnmɛn aghong akarhãrhã umɛn iki isi inyãmɛn ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi abeea umum? Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi agɛ awu ufang umum iki iwe ri iya Utɛmum?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Bɔr umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi unga aka arherhe nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Mɔcɛ unga adɔsa umbɔ, umbɔ azĩmbɔ Unazarat na agũna umbɔ. Bɔr uyisunga angwɛ̃ arherha ha kishoo ra amɛnnga. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Uyesu aseng nggu itsoi, nu iker iyor, na akpo izama ra anang Unum nu anera.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima <optbreak/> agbishu utsĩndĩã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Umat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Umar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Uyoh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Ri imɛka iyi usɔka ni imɛka itɔ̃ɔ̃ iyi iyɛrhe Ukaisar Utibariya, Ubuntu Ubirhatu awu ugomna Uyahudiya. Uhiridu atɔ̃ itser iyɛrhe Ugarhirhi, ungwɛ̃mbɔ Ufirhibu unga agha iyɛrhe Uiturhiya nu Utarakunita, nu Urhisaniya atɔ̃ itser iyɛrhe Uabirhene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ri ivang hã umbɔ Uhanana nggu Ukayafa aka awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num. Arherhu-Num aba ru Uyohana ungwɛ̃ Uzakariya ra arhum. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Nggee Uyohana aba, asorhuwe ubɔtisima ru Azɛ̃ Urdun na adzowe isarhe iyi idzidzipa iyiki itsũwe arhim. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ru nyaka ngge iki itsɛng ru ubvur uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uishaya igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Urhɛm uner udũwã ra arhum ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Àka agbisha anang Uteijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">àka agbisha atsĩndĩnga uku urhirhiki.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Awuri itsu abĩ atɔke ubɛn izɛ̃rhĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na asim ifũrhã ni igũ asituwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">awuri ivii atsĩndĩ akika anyɔsha awe uku urhirhiki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Na agbisha atsĩndĩ akika arhurhuta ake aghwɔrhe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Nu anera kishoo awuri inyãmbɔ ififɔrh Unum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Uish 40.3-5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Uyohana agɔr anera kishoo aka akɔng aba ru unga asorhuwe umbɔ ubɔtisima agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi angwɛ̃ ibvui! Ungaa adɛyiwa umbi itĩ avɔm Unum aka iba unuma? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Àka atɔ̃ itseryɛ iki idɛyiwe idzidzipambi. Àka aneke igɔr ra amɛnmbi agɛ, &lt;Uibrahim unga awu utɛmɛn.&gt; Ubinkutsu, umum idɛyiwa umbi Unum awea ri ijee unga aka itsu atarh akɛrɛ ake awe awɛkaci ru Uibrahim. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Icɛrɛ anggãi iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge ra anũnang acucii, ubɛn ucucii uku usi ighwɛr umgbɔ ikpũrhã iyiki ize umbɔ awuri igbɛr umgbɔ atsuku urha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Ikikɔnga kishoo irhusa unga igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ude umɛn ikorhi uguse?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Uyohana agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera aka awu ra atorho avaa, unga agaar unying adzowe undɔkanga aka ashia, nu uwuruwi aka awu ru ubingha, akorhe rimi hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Abika ayɛsu ikirbi abĩ, aba umbɔ isorhu ubɔtisima arhusa unga ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uner imesa, umɛn igamɛn ikorhu ugusemɛn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ayɛi agarmbi ubinkpi umbɔ aka atsuka umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Umɔ abi iwa arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn igamɛn ikorhu ugusemɛn?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba avurmbi uhwɛk, niba agbɛrangwĩ atsukukumbi anera, àka ashur nggu ugbɛtambi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Anera aka afosi ibiba Ukiristo, arhusa adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu Uyohana unga Ukiristo ha?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Uyohana agɔr umbɔ kishoo agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isorhuwa umbi ubɔtisima nggu amɛ̃, bɔr uwɔɔ ruwɔ abarɔ, awuri ijee ananga umum. Abadaknga umum isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ inggarhukũ arhisa. Unga awuri isorhuwa umbi ubɔtisima nggu Ipfu Isarsatangge nu urha. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Utak ukpuku utsɛku itsemnga uwu ru uboknga. Awuri itsɛki ishaa itsemnga itɛtɛnangge azĩ atsuku ungbanga, na akpĩĩwe uhwenga ru urhakpi uku usi írhimkpɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Nu irhɛm iyɔɔ irhɛirhɛ Uyohana aka akũ adam anera na adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra anera.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Uyohana atsɛrhu uyɛrhe Uhiridu, ri itsi Uhirudiya utsɛrha ungwɛ̃mbɔ, nu kishoo amɛn akatãrhã akɔɔ Uhiridu aka akorhe. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Uhiridu ashɔi arherhe akɔɔ atoma ikɛi, agbange Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima ru ugborzĩ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubɔtisima Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Umat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Umar 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ivangyɛ anera kishoo aka asorhu ubɔtisima, Uyesu asorhunga iganga. Unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɛn-Num, afã adiki iyanga, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Ipfu Isarsatangge ru nyaku unurhɛu icipuwa ni itsinga, urhɛm udzeka afã ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Ungwɛ̃mum uwuruwi umum iki ibema. Nggu ungo umum igũibɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atoku Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Umat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka ayoka imɛka isɔka itaar, unga aka atirhi itsernga. Anera akaifɛrhkɔ unga awu ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf ungwɛ̃ Uherhi,<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Uherhi ungwɛ̃ Umatat, Umatat ungwɛ̃ Urhawi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Urhawi ungwɛ̃ Umarhki, Umarhki ungwɛ̃ Uyanna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Uyanna ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Uyusuf ungwɛ̃ Umatatiya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Umatatiya ungwɛ̃ Uamos, Uamos ungwɛ̃ Unahum,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Unahum ungwɛ̃ Uhasrhi, Uhasrhi ungwɛ̃ Unajaya,<verse eid="LUK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Unajaya ungwɛ̃ Umaata, Umaata ungwɛ̃ Umatatiya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Umatatiya ungwɛ̃ Ushimeya, Ushimeya ungwɛ̃ Ujosek,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Ujosek ungwɛ̃ Ujoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Ujoda ungwɛ̃ Ujowanan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Ujowanan ungwɛ̃ Uresa, Uresa ungwɛ̃ Uzerubaberh,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Uzerubaberh ungwɛ̃ Usheyarhtiyerh, Usheyarhtiyerh ungwɛ̃ Uniri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Uniri ungwɛ̃ Umarhki, Umarhki ungwɛ̃ Uaddi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Uaddi ungwɛ̃ Ukosama, Ukosama ungwɛ̃ Uerhmadama,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Uerhmadama ungwɛ̃ Uer, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Uer ungwɛ̃ Ujoshuwa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Ujoshuwa ungwɛ̃ Uerhiyeza, Uerhiyeza ungwɛ̃ Ujorima,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Ujorima ungwɛ̃ Umatat, Umatat ungwɛ̃ Urhawi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Urhawi ungwɛ̃ Usiman, Usiman ungwɛ̃ Uyahuda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Uyahuda ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf, Uyusuf ungwɛ̃ Uyonam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Uyonam ungwɛ̃ Uerhiyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Uerhiyakim ungwɛ̃ Umerheya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Umerheya ungwɛ̃ Umena, Umena ungwɛ̃ Umattata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Umattata ungwɛ̃ Unatan, Unatan ungwɛ̃ Udauda,<verse eid="LUK 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Udauda ungwɛ̃ Ujesse, Ujesse ungwɛ̃ Uobida,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Uobida ungwɛ̃ Ubo'aza, Ubo'aza ungwɛ̃ Usarhmon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Usarhmon ungwɛ̃ Unashon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Unashon ungwɛ̃ Uamminadab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Uamminadab ungwɛ̃ Uaram, Uaram ungwɛ̃ Uhezuron,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Uhezuron ungwɛ̃ Ufereza, Ufereza ungwɛ̃ Uyahuda,<verse eid="LUK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Uyahuda ungwɛ̃ Uyakubu, Uyakubu ungwɛ̃ Uishaku,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Uishaku ungwɛ̃ Uibrahim, Uibrahim ungwɛ̃ Utera,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Utera ungwɛ̃ Unahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Unahor ungwɛ̃ Userug,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Userug ungwɛ̃ Ureyu, Ureyu ungwɛ̃ Uferheg,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Uferheg ungwɛ̃ Ueber, Ueber ungwɛ̃ Usherha,<verse eid="LUK 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Usherha ungwɛ̃ Ukenan, Ukenan ungwɛ̃ Uarfakshad,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Uarfakshad ungwɛ̃ Ushem, Ushem ungwɛ̃ Unuhu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Unuhu ungwɛ̃ Urhamek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Urhamek ungwɛ̃ Umetuserha,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Umetuserha ungwɛ̃ Uenɔk, Uenɔk ungwɛ̃ Uyared,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Uyared ungwɛ̃ Umaharharherh, Umaharharherh ungwɛ̃ Ukenan,<verse eid="LUK 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Ukenan ungwɛ̃ Uenosh, Uenosh ungwɛ̃ Usɛt,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Usɛt ungwɛ̃ Uadamu, Uadamu ungwɛ̃ Unum.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Aviru Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Umat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Umar 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Uyesu awu nggu Ipfu-Num, adzeku Azɛ̃ Urdun, Ipfu ikũna unga izĩngge ra arhum. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Umɔ unga amaa inuma isɔka inaa Undenggũ adeya unga. Ri inum hã unga asi ighaa ubingha. Inum hã iki imaa, imerh ifɛr unga.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Undenggũ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba uwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum, ugɔr utarh ukpirɛ ukpɔ uwu ubingha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;Asi iwea ubingha ukpekũ itsu unera abɛk.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Iva 8.3</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Undenggũ akũna unga afũã ra anang afafã na adɛyiwe unga kanying iyɛrhu upfung kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwuri idzaamum ungo ijee ra abĩã kishoo ni idzaa ungo ikpikpoingge, ubinkutsu aka adzaa ru umum, nu umum idɛ̃ɛ̃ indzowukũ ubɛn unera umum iki ibee. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Nggee ungo uba udzaango umum igɔng, ukpɔ uwuri iwu ukpungo kishoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔrngge ugɛ, &lt;Udzowe igɔng ru Uteijee Unumngo nu uwu ugãrhãnga ukpekũ.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Iva 6.13</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Undenggũ akũna unga azĩã Urusharhima, na atsu unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra afafã ni itsi uvi Iya-Num, na agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba uwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum, upur ucipa ru nggɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>ubinkutsu itsɛng igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Unga awuri itsu ípfu itsernga ngge ingwɛ̃dzɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">ni ikaa ungo,<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>ngge iwuri ikpɔm ungo ra afafã ra abokngge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">utsur ungo ukwɛrɔ undaidakngo nu utarh.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Amb 91.11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on the roof of the Temple" file="DN00405b.tif" size="col" loc="4.11" copy="Dn" ref="4.9">Uyesu nú itsi uvi Iya-Num</figure><verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr ugɛ, &lt;Ungo niba ivirungo Uteijee Unumngo.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Iva 6.16</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Ivangyɛ Undenggũ aka amaa ideya unga kishoo, unga nekuka unga utsɛku ivang iyikise.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpɛ̃mbɔ Uyesu ru Unazarat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Umat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Umar 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu abvui azĩã abĩ Ugarhirhi ri ijee Ipfu-Num, isarhe ri itsinga itɛ̃rhã imaangge abĩã kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Unga amesuwe ra abã ifɛn-Nummbɔ, nu ubɛn unera akpoi unga.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Unga azĩã Unazarat, ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka akpɔm unga, ru unum ukpuku uwosha unga azĩ atsĩã ru ubã ifɛn-Num, ru nyaka unga aka abayi. Unga asok adɛ̃ɛ̃ abee ivarhu uvarhe. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Umbɔ adzowe ubvur uku ufeta uwu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uishaya, unga aka ayanga, unga akpo anangkɛ iki itsɛng igɛ,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>&lt;&lt;Ipfu Uteijee iwu nggu umum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ubinkutsu unga aka adzukuwa umum atsei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">akika adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra atsũwã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Unga aka adena umum idũwã itsũwe abirabɛ umbɔ aka abow ru ugborzĩ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ni iyanguwe asu abi ibvuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ni ifɔne abika ahwa ayetnum.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Izĩ idũwã imɛk umatu Uteijee.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Uish 61.1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Mɔcɛ unga afetu ubvura, adzowuka umgbɔ ru uner itsera ru ubã ifɛn-Num hã na aseisa. Asumbɔ kishoo ru ubã ifɛn-Num hã awing arhi unga. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Nu unga atirhi agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Irherɛ Arherhu-Num akɛrɛ atsuafɛrke ri igigũmbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Kishoo arherhe iki ize ri itsinga na adzeidzeu irhɛm iyiki ize iyiriyɛ iki idzeka ra angwĩnga. Umbɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea ungwɛ̃ Uyusuf nuwi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idzidzɛrhe umbi awuri idzaambi umum unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;Unera agɔu ukerhuwe itsikamngo! Umbi ikɛi awuri igɔrmbi umum ugɛ, ukorhe nggimi ru utepungo ubinkpi umɛn iki igũ ugɛ ungo ukorhe ru Ukafanahum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>&lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num asi isaka ikpoa imor ru utepunga. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Umum isɔma umbi idzidzɛrhe, atsɛ̃rhãpfu awu arhɛrhɛ ru Uisrairha ri ivang uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uirhiya, inai iki isi idoingge imɛka itaar nu utenga rimɔ̃ɔ̃ imerh akarhãrhã imaangge abĩã. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Rimi hã asi idene Uirhiya azĩã ru unyinga umbɔ na adene unga azĩ ru utsɛ̃rhãpfu ru Uzarefat ra abĩ Usidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Ikɛi ru Uisrairha abi ingbim awu arhɛrhɛ ri ivang uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uerhisha, rimi hã unera asi ikerhunga, Una'aman ukpekũ, utsa Usuriya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Anera kishoo ru abã ifɛn-Num hã, amɛnmbɔ asoke umbɔ aka agũ rimi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Umbɔ asok agbĩrhã unga adzek ru utepa, na akũna unga azĩmbɔ ni ishi igũa, ra anangkɛ utepa uku uwe, abee iyira unga agɔ̃rhã. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Bɔr unga azɛ̃rhã atɔng ra ateumbɔ azĩã udĩnga.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu awayiwe ipfu iyiki ibewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Umar 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Mɔcɛ, unga azĩã Ukafanahum ru uteu ukpɔɔ ra abĩ Ugarhirhi, ru unum ukpuku uwosha amesuwe anera. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Umbɔ adzeidzeu nggu imesanga ubinkutsu isarhanga iwu nggu ijee.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Ru abã ifɛn-Num hã uner uwɔɔ awe ru ipfu iyiki ibewe. Unga atsarhi irhaknga ikerketangge atsu ivum agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>&lt;&lt;Iyee! Ungo ubee use nggu umɛn Uyesu uner Unazarat? Ungo uba itsĩme umɛn? Umum ihwɛng ungo uwu usarkasar uwu Unum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Uyesu atsɛrha ngge agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unukutata! Upfudzeka ru unga!&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ ipfu iyiki ibewe ha ashupa unga atar ra ateumbɔ kishoo, ni inekungge unga, isi inayikungge unga.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Anera kishoo adzeidzeu na agɔr adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Arherhakɛ awu ikpũ akasong? Nggu iker nu ijee unga atsu ípfu iyiki ibewe ngge ipfudzeka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Isarhe ri itsinga itɛ̃rhã imaangge ikãwã anang hã.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhɛrhɛ anera Uyesu aka akerhuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Umat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Umar 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Uyesu asoku ubã ifɛn-Num hã azĩã ri iya Usiman. Mɔcɛ uyisa utsɛrha Usiman iyora imani akarhãrhã, umbɔ arhusu Uyesu ama ayike unga. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Nggee unga agbapfu akhapa ru unga na atsɛrhi imani anii iyor, ngge idzengge ru unga. Unga asok kanying azĩã agashuka umbɔ amɛ̃ aka ahwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Ivang urhɛɛ uku uwe, anera akũ abi ikpũ irhãrhã aba ru Uyesu atsorha aboknga, anyinganying, akerhuwe umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ikɛi ípfu iyiki ibewe ha adzeka ra anera arhɛrhɛ itsu ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum!&gt;&gt; Bɔr unga atsɛrha ngge, unga asi ibeenga ineke ngge idzipa arherhe, ubinkutsu ngge ihwɛngngge unga aka awu Ukiristo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Ukpe uku usar, Uyesu adzek azĩã anangkɛ aka awu uku utata. Anera anu ibeea unga, umbɔ aka anyã unga, umbɔ abee iden unga utsur unga nekuka umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Bɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ufang umum idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Iyɛrhe Unum ri iteu iyɔɔ ikɛi, ngge itsu umbɔ adena umum ĩba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Nu unga adɛ̃ɛ̃nga idzowe isarhe ra abã ifɛn-Num Uyahudiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyisa angwɛ̃ imesa abi inggbaashia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Umat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Umar 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Unuma nukpɔ Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ ni ifɛn ukau Ujanisarat, anera arhɛrhɛ afĩĩ adzipa unga na akpeto ani igosha Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Unga anyã akhukhɔɔ avaa aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ri ifɛn amɛ̃, abi udɛm aka aden, na adɛ̃ɛ̃ isorh igbermbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Unga atsĩ ru ukhukhɔɔ uwu Usiman, na ashɔ̃rhã unga agɔpa atsĩ ukunjiir ru ukau ha. Umɔ unga asei nu ukhukhɔɔ ha na amesuwe anera.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Unga aka amaa arherhe, unga agɔr Usiman, agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka atsĩ ra anang aka aghora na atsu igbermbi adzui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Usiman agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, umɛn imaa utsuu itɛ̃wã, isi idzurmɛn ubin. Bɔr ri igigɔrngo, umum itsukũ igber ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Umbɔ aka atsu igber ha, umbɔ adzui abɛrh arhɛrhɛ ake atsu igbermbɔ itirhi ipupa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Umbɔ akorhuwe utsara ra adɔkambɔ ru ukhukhɔɔmbɔ aba ayike umbɔ. Umbɔ aka aba atsu abɛrh ake atɔk akhukhɔɔmbɔ, akhukhɔɔ ha akpurha abee ididɛk.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Usiman Ubitru aka anyã rimi, unga agba ra atsurhuk Uyesu na agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ugɔpa ru umum, umum iwu uner arhim!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ubinkutsu unga nggu abirabɛ aka awu nggu unga kishoo adzeidzeu ra arhɛrha abɛrh ha umbɔ aka adzui. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Awu umbɔ Uyaku nggu Uyohana, angwɛ̃ Uzabadi, awɛrhi itser Usiman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr Usiman, agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ugũa iwei, utirhi icɛrɛ ungo uwuri idzui anera.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Nggee umbɔ ayii akhukhɔɔmbɔ adzeka nu ubang ukau ha. Umbɔ aneke abinmbɔ kishoo na adɔsa unga.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uner irhãrhĩ ingbim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Umat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Umar 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Ivang hã niyɔ Uyesu awu ru uteu ukpɔɔ, uner uwɔɔ aba awuri irhãrhĩ ingbim. Unga aka anyã Uyesu, unga agba ra asunga na ashɔ̃rhã unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo uba ubemungo, ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃ ukerhuwango umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Uyesu aberu uboknga abangu uner irhãrhĩ ingbim hã, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ĩbeemum, ukerhe!&gt;&gt; Kanying ingbimnga ikerhungge.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu avange unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba udɛyikɔ unera, bɔr uzĩ udɛyiwe itsingo ra abika adzowe idɛm-Num, nu udzowe idɛm-Num iyiki ikikerhe Umusa aka atsuka umbi, ngge iwu utsara ra anera ugɛ ungo uku ukerhungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Bɔr rimi hã isarhanga itɛ̃rhã imaangge inanga, ngge itsú anera arhɛrhɛ aba igũ unga na akpo ikikerhe ri irhãrhãmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Bɔr Uyesu aka isaka adzek ikiyikanga anu ifɛn-Num ra arhum.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu akerhuwe irhãrhĩ ishai iyor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Umat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Umar 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Unuma nukpɔ Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ imesuwe anera, abi Ufarisi nggu abika amesi Íkpem Umusa, adzek kishoo ri iteu iyiki ici iki iwe ru Ugarhirhi nu Uyahudiya nu Urusharhima, asei umɔ. Ijee iyi Uteijee iwu nggu unga iyiki ikerhuwe abi irhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Mɔcɛ abɔɔ atsã uner irhãrhĩ ishai iyor nu ufar abee ikũna unga atsĩ ri iya azĩ angwɛ̃we unga ra asu Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka asi ikpombɔ anang aka atsĩã, ubinkutsu anera arhɛmbɔ, umbɔ afũ ni itsi uvi ati uvi ha na acipuwe unga nu ufarnga ra asu Uyesu ra ateu anera.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Ivang Uyesu aka anyã imangmangmbɔ, unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A uwee, aka atsũwãmbɔ arhimngo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Abi Ufarisi na abika amesuwe Ikpem atirhi ikaifɛrhkɔ ra amɛnmbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungaa nuwi arhenu Unum! Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsũwe arhim uba asi iwea Unum ikiyikanga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Uyesu aka ahwɛnga ifɛrhkɔmbɔ, unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi anu ikaifɛrhkɔ rimi ra amɛnmbi? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Akasong asi ighongke irherhe, umum iki igɔr, &lt;Àka atsũwãmbɔ arhimngo,&gt; use igɔr igɛ, &lt;Usiso uzɛ̃rhũ uzɛ̃rhã?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Bɔr ngge itsú umbi ahwɛng ugɛ Ungwɛ̃-Ner awea ri ijee iyiki itsũwe arhim ru upfung.&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ unga agɔr uner ishai iyor ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum igɔr ungo, usisok, ufetu ufarngo uzĩ ri iya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Kanying utsa ha abera asok ra asumbɔ, afetu ufarnga, akai izĩ ri iya na akpoi Unum. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ubɛn unera adzeidzeu na akpoi Unum. Umbɔ awe nggu iwei na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn inyãmɛn abin idzeu irherɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ayisu Urhawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Umat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Umar 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Akɛrɛ ha aka amaa, Uyesu adzek anyã uner uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ itsoka igburh Urhawi asei ra anang itsernga. Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɔsa umum!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Urhawi asok nekuka ubɛn ubin na adɔsa unga.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Mɔcɛ Urhawi azɛke Uyesu irhowa iyiki igɔng ri iyanga, arhɛrhɛ abika ayɛsu ikirbi abĩ nu abɔɔ atɔk agha nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Bɔr abi Ufarisi nu abika amesuwe Ikpem Umusa aka awu ru ukpui agbeyambɔ akũ arherhe aba ra angwɛ̃ imesa Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi agha na ahwa nggu abika ayɛsu ikirbi abĩ nu abi arhim?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea abika aker abee uner agɔu, bɔr abi irhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Umum isi ĩbamum iyisa abika arhurhika, bɔr umum ĩba iyisa abi arhim umbɔ adzipa ra arhimmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhusu Uyesu arherhi <optbreak/> ikpem igha ubin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Umat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Umar 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Angwɛ̃ imesu Uyohana aka isaka akpemmbɔ igha ubin na afɛnmbɔ Unum, nu angwɛ̃ imesa abi Ufarisi, bɔr abingo agha na ahwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu awɛrhu uner utsɛrh uwuku ufa akpemmbɔ igha ubinghanga na awu nggu umbɔ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ awuri inyangukumbɔ uner utsɛrh uwuku ufa ru umbɔ, ivang ha niyɔ umbɔ aka ikpem igha ubin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Ikɛi asɔme umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera asi ízharha atorho aka afa akũ abipunga nu atorho akagbe. Unga aba akorhunga rimi, unga adakuwe atorho aka afa ha, nu atorho aka afa ha asi íweke ru nyaku akika akagbe ha. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Asi ítsumbɔ amɛ̃ inebi aka afa ru ubãĩ uwuku ugbe. Ungo uba utsukɔ, ubãĩ uwuku ugbe ha ukpurhu uyar, amɛ̃ inebi ha akpurha adzɛ̃rhã ra abĩ, ubãĩ hã uwuri iwu ibɛm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ambãĩ aki isaka akũ abvur ijuɛ asɔr ake. Nggu adaka nu urhɔka umbɔ aka ayanga na abope. Ambãĩ aka afa aki isaka ayanga ru ighwighwii amɛ̃ inebi ha. Ambãĩ aka agbe aka ayanguke asi íbvui ayanguke ikɛi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Bɔr, awu ufang umbɔ atsu amɛ̃ inebi aka afa ra ambãĩ aka afa! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Unera asi íbemunga ihwa amɛ̃ inebi aka afa, unga aba aka ahwaa akagbe. Awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;Akagbe azeke aka afa.&gt; &gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Wine Skins" file="lb00145b.tif" size="col" loc="5.39" copy="Louise Bass" ref="5.39">Ubãĩ</figure><verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Uteijee unum ukpuku uwosha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Umat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Umar 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Unum ukpuku uwosha ukpɔɔ Uyesu azɛ̃rhã atɔng ri icang arhkama, angwɛ̃ imesanga agbiu azang arhkama adzuka ra abokmbɔ, na atãi ishaanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Abi Ufarisi abɔɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi azharhuwe Ikpem unum ukpuku uwosha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi anasi ivarhumbi ubin Udauda aka akorhe ri ivangyɛ unga aka agũ imerh nggu abi uzãrhãnga? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Unga atsĩ ru Utsurha-Num, azĩ anyangu ubingha umbɔ anɛmuwe ru Unum, adiki ighigha nggu abi uzɛ̃rhãnga. Ikpem iki igɔr igɛ abika adzowe idɛm-Num ukpekũ umbɔ igha ubingha ha.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arherhakɛ ri itsi Udauda akpo ake ru ubvur </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Usm 21.1-6</ref></char>. Akorhuke nu Udauda adɔrha atsim iyɛrhe. Ri ikpem abi Uyahuda, Udauda azharhuwe ake ru unum ukpuku uwosha.</note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃-Ner unga awu Uteijee unum ukpuku uwosha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uner ubok ukpuku ushai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Umat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Umar 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ru unum ukpuku uwosha ukpɔɔ unga atsĩ ru abã ifɛn-Num amesuwe anera, uner uwɔɔ umɔ ubok ughanga ushushai. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Abi Ufarisi nu abika amesuwe Ikpem arhi ubin umbɔ aka ikũ atsu uvau ru Uyesu. Nggee umbɔ awing asumbɔ arhi unga use unga awuri ikerhuka ru unum ukpuku uwosha. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Bɔr Uyesu ahwɛnga ifɛrhkɔmbɔ, umɔ unga agɔr uner uwuku ushai ubok ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usisok uba udidɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asumɛn kishoo.&gt;&gt; Utsa ha asok aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum irhusa umbi, Ikpem iwu use ru unum ukpuku uwosha? Akorhi iyiki ize use iyiki ibewe? Afɔrhe urhɛ use atsĩme umgbɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Unga arhi adzipa umbɔ kishoo, na agɔr uner ushai ubok ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unɛmu ubokngo udzek!&gt;&gt; Unga ayɛrhu uboknga, ukpu udiki ikikerhe kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu umbɔ asoyi avɔm akarhãrhã na atirhi arherhe nggu adɔkambɔ ubin umbɔ aka ikorhuwe Uyesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu atsũ abi itsernga usɔkdũmɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Umat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Umar 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Unum ukpɔɔ ri inum hã Uyesu azĩ afũã igũ azĩ ifɛn-Num, amaa utsuu unum hã kishoo anu ifɛn-Num. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Ivangyɛ ukpe uku usar unga ayisa angwɛ̃ imesanga aba ru unga, umɔ unga atsũ usɔkdũmɛn, na ayisa umbɔ abi itsernga. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Usiman uwu ha unga aka atar unga agburh Ubitru, nu ungwɛ̃mbɔ Uandarawu, nu Uyaku, nu Uyohana, nu Ufirhibu, nu Ubatorhomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>nu Umatiyu, nu Utoma, nu Uyaku ungwɛ̃ Uharhfa, nu Usiman umbɔ iki iyisa Uzarhoti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>nu Uyahuda ungwɛ̃ Uyaku, nu Uyahuda Uiskariyoti uwuku ugha adak.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igũibɛn nggu atorh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Umat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Unga acipuwa nggu umbɔ azĩ adɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ ri idɛɛ iyɔɔ. Arhɛrha angwɛ̃ imesanga akɔng umɔ, nu arhɛrha anera aka adzeka abĩ Uyahudiya nu Urusharhima, nu abɔɔ aka adzeku ubang azɛ̃ Utaya nu Usidon. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Umbɔ aka aba igosha unga, unga akerhuwe irhãrhãmbɔ. Abika agũ uver nggu ípfu iyiki ibewe ikɛi akerhumbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Anera kishoo akɔka abee ibanga unga, ubinkutsu unga akerhuwe umbɔ kishoo nggu nggaa ijeenga.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Unga arhi angwɛ̃ imesanga, na agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Idorh iwu iyimbi aka awu atsũwã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ubinkutsu Iyɛrhe Unum iwu iyimbi.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Idorh iwu iyimbi abika agũ imerh icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">umbi awuri ishuurmbi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Idorh iwu iyimbi abika adɔng icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">umbi awuri inyĩrhũmbi unyĩrhã.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Idorh iwu iyimbi anera iki ikpɛ̃na umbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">na awayiwe umbi na arhena umbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">na agũ ashĩ umbi ugɛɛ umbi awu abi amɛn aka abewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ni itsi umbi aka adɔsu Uyesu Ungwɛ̃-Ner.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>&lt;&lt;Àka agɔm ru unum hã na atengasha nggu anggɔm, ubinkutsu ugbɛtambi uwu ugɔgɔngakpɔ ra afã. Rimi hã ateimbɔ aka akorhuwe abika asɔm Arherhu-Num.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr atorhmbi abika awu ru ubin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">umbi aka ayɛimbi ififitambi.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Atorhmbi abika awu ra ashur icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ubinkutsu umbi awuri igbambi imerh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Atorhmbi abika anyĩrhũ unyĩrhã icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ubinkutsu umbi awuri idɔngmbi na aciu.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Atorhmbi ivang anera kishoo iki irherhe iyiki ize ru atsimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">ubinkutsu atokambɔ aka isaka akorhe rimi nggu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibema igamtsak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Umat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umum idɛyiwa umbi abika agũna umum, àka abema anggamtsakmbi, àka akorhuwe iki ize ru abika akpɛ̃na umbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Àka atsuke idorh ra abika arhena umbi, àka afɛne-Num ra abika ayɔm umbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Unera aba akwɛra ungo nu utamngo, udzipuwe utam ukpu uvaa ikɛi. Unera aba avura atorhango akagɔng, niba ukɛnɔ unga atorha akɔɔ akaci. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Udzowe ubɛn unera aka afɛnu ubinngo, unera aba avura ubinngo, niba ubvui uyɛsɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Ukorhuwe anera ubinkpi ungo uku ubee umbɔ akorhuwa ungo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>&lt;&lt;Umbi aba abema abika abema umbi ukpekũ, umbi awu ru use ugbɛtunga? Abi arhim aka isaka abema abika abema umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Umbi aba akorhi iyiki ize nggu abika akorhuwa umbi iyiki ize, umbi awu ru use ugbɛtunga? Uko abi arhim aka isaka akorhe rimi hã. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Umbi aba adzowe ikɔw ra abirabɛ umbi aka afosa ugɛ adɛ̃ɛ̃ afaimbɔ, ugbɛtɛ umbi uwu use? Abi arhim aka isaka adzowukumbɔ ikɔw ra abi arhim na ayɛi uku kpengkpeng. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Bɔr àka abema anggamtsakmbi, àka akorhe iyiki ize ru umbɔ, àka adzowe umbɔ ikɔw niba arhimbi usu ififai. Mɔcɛ ugbɛtambi uwu ugɔgɔng, umbi awuri iwe angwɛ̃ Nggaa Uwuku Ugɔng, ubinkutsu unga aka amutuka abika akpɛ̃ itar uwɛɛ nu abi amɛn aka abewe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Àka awu abika agũ atorh, ru nyaka Utɛmbi ra afã aka awu uwuku ugũ atorh.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itsu uvau ra abɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Umat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>&lt;&lt;Niba atsumbi uvau ra anera, asi ítsukambɔ umbi uvau. Niba atsumbi ufai, asi ítsukambɔ umbi ufai. Àka atsũwe anera, awuri itsũwãmbɔ umbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Àka adzowe, awuri idzaambɔ umbi. Ugbiu utsutɔk, nu ujer, nu uzusa, nu utɔk, nu ubɔr ugba. Ugbiuwi umbi aka akũ amei, awuri ikũ ugbiu ha amei adzaa umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Uyesu adɛyiwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ibvuta adɛ̃ɛ̃ adarha uner ibvuta? Umbɔ ikivarhambɔ asi ígbambɔ ru ughwee? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Ungwɛ̃ imesa asi inangnga uner uwuku umesuwe unga, bɔr ubɛn unera umbɔ aka amesuwe unga abina kishoo, awuri iwea ru nyaku uner uwuku umesuwe unga.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>&lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo urhi umbumbin ru usu undɔkango, nu usi inyãɔ̃ ungbũngkũ uku uwe ru usungo? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ungo ukorhu uguse nu ugɔr undɔkango ugɛ, &lt;A ungwɛ̃mɛn, umum itsũwã umbumbinwi ru usungo,&gt; ri ivangyɛ ungo uku usi idɛ̃ɛ̃ unyãɔ ungbũngkũ ru usu ukpungo? Ungo uner ukpukpeta, utirhu utsũwe ugbũkũ uwɔ ra asungo, nu urhi utai nu utsũwe umbumbin ru usu undɔkango.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ucucii nu ikpũrhãngge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Umat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>&lt;&lt;Ucucii uwuku uze usi íghwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã iyiki ibewe, nu ucucii uwuku ubewe usi íghwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã iyiki ize. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Ahwɛng ubɛn ucucii ri ikpũrhãngge. Asi íkɔɔrmbɔ ikpũrhũ uvorhvo ru ididɔk, use ikpũrhĩ ihwerhe ru ididɔk. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Uner uwuku uze, aka isaka akũwã abin aka aze, akirakɛ aka awe ra amɛnnga. Uner uwuku ubewe, aka isaka akũwã abin aka abewe, akirakɛ aka awu ra amɛnnga. Nggee, abinkɛ aka atɔk ra amɛn unera, ake angwĩnga iki irherhe.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idzin uner itsoi nu uguge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Umat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>&lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi ayisa umum, &lt;A Uteijee, a Uteijee,&gt; na asi ikorhumbi ubinkpi umum iki irherhe? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Umum iwuri idɛyiwamum umbi arherhe ri itsi uwuku uba ru umum na agũ irhɛm arherhamum na atɔ̃ itser nggu ake. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Unga awu ru nyaku uner idzin iya, unga asim abĩ aghoghotake, na atsu atarh idzin ni ifa. Ivangyɛ amɛ̃ aka adzek aba, ayiri ubandzina ukpɔ usi izusukpɔ, ubinkutsu ubandzin iya ha udɛ̃ɛ̃ ni ifa. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Bɔr uwuku ugũ arherhamum na asi itɔ̃ itser nggu ake, awu ru nyaku uner idzin aka adzin iya nu uzuzeu. Amɛ̃ aka adzek aba ayiri iya ha ike igba, ni ida kishoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Imangmang unggba iwa abi iwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Umat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Ivang Uyesu aka amaa arherhe kishoo ri igigũ anera, unga atsĩã Ukafanahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Nggɔɔ ha ugãrhã unggba iwa abi iwa, uwuruwi uteiyanga aka abema akarhãrhã, aghonga unga akpurha abɔra akpe. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Unggba iwa abi iwa ha agũ isarhe Uyesu na adene akakũ abi Uyahuda azĩmbɔ ru unga, ashɔ̃rhũ Uyesu amaa aba akerhuwe ugãrhãnga. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka aba ru Uyesu, umbɔ ashɔ̃rhã unga akarhãrhã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imɛ̃ngge ungo ukerhuwe ugãrhã utsa ha, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>ubinkutsu abema abĩmɛn. Unga adzin abã ifɛn-Nummɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Nggee Uyesu asok azĩã nggu umbɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Unga aka ayoki iya, uteiya abi iwa ha adene awɛrhanga umbɔ azĩ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, niba uhwaɔ uver, umum isi imɛ̃mum ungo iki iba ri iyamum. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ngge itsu umum inyã umum ibɔtũci umum iki inba ru ungo. Bɔr urherhu urhɛm, nu ugãrhãmum awuri ikerhunga. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Umum iwe ru ubok ijee, abi iwa abɔɔ awu ru ubokmum. Igɔr uwɛrɛ inggɛ, &lt;Uzĩ,&gt; unga azĩã, nu uwɔrɔ inggɛ, &lt;Uba,&gt; unga abanga. Umum iba igɔr ugãrhãmum inggɛ, &lt;Ukorhe riminɛ,&gt; unga akorhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Uyesu aka agũ rimi, unga adzeidzeu ru unga. Na adzipa udika anera aka adɔsa unga, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umum ina isi ikpomum uner imangmang akarhãrhã ru Uisrairha rimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Mɔcɛ, aner ha umbɔ aka adene umbɔ itser ha, abvui atsĩwã ri iya akpo ugãrhã ha aka akerhunga.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu azituwe ungwɛ̃ utsɛ̃rhãpfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Asi idãrhũmbɔ, nu Uyesu azĩã uteu ukpɔɔ ugburh Unayin, angwɛ̃ imesanga nu anera arhɛrhɛ azĩmbɔ nggu unga. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Unga aka ayoka ra angwĩ uteu ha, anyã ukom umbɔ aka atsã, ukom hã uwu unanyĩ ungwɛ̃ utsɛrh uwɔɔ. Anera arhɛrhɛ adzeku utepa adɔsu utsɛ̃rhãpfu ha. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Ivangyɛ Uteijee aka anyã utsɛrh ha, atorh afɛr unga. Unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba uciupɔ akpe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Unga agɔpa azĩ abangu ukom hã, abika atsã ukom hã adɛ̃ɛ̃ uku udzik. Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A ungwɛ̃dzɛm, umum ĩgɔr ungo ugɛ, usisok!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Ukom hã uso asei isei nu utirha arherhe. Uyesu adzowuka unga ru uyisunga.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Kishoo agũ iwei, na akpoi Unum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num ukugɔng aka abanga ru umɛn, Unum aba iyike anernga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Isarhe iyɛrɛ ri itsi Uyesu itɛ̃rhã imaangge abĩ abi Uyahudiya nu ikãwãngge.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nu Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Umat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Angwɛ̃ imesu Uyohana adɛyiwe unga ifɛrhɛ ha kishoo. Uyohana ayisa angwɛ̃ imesanga avaa, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>adene umbɔ azĩ arhusu Uteijee, agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungo uwu uwuku ububa ha, use umɛn ifosu uwukuse?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Ivangyɛ aner ha aka azĩ atsĩ ru Uyesu, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima unga adena umɛn ĩba irhusa ungo ĩgɛ, &lt;Awu ungo uwu uwuku ububa ha, use umɛn ifosu uwukuse?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Ri ivang hã Uyesu akerhuwe arhɛrha anera abika awe ru uver ri irhãrhã, nu ípfu iyiki ibewe, na ayanguwe asu abi ibvuta arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Nggee unga adzipa agɔr abika akũ itser ha aba agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka abvui azĩ adɛyiwe Uyohana ubinkpi umbi aka anyã na agũ. Abi ibvuta anyãmbɔ, akatarhu azɛ̃rhũmbɔ uzɛ̃rhã, abi ingbim akerhumbɔ, abi igbau agũmbɔ, ikom isongge nggu urhɛ, adzowukumbɔ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra atsũwã. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Unum awuri idzowuka idorh ru unerwi aka asi icicanga imangmangnga ri itsimum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Angwɛ̃ itser Uyohana aka azĩmbɔ, Uyesu atirha arherhe nggu ikikɔnga ri itsi Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi azĩ izɛrhu use ra arhum? Ubĩĩ uku uder ugba iki ifɛu? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ngge iba isi iwengge rimi, ude umbi azĩ izɛrhu use? Umbi azĩ izɛrhe unera aka atsim atorho imang? Ishingge rimi, abika igũibɛn na atsim atorho imang, aka isaka akpombɔ ra adzepurhe iyɛrhe ru utepa. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Bɔr umbi adzek azĩ izɛrhu use? Uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num? Ĩĩ, umum idɛyiwa umbi, ananga uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Unga hã uwi umbɔ aka atsɛng ra Arherhu-Num ri itsinga agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;&lt; &lt;Umum iwuri idene ungwɛ̃ itsermum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">agbaashia ru ungo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">Unga awuri igbishuwa atsĩndĩngo.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Umrh 3.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, abirabɛ akatsɛrh aka amar kishoo, unera asi igɔnga Uyohana. Rimi hã, uwuku ucia ri Iyɛrhe Unum agɔnga unga Uyohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Anera kishoo, nu abika ayɛsu ikirbi abĩ aka agũ irhɛm Uyesu, umbɔ abema ugɛ utsĩndĩ Unum uwu uku uzea, ubinkutsu Uyohana aka akorhuka umbɔ ubɔtisima. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Bɔr abi Ufarisi nu abika amesuwe Íkpem Umusa akpɛ̃mbɔ ubinkpi Unum aka abee ikorhuwe umbɔ, ubinkutsu Uyohana anasi ikorhuka umbɔ ubɔtisima.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>&lt;&lt;Umum ikpangu aner udan ukpirɛ nggu use? Umbɔ awu ru nyaku use? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Awu ru nyaka awɛkaci aki iseyi ra anang izɛɛ na ayisa adɔkambɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt; &lt;Umɛn ibar aserhuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">umbi akpɛ̃mbi azera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Umɛn itsũ ubom akpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">umbi asi iciumbi akpe.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima aka aba, asi itãinga uborodi, asi ihwaa adɛ, umbi agɔra agɛ, &lt;Awu ri ipfu iyiki ibewe.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Nggayɛ Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka aba agha na ahwa, umbi agɛ, &lt;Unyã uner uwuku ubvun igha abin nu ufĩrhã afĩrhã, uwɛrhɛ abika ayɛi ikirbi abĩ, na abi arhim.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Bɔr awu itser unera iwuri idɛyiwe ugɛ unga awea ri itsoi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsɛrh arhim adzukuwe atsei <optbreak/> nú Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Utsa Ufarisi uwɔɔ ayisu Uyesu igha ubingha, Uyesu atsĩ ri iya utsa ha azĩ asei ra anang ubingha. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Utsɛrh uwɔɔ ru uteu ha awu ra arhim. Ivangyɛ unga aka agũ ugɛ Uyesu awe ri igha ubingha ri iya utsa Ufarisi ha, unga azĩ nggu udzoma atsei isung imang akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ udiku undzingnga, udika adaknga, aciu awua anyĩ ra adaknga, na akũ igwar itsinga adzukuwe, na atar uwɛɛ, na atsuke atsei isung hã nu ake.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Ivang utsa Ufarisi uwuku uyisa unga, aka anyã rimi, unga agɔr ra amɛnnga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uda utsak uwurɛ awu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num, unga awuri ihwɛngnga ungamɔ ani ibasa abok ru unga, ikpũ utsɛrh ha aka awe, awu ra arhim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Usiman, umum iwu ru ubina ukpi umum iki idɛyiwa ungo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, uma udɛyiwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Inera ivaa agha uvɛrh unera aka akɔwe umbɔ imang. Unying agha uvɛrh íshaa imang anaka atɔ̃ɔ̃, uwu uvaa agha uvɛrh íshaa imang isɔka itɔ̃ɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Ikivarhambɔ ashimbɔ ri imangyɛ umbɔ aka ifai unga. Unga anekuka umbɔ ikivarhambɔ. Uwukusong awuri ibema unga anang udɔka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Usiman agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwuruwi uvɛrh unga urhɛrhɛ umbɔ aka aneke unga awuri ibema anang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uzharhe mɔnɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Mɔcɛ unga adzipa arhi udiku utsɛrh ha na agɔr Usiman agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo unyã utsɛrh uwurɛ? Umum iki iba ri iyango, ungo usi idzaango amɛ̃ aka asorha adak, bɔr unga akũ anyĩnga awua ra adakmum na afire ake nggu igwar itsinga. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ungo usi idzaango umum imor nu itar uwɛɛ, bɔr utsɛrh uwurɛ udzur ri ivangyɛ umum iki itsĩwã ri iya ikɛrɛ unga anasi nekuka idzaa umum imor nu itang awɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ungo usi itsukango atsei ni itsimum, bɔr unga atsukanga atsei isung ra adakmum. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Nggee, umum idɛyiwa ungo, aka itsũwũkumbɔ arhɛrha arhimnga ha, ibibemanga iwu irhɛrhɛ. Bɔr uwuruwi umbɔ aka atsũwe arhim ukunjiir, abema ukunjiir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Mɔcɛ, Uyesu agɔr utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka atsũwũkumbɔ arhimngo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Atsen abɔɔ atirhi igɔr adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungamɔ nuwi, atsũwũka arhim?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Uyesu agɔr utsɛrh ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imangmangngo ngge ifɔrha ungo, uzĩ uku utɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ri itsi <optbreak/> uner uwuku udoi ikpũ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Umat 13.1-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-20">Umar 4.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Akɛrɛ ha aka amaa, Uyesu azɛ̃rhã amaa iteu iyiki igɔng nu iyiki ici, adũwã Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Iyɛrhe Unum. Abɔrɔ ha usɔkdũmɛn awu nggu unga, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>nu ikɛi akatsɛrh abɔɔ aka akerhe ri ípfu iyiki ibewe nu irhãrhĩ iyɔɔ. Umaryamu Umagadarha, uwu umbɔ aka atsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe utɔɔva. <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Nggu Uyowana, utsɛrha Ukuza unggbaashi ufɔm iya Uhiridu, nu Usuzana, nu arhɛrha akatsɛrh abɔɔ akũ abina arhɛrhɛ ayike Uyesu nu angwɛ̃ imesanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ adzeyi ri iteu aba akɔng ru Uyesu, unga arherhe unyaka arherhe agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>&lt;&lt;Uner ikpũ abin akũ ikpũnga azĩ ididoi. Unga aka annaa ikpũa ri icanga, ikpũ iyɔɔ igba ru utsĩndĩ, umbɔ azɛ̃rhã ajang adak, anunu aba akpɔuke iyi ha. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Iyɔɔ igba nu ifa, ngge iki imɛr, isi idãrhũngge ni ikoingge, ubinkutsu amɛ̃ ashike ra anang hã. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Iyɔɔ ikɛi igba ra aga ididɔk, ngge imɛr ni iseng, ididɔk ha itong ngge. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Ikpũ iyɔɔ igba ra abĩ aka aze, imɛr iseng ighwɛr ikpũrhã inainaka inangngge ikpũ ha umbɔ aka adoi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Unga aka arherhe rimi, na atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner ato akika agũ, unga agũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga arhusa unga agɛ awu use uwu agben unyaka arherhe ha. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka adɛyiwambɔ umbi abinkɛ aka awɔk aki Iyɛrhe Unum. Bɔr ra abɔɔ umum irherhe unyaka arherhe nggu umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;nggee umbɔ awuri irhimbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">na asi ínyãmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Awuri igũmbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">na asi íhwɛngmbɔ agbena.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Uish 6.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>&lt;&lt;Agben unyaka arherhe ha akɛ, ikpũ hã iwu Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Iyɔrɔ iyiki igba nu utsĩndĩ iwu abirabɛ aka agũ, bɔr Undenggũ aba anyanga arherhe ha adzeke ra amɛnmbɔ, utsur umbɔ ayɛimbɔ idzidzɛrhe na akpombɔ ififɔrh. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Iyɔrɔ iyiki igba ni ifa, iwu abirabɛ aka ayɛi arherhe ha nggu anggɔm ri ivangyɛ umbɔ aka agũ, bɔr umbɔ ashimbɔ ra anũnang. Umbɔ akpurha ayɛi idzidzɛrhe ivanga ukunjiir, bɔr umbɔ aka avira umbɔ, umbɔ azĩmbɔ udĩmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Ikpũ iyɔrɔ iyiki igba ru aga ididɔk, iwu abirabɛ aka agũ Arherhu-Num, bɔr igũ ighong iwu ru ubin, nu igũibɛn upfung itsu umbɔ asi isengmbɔ na aghwɛrmbɔ ikpũrhã. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Bɔr ikpũ iyɔrɔ ra abĩ aka aze, iwu abi amɛn aka aze, abika agũ Arherhu-Num na anyanga akpɔm ra amɛnmbɔ, umbɔ abima na aghwɛr ikpũrhã.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhirhang nú anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Umar 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>&lt;&lt;Unera asi ítsuka irhirhang awɔkuka ru utsutseu, use atsukuka ra ada ukoma. Ĩ'ĩ, awuri idene irhirhang hã afafã nú anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ke ru abika atsutsĩwã anyã ananga arhang. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Ubin usi íwɔkpɔ umbɔ aka asi ínyãmbɔ. Ikɛi ubin usi ítsirkpɔ umbɔ aka asi íhwɛngmbɔ ra awiya. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Nggee àka ayepa anyã na angwɛ̃dzɛn ri igigũ. Uwuruwi aka awe ru ihwihwɛng awuri itomuwe unga akpo arhɛrhɛ. Uwuruwi aka ashia, awuri iyɛse ungwɛ̃rhĩ ihwihwɛng ha unga aka awerangge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwɛ̃mbɔ Uyesu nggu uyanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Umat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Umar 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Uya Uyesu nu angwɛ̃mbɔ asok aba ru unga, bɔr umbɔ afɔr izĩ atsĩ ru unga adambɔ, ubinkutsu anera arhɛmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Uwɔɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyango uwɔɔ nu angwɛ̃mbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra awiya rɔ, abee inyã ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Bɔr unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abika agũ Arherhu-Num na atɔ̃ itser nggu ake, umbɔ awu uyamum nu angwɛ̃mɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adɔɔte ugba inai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Umat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Umar 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Unum ukpɔɔ Uyesu agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn igar ukau ha izĩ afɛn akɔrɔ.&gt;&gt; Umbɔ asok atsĩ ru ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ azĩmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Umbɔ awu ru uzɛ̃rhã, unga arhaa urhɔ. Ufin inai nggu ugba uso ubvun nu ukau ha ukwɛr amɛ̃ utsuke ru ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃mbɔ, uwuri itsĩme umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Angwɛ̃ imesa ha azĩ azita unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, a Uteiya! Umɛn iki itsĩmmɛn!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Unga azir asok atsɛrhu ugba nu ibvun amɛ̃ hã udɔɔr unu, ananga uku utɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Unga arhusa angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Imangmangmbi iwerɛngge?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nggu iwei umbɔ adzeidzeu, na arhusa adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungamɔ nuwi ikɛi, atsɛrhu ugba nu amɛ̃, ake agũna unga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikikerhe uner ipfu iyiki ibewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Umat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Umar 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Umbɔ atsĩ ukhukhɔɔ azĩ atsĩ abĩ Ugarasa, ake awu ugar ukau Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka acipa nu ubang ukau ha, unga agbopa unerwi aka awe ru ipfu iyiki ibewe ru uteu ha. Aka adera utsa ha asi itsima atorho use aseisa ri iya, aseiyi ra adzak. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka anyã Uyesu, unga atsu ivum na agba ra adaknga na atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubee usengo nggu umum Uyesu, Ungwɛ̃ Unum Uwuku Ugɔng? Umum ishɔ̃rhã ungo niba udzaango umum uver!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Unga irherhe rimi ubinkutsu Uyesu aka agɔra ipfu iyiki ibewe ha ugɛ ngge idze ru utsa ha. Aka adera ngge iki isaki idzur unga, anera aka isaka abow adaknga nu aboknga nggu inyãwã na adzɛu unga, bɔr unga anang apupuwe, ipfu iyiki ibewa ha iki isaki ikũna unga izĩngge ra arhum.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itsokngo igburh ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukpusha,&gt;&gt; ubinkutsu ípfu iyiki ibewa ha iwu irhɛrhɛ iki itsĩ ru unga. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Ngge ishɔ̃rhã unga, unga niba atsuka ngge izĩngge ru ughorkaghor angwĩ ra anangkɛ umbɔ iki igbang ípfu iyiki ibewe.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Ikpui arhede niyɔ iwu ru ughãwã ra anang akɔɔ nu ubang igũ iki ikhapa nu ukau ukugɔng. Ípfu iyiki ibewa ha ishɔ̃rhũ Uyesu ama aneke ngge itsĩ ru ngge, unga nekuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ípfu iyiki ibewa ha iki idzeku utsa ha ngge itsĩngge ru ukpui arhede ha. Ukpui arhede ha iso itĩ icipungge ru ukau ukugɔng hã, íkpengge ra amɛ̃.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Ivangyɛ abi idzɛu arhede ha aka anyã ubinkpi uku ukorhe, umbɔ asok atĩ azĩ adzowe isarhe ru utepa nu ikãwãngge. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Anera adzek aba inyã ifɛrhɛ ha. Umbɔ aka aba atsĩ nu Uyesu, umbɔ akpurha anyã utsa ha ípfu iyiki ibewa ha iki idzeku unga atsim atorho asei ra adak Uyesu nggu amɛnnga uku urhirhiki, iwei ifɛr umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Abirabɛ ifɛrha ha iki ikorhe ra asumbɔ, adɛyiwe anera ubinkpi uku utsu uner ípfu iyiki ibewe ha akerhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Iwei iki ifɛr anera kishoo ri ikãwã abĩ Ugarasa, umbɔ ashɔ̃rhũ Uyesu unga ama adzeka ra abĩmbɔ. Nggee unga asok atsĩ ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ azĩã.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Utsa ha ípfu iyiki ibewa ha iki idzeku unga ashɔ̃rhũ Uyesu agɛ unga adɔsa unga, bɔr Uyesu adene unga azĩã agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>&lt;&lt;Ubvui uzĩ ri iya nu udɛyiwe ubinkpi Unum aka akorhuwa ungo.&gt;&gt; Nggee utsa ha azĩã, na adɛyiwe utepa kishoo ubinkpi Uyesu aka akorhuwe unga.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukom unakuci nu ukutsɛrh <optbreak/> uwuku ughong iyor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Umat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Umar 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka abvui aba, anera arhɛrhɛ aba aghwe unga, ubinkutsu umbɔ kishoo asei idzɛu unga. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Mɔcɛ utsa uwɔɔ agburh Uyayiru, unggbaashi abã ifɛn-Num, aba agba ra adak Uyesu, na ashɔ̃rhã unga ama azĩ ri iyanga, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>ubinkutsu unanyĩ unapunga, imɛknga iki iyongge usɔkdũmɛn, aka abɔr ikpikpe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Uyesu awu ru utsĩndĩ anera arhɛrhɛ afĩĩ azɛ̃rhã nggu unga. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Utsɛrh uwɔɔ aka arhong adzirh imɛka usɔkdũmɛn awe umɔ, bɔr unera asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ akerhuka unga. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Unga aghɔ̃rhã aba udiku undzing Uyesu na abangu ifɛn atorhanga, kanying irhong adzirhnga ikerhungge.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Uyesu arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungaa abanga umum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Umbɔ kishoo atsɛyimbɔ, Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, anera arhɛrhɛ aka akɔng afĩĩ azɛ̃rhã nggu ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Bɔr Uyesu agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera abangunga umum. Umum ihwɛng ijee iki idzengge ru umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mɔcɛ utsɛrh ha anyã unga asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ awɔka, unga adzek azang aba agba ra adak Uyesu. Ra asu anera kishoo, unga adɛyiwe umbɔ ubinkpi uku utsu unga abanga unga, nu ibibanga hã iki ikerhuwe unga kanying. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A unapmum, imangmango ngge ikerhuwe ungo, uzĩ uku utɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Uyesu ana awu ra arherhe nu uwɔɔ adzeki iya Uyayiru unggbaashi ubã ifɛn-Num hã aba adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unapungo aka akpea. Niba udzowukɔ uver ikɛi ru uner imesa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Bɔr Uyesu aka agũ rimi, unga agɔr Uyayiru agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ugũo iwei, uwe ri imangmang ukpekũ, unapungo awuri ikerhunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Unga aka atsĩ ri iya Uyayiru, unga asi ineke unera atsĩã nggu unga Ubitru nu Uyohana nu Uyaku nu utesa nu uyisa una hã ukpekũ. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Anera kishoo ra awiya iya adɛ̃ɛ̃ iciu akpe, na atsui ivum ni itsi una hã. Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aneke iciu akpe. Una hã anasi ikpea, awu ru urhɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Umbɔ anyĩrhã unga, ahwɛngmbɔ unga aka akpea, <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>bɔr unga adzur ubok una hã akpɔm, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;A unapmum, usisok!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Ipfu una hã ibvui ibangge, kanying unga abera asok. Mɔcɛ Uyesu atsu umbɔ adzowe ubingha ru una hã. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Abika amar una hã adzeidzeu, bɔr unga akɛna umbɔ niba adɛyikumbɔ unera ifɛrha ha.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adene angwɛ̃ imesanga <optbreak/> usɔkdũmɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Umat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Umar 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Uyesu aka ayisa angwɛ̃ imesanga usɔkdũmɛn ananga unying, unga adzowe umbɔ iker nu ijee iyiki itsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe kishoo na akerhuwe irhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Adene umbɔ adzek adzowe isarhe Iyɛrhe Unum na akerhuwe abi irhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka niba anyangumbi ubin nu uzɛ̃rhã hã, niba anyangumbi igbong, use ukpoka, use ubingha, use uhwɛk. Niba anyangumbi atorho avaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ubɛn iyaa umbi aka itsĩ, àka asei umɔ utsɛku umbi aka isoku uteu ha. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Anera aba asi iyɛimbɔ umbi, àka awashuwe uzurhu adakmbi ri ivangyɛ umbi aka idzek utepumbɔ. Umgbɔ uwu utsar ukpuku ubewe ru umbɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Nggee umbɔ adzek azɛ̃rhã atsĩrhũmbɔ iteu, adzise Isarhe Iyiki Ize na akerhuwe anera ri inanga kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Uhiridu uyɛrhe aka agũ abin hã kishoo aka akorhe, unga adzununga, ubinkutsu abɔɔ agɛ awu Uyohana aka asoku udzak. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Abɔɔ agɛ uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uirhiya unga adzeka, abɔɔ ikɛi agɛ awu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num uwu ishaisha unga asok nggu urhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Bɔr Uhiridu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki izharhukũ itsi Uyohana. Awu ungamɔ uwi ikɛi umum iki ini igosha ikpũ abin akɛrɛ?&gt;&gt; Na abee inyã unga.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afuka anera anaka agɔnga atɔ̃ɔ̃ <optbreak/> (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Umat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Umar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Uyoh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Ivangyɛ abi itser Uyesu aka abvui aba, umbɔ azĩ asɔme unga ubinkpi umbɔ aka akorhe. Mɔcɛ unga akũna umbɔ, umbɔ abvui adzek umbɔ ikiyikambɔ azĩmbɔ uteu ukpɔɔ ugburh Ubetsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Bɔr anera aka agũ unga awe ru nggɔɔ ha, umbɔ adɔsa unga. Unga ayɛi umbɔ na arherhe arherhe Iyɛrhe Unum nggu umbɔ, na akerhuwe abika abee ikikerhe.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Urhɛɛ uku uwe angwɛ̃ imesanga usɔkdũmɛn aba agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɛyiwe anera umbɔ azĩmbɔ ru umbɔ atsĩ ri iteu nu icang azĩ abee ubingha nggu anang inũ, ubinkutsu nggimi awu arhum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Bɔr unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka adzowe umbɔ ubin umbɔ agha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ikpurhi iwu ru atsɔku uborodi atɔ̃ɔ̃ nu abɛrh avaa, ungo ubee umɛn izĩ igoi ubingha ukpurukpi uku umɛ̃ɛ̃ arhɛrha anera abɛrɛ kishoo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Akatsa abirabɛ aka awu umɔ ayombɔ anaka agɔnga atɔ̃ɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Bɔr unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka atsu umbɔ asei ukpu ukpusha, ubɛn ukpusha uyokpɔ isɔka itɔ̃ɔ̃.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga atsu anera kishoo asei ukpukpusha nú abĩ. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Uyesu ayɛi ímarhu uborodi atɔ̃ɔ̃ hã nu abɛrh avaa ha, unga aka abere arhi afã na atar uwɛɛ adzowe Unum na atsɔka ake. Mɔcɛ unga adzowe angwɛ̃ imesanga umbɔ agashuwe anera. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Umbɔ kishoo agha ashur na abɔre awushunga. Angwɛ̃ imesanga arhɔsa ake atɔk azĩnga usɔkdũmɛn.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubitru agɔr agɛ Uyesu unga <optbreak/> awu Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Umat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Umar 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Unum ukpɔɔ Uyesu ikiyikanga awu ri ifɛn-Num na angwɛ̃ imesanga awu nggu unga, unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anera agɔr agɛ umum iwu ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abɔɔ agɛ ungo uwu Uyohana Uner Ubɔtisima, abɔɔ agɛ Uirhiya, na abɔɔ agɛ uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num uwu ishaisha aka abvui aba nggu urhɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɔr umbi agɔr agɛ use? Umbi agɔr agɛ umum iwu ungamɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Ubitru adzipa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Ukiristo uwu Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Uyesu avange umbɔ utsur umbɔ adɛyikumbɔ unera arherhe akɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ufang Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka ihwa ayetnum ra abina arhɛrhɛ ra akakũ, nu ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num, na abika amesuwe Ikpem, awuri ikpɛ̃mbɔ unga. Awu ufang umbɔ aka ifɛr unga, ru unum untaar unga awuri isok abɛka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr umbɔ kishoo agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aba awuri idɔsunga umum, awu ufang unga ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ itsikamnga, na anyangu igãrhãmau ucuciianga ubɛn unum adɔsa umum. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Nggee ubɛn unerwi aka abee ifɔrh urhɛnga, umgbɔ uwuri igwirmgbɔ. Bɔr uwuruwi urhɛnga uku ugwir ri itsimum, afufɔrh umgbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Izea iwu use, unera aba akpo abin upfung kishoo bɔr urhɛnga ugwirmgbɔ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Unera aba agũã atsak umum nu arherhamum, Ungwɛ̃-Ner awuri igũa atsak uner ha ri ivangyɛ unga aka iba ri ikpikpoi Utɛnga, nu ikpikpoi asarkasar ípfu itser-Num. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, abɔɔ rabɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggimi awuri inyãmbɔ Iyɛrhe afã kata na adɔrha akpe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idzidzipu iyor Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Umat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Umar 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Inuma utɔrɔk iki iyok, Uyesu aka amaa arherhe akɛrɛ, unga akũ Ubitru nu Uyohana nu Uyaku nggu unga, umbɔ afũmbɔ igũ, azĩ ifɛn-Num. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɛn-Num, unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga udzipu uwuwemgbɔ, na atorhanga adiki iwu uku upɛ̃rhɛng ru nyaki inyĩnyaki inai. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Inera ivaa, Umusa nggu Uirhiya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>aka apɛng na arhang ru nyaki ishaa unum adɛ̃ɛ̃ arherhe nggu Uyesu. Umbɔ arherhe arherhe ri itsi akpenga iki iba itsuifɛr ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Ubitru nggu awɛrhu uzɛ̃rhãnga awe ru urhɔ. Umbɔ aka azir, umbɔ akpurha anyã irhirhang Uyesu nggu anera avaa aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu unga. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Ikivarhambɔ aka awuri abɔre Uyesu, Ubitru agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, azea umɛn iki iwu nggimi! Uneke umɛn itar atsurha ataar, unying uwu ungo, unying uwu uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Umusa, unying uwu uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num Uirhiya.&gt;&gt; Asi ihwɛngnga ubinkpi unga aka arherhe.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ana asi ibvura angwĩnga, akpurha anyã amɛɛ aka aba atsire umbɔ. Amɛɛ aka awu uzĩrhzĩ ru umbɔ, angwɛ̃ imesanga adiki igũ iwei. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Urhɛm udzeka ra amɛɛ ha ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɛrɛ awu Ungwɛ̃mum, uwuruwi umum iki itsũ. Àka akpeto ru unga!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Urhɛm hã uku udɔng, umbɔ akpurha anyã Uyesu ikiyikanga. Angwɛ̃ imesa ha akpɔm arherhe ha ra amɛnmbɔ, asi isɔmukumbɔ unera ri inum hã ubinkpi umbɔ aka anyã.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akerhuwe ungwɛ̃ uwuku <optbreak/> uwuri ipfu iyiki ibewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Umat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Umar 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Ukpe unum uvaa, umbɔ aka abvui ri igũ hã acipuwa, anera arhɛrhɛ aba akɔng ru unga. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Unera ri ikikɔnga atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem! Umum ishɔ̃rhã ungo umaa uba uyike ungwɛ̃mum, umum iwu ra unga ikiyikanga! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Ipfu iyiki ibewe iki isaki ifũ unga, itsu unga anu itsu ivum. Iki isaki igbipa unga itar, iyornga izang, ufuu udzeyi ra angwĩnga. Isi ínekungge unga utsɛku ngge iki inayiwe unga akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Umum iki ishɔ̃rhã angwɛ̃ imesango umbɔ ama atsũwe, bɔr umbɔ afɔr adambɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abi udan ukpirɛ, abika asheri imangmang, abi amɛn aka abewe. Umum iki isei ĩdãrhũmum nggu umbi, ukang umbi aka awe ru imangmang ru umum? Utsɛku ukang umum iki ibima nggu ida imangmangmbi? Ukũ ungwɛ̃ hã uba nggɛɛ ru umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ungwɛ̃ hã awu ru utsĩndĩ uwuku ububa, ipfu iyiki ibewe ha ishipa unga itar nu abĩ, iyornga itirhi izizang. Uyesu atsɛrhu ipfu iyiki ibewe ha, akerhuwe ungwɛ̃ hã, adzowuka unga ru utesa. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Kishoo aka awu umɔ adzeidzeu igɔng Unum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Umbɔ kishoo ana awe ru idzeu ru kishoo ubinkpi Uyesu aka akorhe, unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>&lt;&lt;Àka akpeto ru ubinkpi umum iki idɛyiwa umbi! Awuri ighambɔ adak Ungwɛ̃-Ner adzowe unga ra abok anera.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Bɔr umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi unga aka arherhe. Awɔmbɔ ake ru umbɔ utsur umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ. Umbɔ ikɛi agũ iwei irhusa unga arherhe ha.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ungaa awu ukugɔnga?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Umat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Umar 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Uning usomgbɔ ra angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ uwukusong awu ukugɔnga ru umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Uyesu ahwɛnga ifɛrhkɔmbɔ, unga ashupu ungwɛ̃rhũ uwɛkuci, atsu unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ akhapa nggu unga. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unerwi aka ayɛisa ungwɛ̃rhũ ungwɛ̃ uwurɛ ri itsokmum, unga ayɛi umum nukpɔ. Ikɛi ubɛn unerwi aka ayɛi umum unga ayɛi uwuku udena umum ĩba. Uwuruwi aka awu uwuku ucia ru umbi kishoo, unga awu ukugɔnga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteiya, umɛn inyã uwɔɔ asi iwea nggu umɛn na adɛ̃ɛ̃ itsusuwe ípfu iyiki ibewe ri itsokngo. Umɛn ibee ikɛn unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba akɛnmbi unga, ubɛn unerwi aka asi iwea unggamtsakmbi awu uwɛrhambi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abi Usamariya akpɛ̃mbɔ Uyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka ishipu Uyesu azĩ ra afã iki iyo, unga atsu amɛnnga akarhãrhã abee izĩ Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Unga adene abi itser umbɔ agbaashia, umbɔ azĩmbɔ ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ru Usamariya azĩã agbishuwe abina ru unga. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Bɔr abi uteu ha akpɛ̃mbɔ iyɛi unga, ubinkutsu umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ unga awuri itɔng azĩ Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga umbɔ Uyaku nggu Uyohana aka anyã rimi, umbɔ arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo ubeengo umɛn iyisu urha ra afã ukpɔ ucipuwa uba ukpĩĩwe umbɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Bɔr Uyesu adzipa, atsɛrha umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Umbɔ azĩmbɔ ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ukpɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum akika adɔsu Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Umat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Umbɔ aka awu ru utsĩndĩ, utsa uwɔɔ agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum idɔsumum ungo ubɛn anangkɛ ungo iki izĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Uyesu adzipa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Íjui ngbako iyiki ici iwengge ri ingwĩngge, anunu ikɛi aweke ra ashiyake, bɔr Ungwɛ̃-Ner ashia ra anangkɛ unga aka itsu itsinga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Agɔr uwɔɔ ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɔsa umum.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Bɔr uner ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, uneke umum izĩ indzake utɛmum kata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uneke abika akpe adzake abika akpembɔ. Bɔr ungo uzĩ udũwũ Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Uner uwɔɔ ikɛi agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umum idɔsumum ungo, bɔr uneka umum izĩ ighwe unuma nggu abi iyamum kata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Uyesu adzipa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unerwi aka atsai ikau irham na anu irhi undzingnga, asi imɛ̃ɛ̃ itɔ̃ itser ri Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adene isɔka utɔɔva <optbreak/> nu avaa adzek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Akɛrɛ ha aka amaa, Uteijee asɛng inera isɔka utɔɔva nu avaa. Unga adene umbɔ ivaivaa umbɔ agbaashia azĩ ubɛn uteukpi nu inangyɛ unga aka izĩ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Unga adɛyiwe umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Igbɛra abin iwe irhɛirhɛ, bɔr abi itsera awe ukunjiir. Àka ashɔ̃rhũ Uteijee uwu igbɛra abin, unga adene abi itser ri icang igbɛra abinnga. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Àka azĩ! Umum idena umbi ru nyaka angwɛ̃ idɔi ra ateu íjui ngbako. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Àka niba akpɔmmbi uhwɛk use ukpoka use abadak. Àka niba aghwembi unera ru utsĩndĩ.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>&lt;&lt;Ubɛn iyakɛ umbi aka itsĩ, àka atirha agɔr agɛ, &lt;Ididɔɔr ri iya ikɛrɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Uner ididɔɔr aba awea ri iya ha, ididɔɔrambi iwuri iwe nggu unga. Unera aba ashia, ighwembi iyi ididɔɔr ibvui iba ru umbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Àka asei ri iya ha, àka agha na ahwa ubɛn ubinkpi umbɔ aka adzaa umbi, ubinkutsu, imɛ̃ngge umbɔ afai uner itser ugbɛtanga. Àka niba akpɔwumbi aya.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>&lt;&lt;Ubɛn uteukpi umbi aka atsĩ, umbɔ aba ayɛimbɔ umbi, àka agha ubɛn ubinghakpi umbɔ aka idzaa umbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Àka akerhuwe abi irhãrhã abirabɛ aka awu umɔ, àka adɛyiwe anera agɛ, &lt;Iyɛrhe Unum iki iyongge nggu umbi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Bɔr ubɛn uteukpi umbi aka itsĩ umbɔ aba akpɛ̃mbɔ iyɛi umbi, àka adɔsa atsĩndĩ uteu ha na agɔr agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>&lt;Uzurhu uteumbi uku unyapa ra adakmɛn, umɛn iwashuwa umgbɔ ru umbi. Bɔr àka ahwɛng ugɛ Iyɛrhe Unum iki iyongge.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, ru unum ukpuku utsu uvau, Unum awuri igũ atorh Usɔdɔm ananga uteu ha.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhngo, Ukorazin! Atorhngo, Ubetsaida! Akorhuwa umbi abin idzeu arhɛrhɛ, umum iba ikorhumum ake ru Utaya nggu Usidon, umbɔ awuri idzipumbɔ iki ifitem, umbɔ awuri itsim ashaka atorho, na asei ra atɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Bɔr Unum awuri igũa atorh Utaya nu Usidon ru unum ukpuku uvarha arherhe anangnga umbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Ungo igango, Ukafanahum, ungo ukaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ awuri ibera ungo afũ afã? Ĩ'ĩ, awuri ikũna ungo acipa ra anang isei abika akpukpe.<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>&lt;&lt;Unga uwuku ikpeto ru umbi, akpeto ru umum. Uwuruwi aka akpɛ̃na umbi ikɛi akpɛ̃na umum. Bɔr uwuku ukpɛ̃ɛ̃ umum, akpɛ̃ uwuku udena umum ĩba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Isɔka utɔɔva na avaa ha abvui aba nggu anggɔm na agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ípfu iyiki ibewe igũna umɛn ri itsokngo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Uyesu adzipa agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum inyãmum Ushaitan aka agba iki ifitem ru nyaki inai iki inyaka. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Umum iki idzaamum umbi ijee umbi aka ijeku íbvui nu ínna, na atɔngmbi kishoo ijee Undenggũ, ubin isi ínayikpɔ umbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Niba agɔmmbi anggɔm ugɛ ípfu iyiki ibewe igũna umbi, bɔr àka awu ra anggɔm ugɛ aka atsɛngmbɔ atsokmbi ra afã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ri ivang hã Uyesu awu ra anggɔm ri Ipfu Isarsatangge, agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ikpoi ungo Utɛ, Uteijee uwu afã nggu abĩ, ungo uku uwɔkɔ ifɛrhɛ iyɛrɛ ru abi itsoi nu abi idzursu, nu usɔme ake ra awɛkaci. Akɛrɛ ha awu ubinkpi ungo uku ugũibɛn ikorha ukpɔ.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>&lt;&lt;Abina kishoo Utɛmum aka adzaa umum. Unera asi ihwɛngnga amɛn ungwɛ̃ɛ̃, Utɛ ikiyikanga ahwɛng. Unera asi ihwɛngnga amɛn Utei, Ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ ukpekũ nu uwuruwi Ungwɛ̃ hã aka isɔme unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Mɔcɛ unga adzipa udiku angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idorh iwu iyi asukɛ aka anyã ubinkpi umbi aka anyã! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi ugɛ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num nu ayɛrhe arhɛrhɛ aka abee inyã ubinkpi umbi aka anyã, na asi ikpombɔ inyĩnyã, abee igũ ubinkpi umbi aka agũ na asi igũmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe uner <optbreak/> Usamariya uwuku uze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Unuma nukpɔ utsa uwɔɔ uwuku uhwɛng Íkpem Umusa asok adɛ̃ɛ̃ na aviru Uyesu, arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, umum ikorhi iguse ni ikpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Unga adzipa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Atsɛng agɔr agɛ usee ru ubvur Íkpem Umusa? Ungo uhwɛngo agbena?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Utsa ha adzipa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt; &lt;Ungo ibemu Uteijee Unumngo nggu amɛnngo kishoo, nu ipfungo kishoo, nu ikerngo kishoo, nu adzɛnngo kishoo.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Iva 6.5</ref></char>.</note> Ikɛi, &lt;Ungo ibemu udɔkango ru nyaki itsikamngo.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Urha 19.18</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Uyesu adzipa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo urherhe mɔnɔ. Uzĩ ukorhe rimi nu ubɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Bɔr utsa ha anyã ugɛɛ unga ashia ru uvau. Nggee unga arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungamɔ awu undɔkamum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Uyesu adzipa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ aka asoku Urusharhima acipa awuri izĩ Ujeriko. Unga agbopa avɛu. Umbɔ avur atorhanga, na akwɛr unga akarhãrhã, unga akpurha abɔr akpe. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num nuwɔ azɛ̃rhã ru utsĩndĩ hã. Unga aka anyã utsa ha aka anu, unga ayapa nu ubang utsĩndĩã azĩã akinga. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Nggee ikɛi, utsa uwɔɔ ru unang Urhawi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abi Urhawi ani iyike abika adzowe idɛm-Num.</char></note> ivangyɛ unga aka aba atsĩ ra anang hã anyã unga aka anu, unga ikɛi ayapa ru ubang utsĩndĩã. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Bɔr uner Usamariya azɛ̃rhã ru utsĩndĩ hã, aba atsĩ ra anang utsa ha aka anu. Unga aka anyã utsa ha, atorh afɛr unga. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Unga azĩ ru unga azĩ akũ atorhanga afire isɔɔ, na atsuke atsei nu amɛ̃ inebi ake awu agɔu ri isɔɔ ha na abope ngge. Ashupa unga atsuku uzhikanga, akũna unga akũ azĩã inɛta ri iya iki iwosha. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Ukpe uku usar, unga anyangi íshaa imang ivaa adzowe ru uner iya ha, na agɛ, &lt;Uma unɛtuwa utsak uwurɛ. Umum iba ibvui ĩbamum, umum iwuri ifasamum ubinkpi ungo uku ufɛr ri itsinga.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ikitatambɔ, uwukusong awu undɔku utsa ha aka agba ra abok avɛu ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Utsa uwuku uhwɛng Ikpem hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uwɔrɔ aka agũ atorh unga.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ ukorhe rimi hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ri iya Umarta nu Umaryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Uyesu nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga awu ru uzɛ̃rhã nukpi, unga azĩ atsĩ ru ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ukpɔɔ utsɛrh uwɔɔ umɔ agburh Umarta ayɛi unga ri iyanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Unga Umarta awea ru unapumbɔ itsoka igburh Umaryamu, unga asei akhapa nggu Uteijee anu igosha arherhanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Bɔr Umarta itser ubingha inyangungge amɛnnga. Unga aba ru Uyesu na arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo usi igũo ighong unapumɛn aka aneka umum itɔ̃ itser ikiyikami? Udɛyiwe unga aba ayika umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Bɔr Uteijee adzipa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Umarta, a Umarta, amɛnngo aghong na adake ra abina arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Bɔr ubina unying ukpekũ ungo uku ubee. Umaryamu aka atsũa ubin uku uzea, nu umbɔ asi íyesukumbɔ ukpɔ ru unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Imesu Uyesu iyi ifɛn-Num</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Umat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Unuma nukpɔ Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɛn-Num ra ananga akɔɔ. Unga aka amaa, unying ra angwɛ̃ imesanga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umesuwa umɛn ifɛn-Num ru nyaka Uyohana aka amesuwe angwɛ̃ imesanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba awuri ifɛnmbi Unum, àka agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt; &lt;A Utɛmɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">atsam itsokngo isarsatake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Iyɛrhango iba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itsɛng ra abvur akɔɔ atoma </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ubinkpi ungo uku ubee umbɔ akorhe ru upfung ru nyaka umbɔ iki ikorhe ra afã.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Uma udzaa ubinghamɛn ukpu irherɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Uma utsũwe arhimmɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ru nyaka umɛn iki isaki itsuwe abika ashɔng umɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Niba ukũna umɛn uzĩɔ ru undeya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itsɛng ra abvur akɔɔ atoma </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bɔr ufɔrh umɛn ri iyiki ibewe.</char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Agɛ unera unying ru umbi awu ru uwɛrhɛ, unga asok azĩ ru unga ri ikɔtsuuka agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;A uwee, uma ukɔpa imarhu uborodi itaar. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Ubinkutsu uwɛrha umumwi adzeku uzɛ̃rhã aba acipa ri iyamum icɛrɛ. Umum ishimum ru ubin umum iki idzowe unga.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ uwɛrhɛ ha awu ru ubã na agɔr agɛ, &lt;Niba unyekungo umum arherhe! Umum iki ifɔmukumum ananga, umum nu awɛkacimum kishoo iki iwu ra anang inũ, isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ iso idzaamum ubin.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, iwɛrhɛ iba isi itsu unga asok adzowuka ubin, awuri iso adzowuka ubinkpi unga aka abee, ubinkutsu uwɛrha ha asi inekuka ififɛna.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>&lt;&lt;Nggee umum idɛyiwa umbi, àka afɛna awuri idzaambɔ. Àka abee umbi awuri ikpombi. Àka akwɛr angwĩ ubã awuri itsi itsuruwambɔ umbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka afɛna awuri iyɛisa, unga uwuku ububee awuri ikpoa, nu unga uwuku ukwɛr angwĩ ubã awuri itsurukumbɔ unga.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>&lt;&lt;Utei uwukusong ru umbi, ungwɛ̃nga aba ifɛnu ubɛrh, unga adzowe ibvui? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Use ungwɛ̃nga afɛnu udzee, unga adzowe unga inna? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Uba umbi abi amɛn aka abewe, ahwɛngmbi idzowe abin aka aze ra angwɛ̃mbi, icicang ishingge, Utɛmbi ra afã awuri idzowuka Ipfu Isarsatangge ra abika afɛna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nu Uba'arhzaburh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Umat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Umar 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Uyesu atsũwe ru utsa uwɔɔ ipfu iyiki ibewe iki itsu unera asi irherhunga arherhe. Ivangyɛ ipfu iyiki ibewe ha iki idzek, utsa ha arherha arherhe, anera arhɛrhɛ adzeidzeu. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Bɔr anera abɔɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba'arhzaburh uyɛrhe ípfu iyiki ibewe unga adzowe ijee iyiki itsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe ha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Abɔɔ avira unga agɛ unga akorhu ubin idzeu ukpu uwu utsar unga aka adzeku Unum.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Uyesu ahwɛnga ifɛrhkɔmbɔ, unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn iyɛrhe iki igau agbɛra avaa, iyɛrha ha iwuri isita, nu iya iki igau agbɛra avaa, iwuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ke adɔkake, ike iwuri igba ra abĩ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Iyɛrhe Ushaitan iba igasha agbɛra avaa, iyɛrhanga iwuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ iguse? Ubinkutsu umum igɔr rimi, umbi agɔr agɛ umum ikũ ijee Uba'arhzaburh itsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Umum iba ikũ ijee Uba'arhzaburh itsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe, abimbi akũ ijee iyikisong atsusuwe? Angwɛ̃ imesambi awuri itsuka umbi uvau ra arherhe akɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Bɔr, umum ĩba itsũwe ípfu iyiki ibewe ru ubok Unum, Iyɛrhe Unum iki ibangge ru umbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ukerkaker uner aba agbisha abin iwa, adɛ̃ɛ̃ adzɛu iyanga, abin iyanga awuri iwu uku kpengkpeng. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ uwuruwi aka akera unga aba afũ unga nggu ifuw, awuri ikũ ikernga avur abin iwa ha utsa ha aka awe ru imangmang ra ake, na agashuwe abin iya ha.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka asi iwea nggu umum, akpɛ̃ɛ̃ umum. Uwuruwi aka asi ikɔnga nggu umum, asusituwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ ipfu iyiki ibewe iba idzek ru unera, iki isaki iyarhe ri inang iyiki ikoi ibee ikpo iwiwosha ni isi ikpongge. Ngge igɔr igɛ, &lt;Umum ibvui izĩ ri iyakɛ umum iki idzek.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Ngge ibvui iba itsĩ, ngge inyã umbɔ aka ayar na agbishumbɔ iya ha. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Mɔcɛ ngge ibvui izĩ ikarhe ípfu iyiki ibewe iyɔɔ utɔɔva iyiriyɛ iki ibewe inangge ngge, ngge kishoo iba isei umɔ. Isisei utsa ha iyi imaataka iwuri ibewe inangge iyi inggbaashia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igũibɛn iyi idzidzɛrhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Uyesu aka arherhe rimi, utsɛrh uwɔɔ ri ikikɔnga atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idorh iwe nggu uyi uwuku umar ungo, na akpɔm ungo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, bɔr idorh iwu iyi abirabɛ aka agũ Arherhu-Num na adɔsa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsar ukpu Uyunana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Umat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Ikikɔnga iki itoma, Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Undan ukpuku ubewe nukpi. Abee utsar idzeu, bɔr asi ídzowukumbɔ umbɔ utsar ukuse, awuri idzowe utsar ukpu Uyunana ukpekũ. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Ru nyaka Uyunana aka awu utsar ra aner Unineba, rimi hã Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka iwe ru undan ukpirɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Ru unum ukpuku uvarha arherhe, Usarauniya uwu unɔr awuri iso adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu abi undan ukpirɛ na atsuke uvau ru umbɔ. Ubinkutsu unga adzeka anang akika ader aba igũ itsoi Usorhomon. Nggayɛ uwuruwi aka anangnga Usorhomon awu nggimi. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Aner Unineba awuri iso adɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ ru unum ukpuku uvarha arherhe nggu udan ukpirɛ na awuri itsu uvau ru ukpɔ, ubinkutsu, umbɔ adzipumbɔ ri udũwã Uyunana. Icɛrɛ uwuku unang Uyunana uwi nggimi!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhirhang iyor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Umat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>&lt;&lt;Unera asi ítsuka irhirhang awɔkuka, use anyangi ikikĩĩ atsĩmka irhirhang hã. Ĩ'ĩ awuri idene ngge ra anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ke, ngge itsú anera itsĩwã na anyã irhirhang hã. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Asungo ake awu irhirhang iyorngo. Asungo aba akerke, iyorngo kishoo iwe ri irhirhang. Bɔr asungo aba asi ikerke, iyorngo kishoo ikɛi iwu uzĩ. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ungwɛ̃dzɛn utsur irhirhang hã ru ungo iwe uzĩ. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nggee iyorngo kishoo iba irhangngge, ugau ukpɔɔ ushikpɔ ru uzĩ, ngge irhange ananga kishoo, ru nyaku urha utɔngvi uku usaku urhang ru ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ayare igoi abi Ufarisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Umat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Umar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Ivang Uyesu aka arherhe amaa, uner Ufarisi uwɔɔ ayisa unga igha ubingha ri iyanga. Nggee unga azĩ asei ra anang ubingha. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Bɔr utsa Ufarisi ha aka anyã ugɛ Uyesu asi inggbaashia asorha aboknga na atirhi igha ubingha, unga adzeidzeu.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Mɔcɛ Uteijee agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abi Ufarisi aka isaka asorh andzing akpɛwa nu itɛ̃rhĩ, bɔr unɔrkang umbi uwu abi unyɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Umbi aguge aner! Uwuku umuna awiya, ugɛse unga amunu unɔrkang hã ikɛi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Bɔr àka adzowe ubinkpi uku uwe ru unɔrkang itɛ̃rhĩ hã ra atsũwã, na abina kishoo awu atɛtɛnake ru umbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhmbi abi Ufarisi, ubinkutsu umbi aka isaka adzowe Unum unying ra abina usɔka iyi ibɔ̃ɔ̃ iyi ayerhe na ayerhu udzau kishoo ikɛi. Bɔr umbi akpɛ̃mbi izharhe arherhe idzidzɛrhe nu ibemu Unum. Imɛ̃ɛ̃ngge umbi akorhe akɛrɛ ha, na aneke ikwɛɛte akɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhmbi abi Ufarisi! Ubinkutsu umbi abema anang isei aki imor ra abã ifɛn-Num na aghwe umbi ri inang izɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhmbi, ubinkutsu umbi awu ru nyaka adzakɛ umbɔ aka asi idzinmbɔ, akirakɛ anera iki izɛ̃rhã afafã ri ida ihwihwɛng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Unying ra abika ahwɛng Íkpem Umusa agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ungo uba ugɔr rimi ungo urhena umɛn nukpɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Atorhmbi, umbi abika amesuwe Íkpem Umusa! Ubinkutsu umbi atsuke imor Ikpem ra anera umbɔ iki ikɔka atsã, bɔr umbi nibikambi asi ibangumbi abina nggu itokmbi unying, aka iyike umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhmbi, ubinkutsu umbi adzine adzak akika aze ra abika asɔm Arherhu-Num abirabɛ ateimbi aka afɛr. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Rimi hã umbi adekuwe ugɛ umbi abemumbi ubinkpi ateimbi aka akorhe. Umbɔ afɛr abika asɔm Arherhu-Num nu umbi adzin adzaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ri itsi akɛrɛ ha Unum ri itsoinga agɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum iwuri idene umbɔ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num nu abi itsermum. Awuri ifɛre abɔɔ na adzowe abɔɔ uver.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Nggee undan ukpirɛ uwuri iyɛi ufai adzirh abika asɔm Arherhu-Num kishoo umbɔ aka afɛyi ishaisha udzur ri imimunu upfunga, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>utirhi ra adzirh Uhabirha uzĩɔ ra adzirh Uzakariya, uwuruwi umbɔ aka afɛr ra avarhu ubeu anang aka adzowe idɛm-Num ri Iya-Num. Ĩĩ, umum idɛyiwa umbi, udan ukpirɛ uwuri iyɛi ufai abin akɛrɛ kishoo!<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>&lt;&lt;Atorhmbi abika amesuwe Íkpem Umusa, ubinkutsu umbi avur atsak umukurhi idzursu. Umbi nibikambi asi itsĩmbi, na asi ineke abika abee itsitsĩ atsĩmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka aneke anang hã, abika amesuwe Ikpem na abi Ufarisi atirhumbɔ ikpɛ̃na unga akarhãrhã, atsĩmbɔ ibeea unga ifuw nggu irhusa arherhe ra abina arhɛrhɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Adzɛu abee idzur unga ru ubinkpi unga aka irherhe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Igbiir ato nu ififita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-31">Umat 10.26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ri ivangyɛ arhɛrha anera aka akɔng, afĩĩ ajang adɔka, Uyesu agbaashia arherhe arherhe nggu angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn nggu uga abi Ufarisi, iki iwu ukpukpeta. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Ubin usi ítsirkpɔ umbɔ aka asi ínyãmbɔ, use uwɔkpɔ umbɔ aka asi íhwɛngmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Ubinkpi umbi aka arherhe ru uzĩ, awuri igũ ake ru unum ukpuku urhang, nu ubinkpi umbi aka awoyi na arherhe ru ubã, awuri idũwã ake nu atsi uvi aya.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>&lt;&lt;Umbi awɛrhamum, umum idɛyiwa umbi, niba agũmbi iwei abika afɛr iyor na asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbɔ ubin. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Bɔr umum idɛyiwa uwuruwi umbi aka igũ iwei unga. Àka agũ iwei unga, uwuku ifɛr iyor, na awea ri ijee iyiki itsu ungo ri idzũũ urha. Ĩĩ, umum idɛyiwa umbi aka agũ iwei unga! <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Umbɔ aki isaka agoshe anunu atɔ̃ɔ̃ ukobo avaa, bɔr Unum asi iyiruka unying ra ake. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Idzidzɛrhe, igwar itsimbi aka avarha ngge kishoo. Niba agũmbi iwei, umbi awu ru ugarh anangmbi anunu arhɛrhɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɛyiwe ibibemu Ukiristo ra anera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Umat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>&lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi, ubɛn uwuku urherhe ra asu anera ugɛ unga awu uwu umum, Ungwɛ̃-Ner ikɛi awuri irherhunga ugɛ uner ha awu uwu unga ra asu ípfu itser-Num. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Bɔr uwuruwi aka atsɛyinga ihwɛng umum ra asu anera, Ungwɛ̃-Ner ikɛi awuri itsɛyinga ihwɛng unga ra asu ípfu itser-Num. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Nu ubɛn uwuruwi aka arherhe irhɛm iyiki ibewe ri itsi Ungwɛ̃-Ner, awuri itsũwũkumbɔ unga, bɔr uwuruwi aka arhenu Ipfu Isarsatangge, asi ítsũwũkumbɔ unga.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>&lt;&lt;Umbɔ aba akũna umbi ri iker azĩmbɔ ra abã ifɛn-Num, nu ayɛrhe, nu abi ijee, niba agũmbi ighong ikaa atsimbi, use ubinkpi umbi aka irherhe. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Ubinkutsu Ipfu Isarsatangge iwuri imesuwangge ubinkpi umbi aka irherhe ri ivang hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ri itsi uguge uner ubin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Uwɔɔ ri ikikɔnga agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ugɔr ungwɛ̃mɛn unga agashuwa ukammum, ra abinkɛ utɛmɛn aka akpe na abɔra umɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsa uner, ungamɔ atsu umum iwu uwuku utsu uvau, use uwuku ugashuwa ukammbi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka arhi atai, àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka nggu kishoo ikpona abin upfung, ubinkutsu urhɛ unera usi íbɛkmgbɔ ra abin upfung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Arherhuwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner uwɔɔ nuwɔ awu uner ubin, abinkɛ unga aka akau ri icangnga, awu azeze akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Unga akaifɛrhkɔ ra amɛnnga agɛ, &lt;Umum ikorhi iguse? Ananga abɔrkeci umum iki itsu abin icangmum.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ unga agɔr itsikamnga agɛ, &lt;Ĩhĩĩ! Ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe ukpi. Umum ibibupuwe angbanmum akɛrɛ ni idzin akika agɔnga, ni itsuke abin icangmum kishoo nu abin akɔɔ umɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Umum iwuri igɔr itsikammum ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uweɔ ra abin arhɛrhɛ akirakɛ ungo iki igha imɛka irhɛrhɛ. Uwosha, nu ugha nu uhwa nu ugũibɛnngo.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr Unum agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;A ugugge! Ru untsuua ukpirɛ ungo iki ikpe. Umum inyãni ungaa awuri igha abin hã kishoo ungo uku ukɔngnge itsingo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ngge iwe rimi nggu kishoo uwuku ukɔngnge itsikamnga abin upfung, na ashia ru ubin ra asu Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Niba agũmbi ighong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Umat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Nggee umum idɛyiwa umbi, niba agũmbi ighong nggu ibibɛkmbi, ubinkpi umbi aka igha, use ubinkpi umbi aka itsim ra ayormbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Urhɛ unangmgbɔ abingha, nu iyor ikɛi inangngge atorho. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Àka arhi anyã anunu, asi idoike, asi igbɛrke, ashike ra angban akika atsu ubin igha, bɔr kishoo rimi hã Unum adzowuka umbɔ ubingha. Umbi anangmbi anunu akarhãrhã! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Ungamɔ ru umbi igũ ighongnga idɛ̃ɛ̃ itomungge ivanga unying ri inumyɛ unga aka ibɛk? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Umbi aba asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhumbi ungwɛ̃rhũ ubin rimi, ude awu use utsu umbi anu igũ ighong ra abina akɔɔ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>&lt;&lt;Àka arhi anyã ífur iki iseng. Isi ihwɛpungge itser, isi isɔrngge atorho. Bɔr umum isɔma umbi uyɛrhe Usorhomon ri igɔngnga kishoo anasi igbɛra idzam ru nyaku unying ru ngge. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Unum aba agbɛruka idzam ru ubĩĩ usi, uku uwe irherɛ, udã umbɔ akpĩĩwe ru urha, asi ígbɛranga umbi idzam ananga ukpɔ, umbi abi imangmang iyiki ici! <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Àka neke ikaifɛrhkɔ ubinkpi umbi aka igha, use ubinkpi umbi aka ihwa, niba agũmbi ighong abin hã. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Ubinkutsu, abi uzĩ ru upfung atĩna abee ikpũ abin akɛrɛ ha kishoo. Utɛmbi ahwɛnga umbi abeembi ake. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Bɔr àka abee Iyɛrhanga, nu abin akɛrɛ ha awuri idzaambɔ ake ikɛi.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imesa iyiki ingwɛ̃ abin ra afã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Umat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>&lt;&lt;Ukpuimum uku uci, niba agũmbi iwei, ubinkutsu Utɛmbi aka abemunga idzaa Iyɛrha ha. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Àka agoshe abinmbi na adzowe uhwɛka ra atsũwã. Àka agbishu ijari imangyɛ iki isi ívarngge, na angwɛ̃ abinmbi ra afã, anangkɛ abin hã asi ímaake, anangkɛ uvɛu asi íkhapunga umɔ nu adzurh asi ítsĩ aghake ake. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Ubinkutsu anangkɛ abinmbi aka awe, amɛnmbi ikɛi awe umɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agãrhã abika agbishi isiseimbɔ adzɛu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>&lt;&lt;Àka atsim abin itsermbi na akpɔm irhirhang igar, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>ru nyaka anerabɛ aka asei adzɛu uteiyambɔ aka idzeki irhowu ipfuna aba. Unga aka iba akwɛr angwĩ ubã, kanying umbɔ atsuruwe angwĩ ubã ru unga. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Awu ubin anggɔm ra agãrhã hã uteiyambɔ aka iba akpombɔ asei uku urhi. Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, awuri itsim atorho igãrhã, na agɔr umbɔ ugɛ àka asei isei, na agha ubingha, awuri iso nibikanga agashuwe umbɔ ubingha. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Agãrhã hã awuri igũmbɔ ibɛn unga aka aba, ri ikɔtsuuka, use ri igɔ̃kpeka, unga akpombɔ asei ukurhi adzɛu. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Àka ahwɛng ugɛ uteiya aba ahwɛnga ivangyɛ uvɛu aka iba ru unga, unga asi íneke unga ayar iyanga atsĩã. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Umbi igambi awu ufang umbi adzɛu, ubinkutsu, Ungwɛ̃-Ner awuri iba ri ivangyɛ umbi aka asi ikaimbi ifɛrhkɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhirhika nu ida irhirhika agãrhã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Umat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Ubitru arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, ungo urherhe unyaka arherhe ha ru umɛn, use ru ubɛn uner?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Uteijee agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ugãrhũ uwukusong arhika na awe ru itsoi? Awu unga hã, uteiyanga aka itsu unga irhi agãrhã iyanga, unga adzowe ubinghambɔ ri ivangngge? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Anggɔm awe aki ugãrhã hã uteiyanga aka iba anyã unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ itsernga rimi hã. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, awuri itsuke ugãrhã hã arhise abinnga kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Bɔr agɛ ugãrhã hã agɔr ra amɛnnga agɛ, &lt;Uteiyamum asi íbanga ifetem,&gt; na atirhunga ikwɛr agãrhã abɔɔ, akatsɛrh nu akatsak, na atsĩã igha na ahwa, utsɛku unga aka afĩrhã. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Uteiya ugãrhã hã aba ru unumkpi unga aka asi ihwɛnga, ikɛi ri ivangyɛ unga aka asi ihwɛngnga. Uteiya awuri ikwɛr unga iki ibewe na atsuke unga nggu abi uzĩ.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>&lt;&lt;Ugãrhã uwuruwi aka ahwɛnga ubinkpi Uteiyanga aka abee unga akorhe, na asi ikorhunga, awuri ikwɛr unga ugwɛɛ akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Bɔr uwuruwi aka asi ihwɛngnga ubinkpi Uteiyanga aka abee unga ikorhe, na akorhe ubinkpi uku umɛ̃ɛ̃kpɔ ugwɛɛ, awuri ikwɛr unga ukunjiir. Ubɛn uwuruwi umbɔ aka adzowe unga abina arhɛrhɛ, awuri ibee abin arhɛrhɛ ru unga. Uwuruwi ikɛi umbɔ aka aneke unga abin akagɔng arhɛrhɛ, awuri ibee abin akagɔng arhɛrhɛ ru unga.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu akũ igigau aba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Umat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iba itsu urha ru upfung, umum ibee urha ha utirhi ikpĩĩ icɛrɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Bɔr iwemum ru ubɔtisima umbɔ aka ikorhuwa umum, nu uver ru umum akarhãrhã utsɛku umbɔ aka ikorhuwa umgbɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ umum ikũ ididɔɔr inba ru upfung? Ĩ'ĩ, umum idɛyiwa umbi, umum ikũ igigau inba. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Udzur icɛrɛ, ri iyaa unying, inera itɔ̃ɔ̃ awuri igasha awu agbɛra ivaa, itaar angwĩmbɔ asi íweke unying nggu ivaa, ivaa ikɛi angwĩmbɔ asi íweke unying nggu itaar. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Awuri igigau, utei awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ nu ungwɛ̃ɛ̃ awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ utɛnga. Uyi awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ unapa, unapa awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ uyisa. Ukoko awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ utsɛnngwɛ̃nga, utsɛnngwɛ̃ awuri ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ ukokanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihwɛng ivang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Umat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Unga agɔr ikikɔnga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba anyã ufin inai udiku urhɛɛ, kanying umbi agɔr agɛ, &lt;Inai iwuri idoingge,&gt; ngge idoingge. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Umbi aba agũ ugba udze unɔr ufɛu, umbi agɛ, &lt;Imani anii iwuri iwengge,&gt; ngge iwengge. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Umbi abi ukpukpeta! Umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛngmbi idzipa abin abĩ nggu afã, bɔr ihwɛng atsar ivang iyɛrɛ umbi afɔr adambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aka avarha amaa ifuw umbi nu utsĩndĩ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Umat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>&lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi asi ivarhumbi ubin uku urhika nibikambi? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Umbi aba azɛ̃rhã azĩ ivarha arherhe ri iya uyɛrhe, umina asungo umbi avarha amaa nggu unga nu utsĩndĩ. Use unga ikũna ungo akũ azĩã ra abika atsu uvau. Uner uwuku utsu uvau ikɛi atsuke ungo ru ubok abow ikow. Abow ikow ikɛi atsuke ungo ru ugborzĩ. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Umum idɛyiwa ungo, ungo usi ídzekɔ ra anang hã, utsɛku ungo iki ifai kishoo, ukobo usi íbɔrkpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Udzipa use akpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Abɔɔ awu umɔ ri ivang hã, adɛyiwe Uyesu ubinkpi Ubirhatu aka atsu anernga afɛr aner Ugarhirhi atoma adzirh umbɔ ri ivangyɛ umbɔ aka adzowe idɛm-Num. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbɔ aka afɛr abi Ugarhirhi ha rimi hã, umbi agɔr agɛ umbɔ awu ra arhim anangmbɔ anera kishoo ru Ugarhirhi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Ishingge rimi! Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umbi aba asi idzipumbi igambi, umbi kishoo awuri ikpe ru nyaka umbɔ ha. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Use anera usɔka nu utɔrɔk ha ubandzin uku ubupa ru Usirhuwam ufɛre umbɔ, umbi agɔr agɛ umbɔ awu ra arhim anangmbɔ anera kishoo ru Urusharhima? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Ishingge rimi! Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umbi aba asi idzipumbi igambi, umbi awuri ikpe ru nyaka umbɔ ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe uvorhvo <optbreak/> uku usi ighwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu arherhuwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ, awu ru ucucii uvorhvo ri icangnga. Unga asok azĩã ibee ikpũrhũ uvorhvo ha, bɔr unga asi ikpoa ikpũrhã unying. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Unga agɔr uwuku urhise icang hã agɛ, &lt;Amɛɛ untaar rakɛ umum iki iba inu ibee ikpurhu ucucii uvorhvo uwurɛ, bɔr umum isi ikpomum ubin ru umgbɔ. Ugbɛre umgbɔ! Awu use umgbɔ uvina abĩã?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr uwuku urhise icang hã agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, uneke umgbɔ, umum itsuke abĩ ru umgbɔ, ni itsuke abi ru umgbɔ ikɛi ra amɛka akɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Umgbɔ uba ughwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã ra akang, izea niyɔ! Umgbɔ uba usi ighwɛrmgbɔ, umbɔ agbɛre umgbɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Branch of fig tree with fruit" file="hk00088b.tif" size="col" loc="13.9" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="13.9">Ubok ucucii uvorhvo nggu ikpũrhã</figure><verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akerhuwe ukutsɛrh ru unum <optbreak/> ukpuku uwosha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Ru unum ukpuku uwosha ukpɔɔ Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ amesuwe ra abã ifɛn-Num, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>utsɛrh uwɔɔ awu umɔ ipfu iyiki ibewe iki itsuke unga irhãrhã ipfuruwe undzinga imɛka usɔka ni imɛka utɔrɔk, afɔr idɛ̃ɛ̃ ukudzik adaka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka anyã unga, unga ayisa unga aba ru unga na agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsɛrh ha, aka ashɔɔtambɔ ungo ri irhãrhãngo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Mɔcɛ unga aberu uboknga atsorhe nu utsɛrh ha, kanying utsɛrh ha abera adɛ̃ɛ̃ uku udzik, na akpoi Unum.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Bɔr unggbaashi ubã ifɛn-Num hã agũ avɔm Uyesu aka akerhuwe ru unum ukpuku uwosha. Unga agɔr anera aka awu umɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Inuma iwu utɔ̃ĩ iyi itser, aka aba ri inum hã umbɔ akerhuwa umbi, asi iwea unum ukpuku uwosha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Bɔr Uteijee agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi abi ukpukpeta! Ubɛn unera ru umbi aka asi isaka agarhunga inaknga use uzhikanga ru ugbor, akũ azĩa ihwa amɛ̃ ru unum ukpuku uwosha? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Utsɛrh uwurɛ awu unang Uibrahim, uwuruwi Ushaitan aka abow imɛka usɔka ni imɛka utɔrɔk riyɛ. Asi izea umbɔ agarhuwe unga ru unum ukpuku uwosha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Unga aka arherhe rimi, kishoo anggamtsaknga agũ atsa. Bɔr anera agɔm anggɔm abin idzeukɛ unga iki ikorhe kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ishaa umastad</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Umat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Umar 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Uyesu arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Iyɛrhe Unum iwu igusengge? Umum ikpanga ngge nggu use? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Iwe ru nyaki ishaa umastad, iyiriyɛ utsa uwɔɔ aka anyanga adoi ri icangnga, ngge iseng iba iwu ucucii, anunu akang ashiyake ra aboka.&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Mustard plant" file="lb00123b.tif" size="col" loc="13.19" copy="Louise Bass" ref="13.19">Ucucii umastad </figure><verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe aki uga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Umat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Ikɛi unga arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ikpangu Iyɛrhe Unum nggu use? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Iwe ru nyaku uga, ukutsɛrh aka anyanga akayi agbiu isɔka ivaa aki akɔ̃ abvurh, ake kishoo asok afui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwĩ ubã akika apare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Umat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu aka adzur utsĩndĩ uwuku izĩ Urusharhima, unga atsĩrhũ iteu iyiki ici nu iyiki igɔng anu imesuwe anera. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Uwɔɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, inera iwu ukunjiir ukpekũ iki ikpo ififɔrh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>&lt;&lt;Àka abima na atsĩ ra angwĩ ubã akika apare, ubinkutsu, anera arhɛrhɛ awuri ikãrhũmbɔ itsitsĩ bɔr asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Uteiya aba asok afɔma angwĩ iya, umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra awiya na akwɛr angwĩ iya, na ashɔ̃rhã agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, kabɔɔ umaa utsuruwa ananga ru umɛn!&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Bɔr unga awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum isi ihwɛng umbi use anangkɛ umbi aka adzek umɔ!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ umbi awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;E! Umɛn iki igha ni ihwa nggu ungo, ikɛi ungo umesuwa umɛn ru atsĩndĩmɛn.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr unga awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum isi ihwɛng umbi use anangkɛ umbi aka adzek umɔ! Àka asombi ru umum, abi itser iki ibewe!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>&lt;&lt;Iciu akpe nu itãi anyĩ iwe umɔ, aka inyã Uibrahim, nu Uishaku, nu Uyakubu, nu kishoo abika asɔm Arherhu-Num ri Iyɛrhe Unum, bɔr umbi abɛ umbɔ awuri itare umbi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Anera awuri idzeki igɔ̃kpee nu udiku urhɛɛ nu ufã nu unɔr, asei ri irhowu Iyɛrhe Unum. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Idzidzɛrhe, abɔɔ icɛrɛ aka awe amaataka awuri iwe anggbaashia, anggbaashia awuri iwe amaataka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu agũ ighong Urusharhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Umat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ri ivang hã abi Ufarisi aba ru Uyesu, agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usɔkɔ nggimi, uzĩɔ anang akase, ugomna Uhiridu abee ifɛre ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka azĩ adɛyiwe ijui ngbako iyiki ici ha ugɛ, &lt;Irherɛ umum iwuri itsũwũkũ ípfu iyiki ibewe, ni iwuri ikerhukũ anera, ikɛi udã rimi hã, umum imaa itsermum ikpe. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Ĩĩ awu ufang, umum iki izɛ̃rhũ uzɛ̃rhãmum irherɛ nggu udã, ni ikpe ikɛi. Idzidzɛrhe isi imɛ̃ngge uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num akpe ra awiya Urusharhima!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>&lt;&lt;Oka Urusharhima, Urusharhima! Ungo ufɛr abika asɔm Arherhu-Num nu utang atarh ra abirabɛ umbɔ aka adene umbɔ aba ru umbi. Idiki isong umum iki ibee ikɔng angwɛ̃mbi ananga unying, ru nyaki inũ iki isaki ikɔng angwɛ̃ngge ra afɛkngge, bɔr umbi akpɛ̃mbi! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Nggayɛ awuri inekambɔ iyambi arhanga! Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umbi asi íbvui anyãmbi umum, utsɛku unumkpi umbi aka igɔr agɛ, &lt;Idorh iwe nggu uwuruwi aka aba ri itsok Uteijee!&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Amb 118.26</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ri iya utsa Ufarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Unum Ivangyɛ Uyesu aka atsĩ igha ubingha ri iya unggbaashi utsa Ufarisi uwɔɔ ru ukpuku uwosha ukpɔɔ, anera angwɛ̃dzɛn na atsu asumbɔ ru unga. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Uner irhãrhĩ iyiki iseng iyor awu umɔ ra asu Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Uyesu arhusa abi Ufarisi ha nu abika amesuwe Íkpem Umusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ri Ikpem, imɛ̃ngge umbɔ akerhuwe unera ru unum ukpuku uwosha use isi imɛ̃ngge?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Bɔr umbɔ anukutata. Nggee Uyesu akpɔm utsa ha na akerhuwe unga, na adene unga adzeka.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Mɔcɛ unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba unera ru umbi awu ru ungwɛ̃ use inak igba ru uvãã amɛ̃ ru unum ukpuku uwosha, umbi asi ítsũwũkumbi kanying?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Umbɔ ashimbɔ ru urhɛmkpi umbɔ aka irherhe.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka anyã atsen aka atɛng anang isei aka azea asei, unga adɛyiwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe ugɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>&lt;&lt;Unera aba ayisunga ungo irhowu ipfuna, niba useisɔ ra anang isei aka azea, use aghwimbɔ uwɔɔ aka ananga ungo. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Ngge iba iwu rimi, uner irhowa ha aka ayisa umbi aba awuri igɔr ungo agɛ, &lt;Ubɔre anang iseingo ru uner uwɔrɔ.&gt; Ungo uso uzĩɔ̃ ra anang aka acia nggu atsa. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Bɔr umbɔ aba ayisumbɔ ungo irhowu ipfuna, usei ra anang aka acia, uneke uner irhowa ha aba nibikanga, ayisa ungo agɛ, &lt;A uwɛrhɛ, uba usei nggɛɛ ra anang aka azea.&gt; Mɔcɛ ungo uwuri iweɔ ri imor ra asu abi irhowa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka aberi itsinga, awuri irhɛrhuwe ike, uwuruwi aka arhɛrhuwe itsinga, awuri iberuwe ike.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr uner irhowa ha agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba uwuri iyisungo anera igha ubingha, use irhowa, niba uyisungo awɛrhango, nu angwɛ̃mbi, nu unangmbi nu abi ubinmbi. Ungo uba ukorhungo rimi, umbɔ aba ayisumbɔ ungo, umbɔ ifasambɔ ungo ubinkpi ungo uku ukorhe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Bɔr ungo uba uwuri ikorhungo irhowa, uyisa atsũwã nu akatarhu, nu abi ishai iyor, nu abi ibvuta, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>ungo uwuri iweɔ ri idorh. Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ umbɔ asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ afaimbɔ, bɔr Unum awuri ifasa ungo ru unum ukpuku usok ra akpe uwu abika arhurhika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe irhowa iyiki igɔng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Umat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Ivangyɛ unying ru umbɔ abika asei igha ubingha aka agũ rimi, unga agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idorh iwe nggu unerwi aka isei ighigha ri Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ aka agbisha abin irhowa iyiki igɔngnga amaa, na aghwi abika azĩ irhowa arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Ivangyɛ ivang irhowa ha iki iba imɛ̃, unga adene ugãrhãnga azĩ adɛyiwe abi ha unga aka aghwi agɛ, &lt;Àka aba, umum iki inzɛkũ abina.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umbɔ kishoo atsĩmbɔ isɔm abinkɛ aka ikɛn umbɔ izizĩ irhowa ha ru ughwisha. Uwu inggbaashia agɛ, &lt;Umum igoi icang niyɔ, awu ufang umum izĩ inyã ngge. Kabɔɔ uma aneka umum izĩ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>&lt;&lt;Uwɔɔ agɛ, &lt;Umum igoi inak iyiki ikau irham usɔka, umum ibee izĩ ivira ngge. Kabɔɔ uma aneka umum izĩ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>&lt;&lt;Ikɛi uwɔɔ agɛ, &lt;Umum inii ipfunu utsɛrh uwuku ufa, isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ĩbamum.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ugãrhã hã aba adɛyiwe uteiyanga akɛrɛ ha. Mɔcɛ amɛn uteiya iya ha adake, unga adɛyiwe ugãrhãnga hã agɛ, &lt;Udze uzĩ ifetem, ra atsĩndĩ nu ikparavar utepa, ukarha atsũwã, nu akatarhu nu abi ibvuta, nu ashai iyor ukũba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>&lt;&lt;Ugãrhãnga agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, ubinkpi ungo uku ubee iki izĩ ikorhumum, bɔr ananga ana abɔrke ri iya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ uteiya irhowa ha agɔr ugãrhãnga agɛ, &lt;Ubvui udze utsĩrhã atsĩndĩ iteu nu arhum, utsu anera umbɔ aba atɔk iyamum. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, uko unera unying ra abɔrɔ abi inggbaashi ha umbɔ aka aghwi asi íbangunga ubin irhowamum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum akika adɔsu Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Umat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Anera arhɛrhɛ aka azɛ̃rhã nggu Uyesu, unga adzipa agɔr umbɔ agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ubɛn unerwi aka iba ru umum, na asi ikpɛ̃ɛ̃ utɛnga nu uyanga, utsɛ̃nga nu awɛkacinga, angwɛ̃mbɔ nu anapumbɔ, use urhɛnga, unga asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ awea ungwɛ̃ imesamum. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka asi ishupu igãrhãmau ucuciia adɔsunga umum, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ awea ungwɛ̃ imesamum.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>&lt;&lt;Unera unying ru umbi aba abee idzin utsurha udedetamgbɔ, unga asi ígbaashia asei na avarhu ubinkpi unga aka ifɛr, na anyã use unga awea ru uhwɛk ukpurukpi unga aka imaa idzina? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ubinkutsu utsur unga atsu atarh idzina na afɔr imimaa adaka, ubɛn unera aka inyã, awuri inyĩrhã unga, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>agɛ, &lt;Umbi anyã uner uwirɛ aka atirhi idzin, na afɔr imimaa adaka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>&lt;&lt;Use awu uyɛrhe uwukusong awuri izĩ iwa nggu uyɛrhu uwɔɔ, na asi isei avarhunga use anernga anaka agɔnga usɔka awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ nggu abɔrɔ aka awu anaka agɔnga isɔka ivaa? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Unga aba asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛ̃ɛ̃, unga adene itser umbɔ azĩ akpo uyɛrhe uwɔrɔ unga ana awu ukukaa, umbɔ ashɔ̃rhã abee ididɔɔr? <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Iwe rimi hã, ubɛn unera ru umbi aka asi idzowuka abinnga kishoo, uner ha asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ awea ungwɛ̃ imesamum.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angwã akatãrhã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Umat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Umar 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>&lt;&lt;Angwã aze, bɔr ake aba ashike ri itonga angwã, iwuri ikorhu uguse ni iwe angwã ikɛi? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Ashike ri itser ri ikom icang, use ra atɔɔ irham. Umbɔ awuri itare ake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt;Uner ato akika agũ, unga agũ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe idɔi iyiki igwir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Umat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Abika ayɛsu ikirbi abĩ nu abirabɛ umbɔ aka anyanga umbɔ awu abi arhim arhɛrhɛ, aba akɔng adziir anu igosha unga, <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>abi Ufarisi nu abika amesuwe Ikpem abvun agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsak uwirɛ ayɛisa abi arhim na agha nggu umbɔ!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Irh 5.29-30</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu arherhuwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>&lt;&lt;Unera unying ru umbi awe ru ídɔi unaka. Unying iba igwirngge, unga asi ínekuka ídɔi isɔka utɔɔrha nu utɔɔrha ri idɛɛ na azĩã ibee iyiki igwir ha utsɛku unga aka ikpo ngge? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Unga aba akpoa ngge, unga agɔm na atsã ngge ra acɛisa, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>unga aka izĩ ri iya. Unga ayisa awɛrhanga nu andɔkanga ananga unying na agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;Àka agɔm anggɔm nggu umum. Iki ikpomum idɔi uma hã iyiki igwir ha.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, iwuri iwe rimi hã, umbɔ aka igɔmanggɔm ra afã ri itsi uner arhim unying uwuku udzipa anangmbɔ abika arhika isɔka utɔɔrha ni inera utɔɔrha iki isi ibeengge idzidzipa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe igwigwir uhwɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>&lt;&lt;Use, utsɛrh uwukusong awe ru íshaa imang usɔka, ishaanga unying igwirngge, unga asi ígaar urhirhang, na ayar iya kishoo na angwɛ̃dzɛn abee utsɛku unga aka ikpo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Unga aba akpoa, unga iyisa awɛrhanga nu undɔkanga na agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;Àka agɔm anggɔm nggu umum iki ikpomum ishaa uhwɛk ha iki igwir.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, iwuri iwe rimi hã, awu ubin anggɔm ra asu ípfu itser-Num ri itsi uner arhim unying uwuku udzipa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ungwɛ̃ <optbreak/> uwuku uzhuzhoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Uyesu arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ awu ra awɛkatsa avaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Uwuku ucia agɔr utɛnga agɛ, &lt;A utɛ, ugashuwa ukammum.&gt; Mɔcɛ utɛnga agashuka ukammbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>&lt;&lt;Akpurha amaa inuma ukunjiir, uwuku ucia akarha abinnga kishoo, azĩã abĩ akɔɔ nu udĩ ukpuku uder. Mɔcɛ, unga afɛruka abinnga ru ugba. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Unga aka amaawe abinnga kishoo, imerh iso imaangge abĩã, unga atsĩã iyaki imerh. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Unga asok azĩ awea ugãrhã utsa uwɔɔ ra abĩ hã, utsa ha atsuke unga azĩ idzɛu arhede ra agborke. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Unga abee igha ubingha arhede ha, unera asi idzowuka unga ubin.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ unga aka atsĩ ra amɛnnga, unga agɛ, &lt;Agãrhã awu asong ri iya utɛmum, umbɔ iki igha ashur na abɔre? Nu umum iwuri ikpemum ri imerh. <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Umum iso izĩ ru utɛmum igɔr unga igɛ, a utɛ, umum iki ikorhu ubin arhim ru Unum, ni ishɔiwamum ungo. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Umum isi ibvui imɛ̃mum umbɔ ayisa umum ungwɛ̃ngo. Unyanga umum ru nyaku ugãrhãngo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Mɔcɛ unga asok azĩã ru utɛnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">&lt;&lt;Bɔr unga ana adzeka ukuka nu utɛnga anyã unga, atorh afɛr unga, unga atĩ azĩã akarha unga awuma na ashor atamnga.<verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>&lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃nga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;A utɛ, umum ikorhu ubin arhim ru Unum ni iki ishɔiwamum ungo. Umum isi imɛ̃mum umbɔ abvui ayisa umum ungwɛ̃ngo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki inggbaashia agɔr agɛ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ungwɛ̃. Utsu umum iwu ugãrhãngo.</char></note>&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr utesa agɔr agãrhãnga agɛ, &lt;Àka akũ atorho aka aze aba atsĩme unga ifetem. Àka atsuke imangto ri itoknga na abadak ra adaknga. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Àka atsĩ adzur ungwɛ̃ inak iyiki isenga, aba angwãna. Umɛn izɛk irhowa igɔmanggɔm. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ubinkutsu ungwɛ̃mum uwɛrɛ ha aka akpea na azir ikɛi, aka agwira bɔr icɛrɛ umɛn iki ikpomɛn.&gt; Mɔcɛ umbɔ atsĩmbɔ irhowa.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>&lt;&lt;Umbɔ ana awe ru irhowa ha, ungwɛ̃nga uwuku ukũa awu ra arhum. Unga aka adzeka arhum aba ayo ri iya, unga agũ anggang nu azer atɔkuke iya. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Nggee unga ayisu ugãrhã unying na arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;Awu use uni izãrhã?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Ungwɛ̃mbi aka abanga, utɛngo atsu umbɔ angwã inak iyiki isenga, akorhi irhowa, unga aka aba atsĩ ukuker.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>&lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃mbɔ uwuku ukũa amɛnnga adake, unga akpɛ̃ɛ̃ itsĩ ri iya, nggee utɛnga adzek ashɔ̃rhã unga. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Bɔr unga agɔr utɛnga agɛ, &lt;Unyã! Imɛk iyɛrɛ kishoo umum ikapa ungo, inasi ikpɛ̃mum igũna ungo idiki unying. Rimi hã ungo unasi idzaango umum ibũ iyiki ici umum ikorhumum irhowa nggu awɛrhamum. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Bɔr ungwɛ̃ngo uwuruwi aka azĩ afɛre abinngo nggu akatsɛrh aba ri iya, ungo ungwãnuwe ungwɛ̃ inak iyiki isenga ru unga!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>&lt;&lt;Utɛnga agɛ, &lt;Oka ungwɛ̃mum, ungo uwu nggu umum ubɛn ivang, ubɛn ubinmum, uwu ukpungo. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Bɔr imɛ̃ngge umɛn ikorhi irhowa ni igɔmanggɔm, ubinkutsu ungwɛ̃mbi uwuruwi aka akpe, aka azira, uwuruwi aka agwir, umbɔ aka akpombɔ unga.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ri itsi <optbreak/> uner itser ataba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Uyesu adɛyiwe angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ awu uner ubin, umbɔ adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;Uner uwuku udzɛu itserngo anu ikorhe ataba nggu abinngo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Nggee unga ayisu uner itsernga hã arhusa agɛ, &lt;Umum ini igũshu use ri itsingo? Ukũ ubvur itserngo uba uvarhe umum inyãni kishoo, ubinkutsu ungo usi íweɔ uner itsermum.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>&lt;&lt;Uner itser ataba ha akaifɛrhkɔ ra amɛnnga agɛ, &lt;Umum ikorhi iguse icɛrɛ? Uteiyamum uwi awuri iwayiwe umum ri itser. Umum uwi ishimum ri iker iyiki ikau irham, ni iwu ra atsa akika afɛn ifɛn. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Umum ihwɛng ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe, umbɔ aba awayikumbɔ umum ri itser nggimi, anera awuri iyaimbɔ umum ra ayambɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>&lt;&lt;Nggee unga ayisa abika agha uvɛrh ru uteiyanga unying anying, unga arhusu inggbaashia agɛ, &lt;Uteiyamum adɔsa ungo itikisong?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Ídzum atsei anaka utɔrɔk.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ uner itser ataba ha agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Unyangu ubvur uvɛrhngo ifitem, utsɛng anaka ana.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ unga arhusu uwu uvaa ikɛi agɛ, &lt;Adɔsa ungo itikisong?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;Ambãĩ itsem, unaka unying.&gt; Unga adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;Unyangu ubvur uvɛrhngo, utsɛng isɔka utɔrɔk.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>&lt;&lt;Uteiya ha akpoi uner itser uwuku uda irhirhika ha, ubinkutsu akorhi ifɛrhɛ ha nggu isarasu. Anera ru upfung ukpirɛ akorhi ifɛrhɛmbɔ nggu itsoi anangmbɔ abika adɔsu Unum. <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, àka akũ abin upfung akũ akpowe itsikammbi awɛrhɛ, abinmbi aba amaake, umbɔ ayɛi umbi ra aya aki ugbagbaa.<verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka awe ru imangmang nggu ubin uku uci, awuri iwea ri imangmang ru ubin ukpuku urhɛ. Uwuruwi aka ashia ri imangmang ru ubin ukpuku uci, asi íwea ri imangmang ru ubin ukpuku urhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Nggee umbi aba ashimbi ri imangmang ra abin upfung ukpirɛ, ungaa idzaa umbi abin aki idzidzɛrhe? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Umbi aba isaka ashimbi ri imangmang ra abin anera, ungaa idzaa umbi abin aki ukammbi?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>&lt;&lt;Ugãrhã asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atɔ̃wũka itser ra ateiya avaa. Unga awuri ibema unying na akpɛ̃ɛ̃ uwɔrɔ, unga awuri idzowe itsinga ru unying na akpɛ̃ɛ̃ uwɔrɔ. Ungo usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ udzowukɔ itsingo ru Unum nu uhwɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Abi Ufarisi abika abemu uhwɛk, aka agũ akɛrɛ ha kishoo, umbɔ acatu Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi azharhe arherhe aka aze ra asu anera, bɔr Unum ahwɛnga amɛnmbi. Ubin uku uze ra asu anera, uwu ubin ishĩ ra asu Unum.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itomi imesi iyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>&lt;&lt;Imesi Íkpem Umusa nu abvur abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, umbɔ aka adũwã utsɛki ivang Uyohana. Udzur ri ivang hã, umbɔ aka anu idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi Iyɛrhe Unum, nu ubɛn unera abee itsĩ ri ngge ri inggang. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Asi ighonga afã nggu abĩ aki imaa, bɔr ishia unying ri Íkpem Umusa isi ífɔ̃rhũngge.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>&lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aka iwayiwe utsɛ̃nga na apfuna utsɛrh uwukuse, unga awu ra arhim itoma-dak, nu unera aka ipfunu utsɛrh uwuku uwuwayi, awu ra arhim itoma-dak.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uner ubin nggu Urhiazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>&lt;&lt;Uner ubin nuwɔ aka isaka atsim atorhi imang azezerake, unga awe ri igũibɛn ubɛn unuma. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Ra angwĩ iyanga, utsũwã nuwɔ agburh Urhiazaru anu umɔ, awu nggu isɔɔ iki imaa iyornga. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Unga abee igha awushu ubingha aki igbei, ra adak utebur uner ubin hã. Ijui iki isaki iba irhɛn isɔɔnga hã.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>&lt;&lt;Ivanga iki imɛ̃ uner ifɛn hã akpea. Ípfu itser-Num ishupa unga ikũ izĩngge ri igbɔm Uibrahim. Ikɛi, uner ubin hã akpea, umbɔ adzake unga. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Ra anang isei abika akpukpe, ra anangkɛ unga aka agũ uver, unga abera asunga anyã Uibrahim ukuka nu Urhiazaru ri igbɔmnga. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Nggee unga ayisa unga agɛ, &lt;A Utɛtɛ Uibrahim, umaa ugũ atorh umum nu udene Urhiazaru unga ashɔmu itoknga ra amɛ̃ na arhor adɔnga arhɛmmum, ubinkutsu umum iwe ru uver ri idzũũ urha ukpirɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr Uibrahim agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;A ungwɛ̃mum, uyita ri ivangyɛ ungo uku uwe ru urhɛ. Ungo uyɛisa abin aka aze nu Urhiazaru ayɛisa abin aka abewe, bɔr icɛrɛ umbɔ afituwe unga nggimi ungo uwe ru uver. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Asi iwea akɛrɛ ha ukpekũ, bɔr ra ateumɛn nggu umbi, aka atsu ughorkaghor umbumbang uteitasamgbɔ utsur anera asoki nggimi abambɔ ugarmbi, use unera adzek ugarmbi abanga ru umɛn.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɛ, &lt;A utɛ, umum ishɔ̃rhã ungo, uma udene Urhiazaru unga azĩ ri iya utɛmum, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>ubinkutsu umum iwe ra angwɛ̃mɛn atɔ̃ɔ̃. Umum ibee unga arherha umbɔ, utsur umbɔ abambɔ ra anang akɛrɛ ha aki uver ha.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>&lt;&lt;Uibrahim agɛ, &lt;Awembɔ ru Umusa nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, uneke umbɔ akpeto ra abi ha.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɛ, &lt;A utɛ Uibrahim, ĩ'ĩ, unera aba adzek ra abika akpe azĩ ru umbɔ, umbɔ awuri idzipumbɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Umbɔ aba asi ikpembɔ ato ru Umusa nggu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, umbɔ asi ígũmbɔ unerwi aka idzeka akpe.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Arhim, imangmang, nu itser</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Umat 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Umar 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Uyesu agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubinkpi uku itsu anera agba ra arhim, awu ufang ukpɔ uba, bɔr atorh uner ha aka itsu ukpɔ uba. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Nu unerwi aka itsu unying ra awɛkaci abɛrɛ agba ra arhim, ugba umbɔ abope ukɔ igɔ ru urhɔknga na atare unga atsĩ ru ughorkaghor ukau ukugɔng. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Nggee àka akpɔm atsimbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt;Undɔkango aba agbaa ra arhim, utsɛrha unga. Unga aba nekuka, utsũwe unga. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Unga aba agbaa uvau ru ungo idikunga utɔɔva ru unuma unying, na aba idiku utɔɔva agɛ, &lt;Iki inekukũ,&gt; utsũwe unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Abi itser Uyesu agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee, utomuwa imangmangmɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Uteijee agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba awembi ri imangmang ukunjiir ru nyaki ishaa umastad, umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ agɔrmbi ucucii ipfum uwurɛ agɛ, &lt;Ubvurhi nu udɔnna ru ukau,&gt; umgbɔ uwuri igũmgbɔ umbi.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>&lt;&lt;Awu ungamɔ ru umbi aka iwe ru ugãrhã uwu irham use uwuku udzɛu ídɔinga, aka idzeku usi aba, unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Uba ifitem, uba usei nu ugha ubingha&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Asi ígɔra rimi, bɔr unga awuri igɔr ugãrhãnga hã ugɛ, &lt;Utɔng ukorhu ubingha ukũwã umum igha ni ihwa imaa, nu ungo udɔrhu ugha nu uhwa&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Awuri itara uwɛɛ ru ugãrhã hã aka adɔsa arherhanga? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Nggee umbi awe rimi hã, umbi aba adɔsumbi abina kishoo umbɔ aka adɛyiwa umbi. Umbi awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;Umɛn isi iwemɛn ubin, umɛn iwu agãrhã. Umɛn ikpurhi itɔ̃ itseryɛ iki iwe iyimɛn.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu akerhuwe abi irhãrhĩ <optbreak/> ingbim usɔka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Icɛ Uyesu awu ru uzãrhã ukpuku uzĩ Urusharhima, unga azɛ̃rhã ra atsom Usamariya nggu Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Unga aka atsĩ ru ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ukpɔɔ akatsak abi irhãrhĩ ingbim usɔka agbanga unga, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Umbɔ atsarhi irhakmbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu, Uteiya, ugũ atorh umɛn!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka anyã umbɔ, unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka azĩ ra abika adzowe idɛm-Num umbɔ anyã umbi.&gt;&gt; Umbɔ awu ru utsĩndĩ uwuku uzĩ, na akerhumbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Unying ru umbɔ aka anyã unga aka akerhunga, unga abvui aba atsu ivum akpoi Unum. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Unga aba agba ra adak Uyesu na atar uwɛɛ ru unga. Unga uwi awu uner Usamariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Uyesu arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea inera usɔka kishoo aka akerhe? Abɔrɔ utɔɔrha angwɛ̃mbɔ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Awu use ukpɔ utsu akpurha awu utsen uwurɛ ikiyikanga unga abvui aba ikpoi Unum?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usisok uzĩɔ. Imangmangngo ngge ikerhuwe ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibiba Iyɛrhe Unum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Umat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Unuma nukpɔ abi Ufarisi arhusa unga agɛ Iyɛrhe Unum iwuri iba ukang? Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ibiba Iyɛrhe Unum isi íwengge ubinkpi umbi aka inyã ra asumbi, <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Unera asi ígɔra agɛ, &lt;Àka anyã nggayɛ,&gt; use &lt;Nggayɔ,&gt; ubinkutsu Iyɛrhe Unum iwu nggu umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ, umbi aka ibee inyã unuma unying ri inum Ungwɛ̃-Ner, bɔr umbi asi ínyãmbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Anera awuri igɔr umbi agɛ, &lt;Àka anyã nggawi ri nggimi,&gt; use &lt;Nggawɔ ru nggɔɔ.&gt; Niba azĩmbi, niba adɔsumbi umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Ubinkutsu unum Ungwɛ̃-Ner uwuri iwe ru nyaki inai iki inyaka irhangnge afã, usok ru ubang upfunga nggɔɔ uzĩ ubang ukpɔrɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Bɔr awu ufang unga aka igbaashia ahwa uver abina arhɛrhɛ nu undan ukpirɛ ukpɛ̃kpɔ unga.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>&lt;&lt;Ru nyaka ngge iki iwe ri inum Unuhu, rimi hã ikɛi ngge iki iwe ri ivang Ungwɛ̃-Ner. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Anera agha na ahwa, apfuna na apfunuwe, utsɛku unumkpi Unuhu aka atsĩ ru nggaa ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃, mɔcɛ amɛ̃ isopfung aba atsĩme umbɔ kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>&lt;&lt;Iwe ru nyaka ha ri inum Urhutu, anera aka agha na ahwa, agoi na agoyiwe, akau irham na adzin idzin. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Bɔr ru unum Urhutu aka adzeka ru Usɔdɔm, umbɔ atsuke urha nggu akãã urha adzeka afã aba atsĩme umbɔ kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>&lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, iwuri iwe rimi hã ru unum Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka idzeka. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Ru unum hã uwuruwi aka awu afafã ni itsi uvi iyanga na abinnga awu ra abĩ, unga niba acipuwanga inyanga ake. Rimi hã ikɛi, uwuku uwe ru usi, niba abvui abanga ri iya. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Àka ayitu utsɛrha Urhutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Kishoo abika abee ifɔrh urhɛmbɔ, umgbɔ uwuri igwirmgbɔ. Kishoo abika agwirhuwe urhɛmbɔ, afufɔrh umgbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Umum ididɛyiwa umbi, nu utsuu ukpu ha awuri inyãmbɔ inera ivaa nu ukoma unying. Awuri nyanguwe unying na abɔre unying. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Akatsɛrh avaa aka idɛ̃ɛ̃ igɔɔ ananga unying. Awuri nyanguwe unying na abɔre unying.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha agɔrke ikɛi ugɛ, </char><char style="fv" closed="false">36 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Akatsak avaa ri ichang irham, awuri nyanguwe unying na abɔre unying.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awuri iwe rinɛɛ Uteijee?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anangkɛ ukom uku uwe, anang hã amgbɛpɛ iki ikɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe utsɛ̃rhãpfu aka angipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu adɛyiwe angwɛ̃ imesanga unyaka arherhe aki ifɛn-Num ubɛn ivang na aneke igũ azhe. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utepa nukpɔ uner uwuku utsu uvau aka asi igũa iwei Unum, asi ihwɛngnga unera. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Ru uteu ha utsɛ̃rhãpfu ruwɔ akɛyi ru utsa ha anu igɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Umaa utsĩ ra ateu umum nggu abika akpɛ̃na umum.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>&lt;&lt;Unga atirhi akpɛ̃ɛ̃, bɔr unga abvui agɔr ra amɛnnga agɛ, &lt;Umum ihwɛng ugɛ umum isi igũmum iwei Unum, ni isi ihwɛng anera, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>bɔr utsɛ̃rhãpfu uwurɛ akɛna umum iwiwosha. Umum ima iyike unga, utsur ikikɛyanga izhengge umum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Uteijee agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agũ ubinkpi uner uwuku utsu uvau uwu amɛn aka atãrhã aka arherhe. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Unum asi íkorhuka anernga aka asɛng abinkɛ aka arhika, abirabɛ aki iciu ru utsuu na atenum ru unga? Unga awuri adɔ̃rhũnga ri iyike umbɔ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, awuri iyikuka umbɔ ifitem ikɛi ru ubinkpi umbɔ aka abee. Bɔr Ungwɛ̃-Ner aka iba, awuri ikpoa imangmang ru upfung?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe uner Ufarisi <optbreak/> nu uner uwuku uyɛisu ikirbi abĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Ra abirabɛ aka adzowe imangmang ra atsimbɔ agɛ umbɔ arhika, na anu iyɛɛi abikase, Uyesu arherhe unyaka arherhe ugɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>&lt;&lt;Inera ivaa atsĩ ifɛn-Num ru ufɔm Iya-Num, unying awu utsa Ufarisi, uwu uvaa awu uner uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Uner Ufarisi ha asok abera adɛ̃ɛ̃ afɛn-Num ri itsikamnga agɛ, &lt;A Unum, umum itar uwɛɛ ĩdzaa ungo umum iki isi iwemum ru nyaka avɛu, abika ida irhirhika, abika atoma-dak, use uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ uwurɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Umum ikpem igha ubin idiki ivaa ri inuma utɔɔva, ni idzowe unying ra abina usɔka ra abinkɛ umum iki ikpo kishoo.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr uner uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ hã adɛ̃ɛ̃ uku uka. Asi ibera asunga arhisa afã, bɔr abangu ikɔknga na agɛ, &lt;A Unum, ugũ atorh umum uner arhim.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>&lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi, uner uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ hã abvui azĩ ri iyanga, Unum anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika, bɔr asi inyangu utsa uwɔrɔ awea rimi. Ubɛn unerwi aka aberi itsinga, awuri irhɛrhuwe ike. Nu uwuruwi aka arhɛrhi itsinga, awuri ibiberuwe ike.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu nggu angwɛ̃rhã awɛkaci</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Umat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Umar 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Anera ikɛi akũ angwɛ̃rhã awɛkaci aba ru Uyesu abanga umbɔ. Angwɛ̃ imesanga aka anyã rimi, umbɔ atsɛrha umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Bɔr Uyesu ayisa awɛkaci ha azĩ ru unga, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aneke awɛkaci aba ru umum, Àka niba akɛnmbi umbɔ, Iyɛrhe Unum iwu iyi ikpũmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, ubɛn unerwi aka asi iyɛisa Iyɛrhe Unum ru nyaku uwɛkuci, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩã ri ngge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyɛrhe uner ubin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Umat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Umar 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Uyɛrhu Uyahuda uwɔɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem uwuku uze, umum ikorhe uguse ni ikpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo uyisa umum uwuku uze? Uwuku uze ashia, Unum ukpekũ awu uwuku uze. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Ungo uhwɛngo íkpem iyɛrɛ, &lt;Niba ufɛrɔ unera, niba utomungo-dak, niba uvɛpɔ ivɛu, niba ugbɛrɔ angwĩ utsukukɔ unera, udzowe igɔng ru utɛngo nu uyango.&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Idzi 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Iva 5.16-20</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Uwɛdzɛm hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, umum iki idɔsumum akɛrɛ ha kishoo rimɔ̃ɔ̃, utirhi ri iwɛ̃nci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Uyesu aka agũ rimi, unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubɔr ubina unying ukpekũ. Ugoshe abinngo kishoo, udzowe uhwɛka ra atsũwã, nu uba udɔsa umum. Mɔcɛ ungo uwuri iweɔ ru ugbɛta urhɛrhɛ ra afã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Unga aka agũ rimi, amɛnnga aghong akarhãrhã, ubinkutsu unga awu uner ubin akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Uyesu arhi unga na agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aghong uner ubin aka itsĩ ri Iyɛrhe Unum. <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Idzidzɛrhe, uwuri ighwɔrhungge Urhakumi utsĩ ra angwĩ inepurha nu uner ubin aka itsĩ ri Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Abika agũ rimi, arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ akpo ififɔrh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubin ukpuku unang anera, Unum ananga ukpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Ubitru agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn abɛ ineke abinmɛn kishoo ni idɔsa ungo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, unera asi íneke iya use utsɛrh, use angwɛ̃mbɔ, use ateinga, use awɛkaci ri itsi Iyɛrhe Unum, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>na asi ikpoa arhɛrhɛ ru udan ukpirɛ, ru unum upfung uku ufa uku iba ikɛi unga akpo urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu abvui arherha arherhe akpenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Umat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Umar 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Uyesu akũna umbɔ usɔkdũmɛn azĩ ri ibanga, na adɛyiwe umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn izĩ ufã Urusharhima, nu kishoo abinkɛ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num aka atsɛng ri itsi Ungwɛ̃-Ner awuri itsuafɛrke. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Awuri idzowe unga ra abok atsen abi Uyahuda. Umbɔ awuri iyɛia unga, arhena unga, ashau aci atsuyiwe unga, awuri ikwɛr unga, na afɛre unga. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Ru unum untaar unga awuri isoka ikɛi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Bɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga asi igũ arherhanga ataimbɔ. Agbena awuwɔk ru umbɔ, nu umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi unga aka arherhe.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uner ibvuta asunga ayanguke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Umat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Umar 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Uyesu aka ayoku Ujeriko, uner ibvuta asei nu ubang utsĩndĩã anu ifɛn. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka agũ ititɔng anera arhɛrhɛ, unga arhusa agɛ awu use uni izãrhã? <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Umbɔ adɛyiwe unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu uner Unazarat unga atɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Unga atsarhi irhaknga ayisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu! Ungwɛ̃ Udauda! Ugũ atorh umum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Abika azɛ̃rhã ra asu Uyesu atsɛrha unga agɛ unga unukutata, bɔr unga agbisha atsarhi irhaknga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Ungwɛ̃ Udauda! Ugũ atorh umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Uyesu adɛ̃ɛ̃ na atsu umbɔ akũ uner ibvuta ha aba ru unga. Unga aka aba ukhapa, Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>&lt;&lt;Ungo ubee umum ikorhuwa ungo use?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umum ibee ikpo inyã anang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyɛi inyinyãngo. Imangmangngo ngge ikerhuwa ungo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Kanying asunga ayanguke, unga adɔsu Uyesu na akpoi Unum. Anera kishoo aka anyã rimi, umbɔ akpoi Unum ikɛi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Uzakka uner uwuku uyɛi ikirbi abĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Uyesu aka atsĩ ru Ujeriko, na azɛ̃rhã atɔng. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Uner uwɔɔ umɔ itsoka igburh Uzakka, unga awu unggbaashi abika ayɛi ikirbi abĩ, na awu ru ubin akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Abee inyã ungamɔ awu Uyesu ha. Bɔr Uzakka akpinunga asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãã Uyesu, anera arhɛmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Nggee unga atĩ agbaashia azĩ afũ nggaa ucucii abee inyã unga, Uyesu ani itɔng udika ha.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Uyesu aka azĩ atsĩ ra anang ucucii ha, unga abera asunga afafã na agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uzakka, ucipuwa ififitem, awu ufang umum iki icipa ri iyango irherɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Nggee iki ififitem unga ahwarha acipuwa aba agbanga unga nggu agɔm.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Anera kishoo aka anyã rimi, umbɔ atirhi ibvun arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga azĩ iwu utsen uner arhim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Bɔr Uzakka asok adɛ̃ɛ̃ na agɔr Uteijee agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, unyã! Icɛrɛ umum idzowe uteng abinkɛ umum iki iwu ra ake ra atsũwã, ni ifase idikunga inaa ra abirabɛ umum iki igha urhambɔ ri iyɛi ikirbi abĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ififɔrh iki itsĩngge ri iya ikɛrɛ irherɛ, ubinkutsu utsak uwurɛ iganga awu unang Uibrahim. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Ungwɛ̃-Ner aba ibee abirabɛ aka agwir, na afɔrh umbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe uazurhfa usɔka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Umat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Anera aka anu igosha akɛrɛ ha, unga atsĩã irherhe unyaka arherhe, ubinkutsu unga aka ayoka itsĩ Urusharhima, umbɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ use Uyesu awuri itsu Iyɛrhe Unum idzeka kanying ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsa uwɔɔ aka akpo imar iyiki ize asok azĩã itsim iyɛrhe ra abĩ akɔɔ, ra anang aka ader, na abvui aba ra abĩnga. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Nggee unga ayisa agãrhãnga usɔka, agashuwe umbɔ imang uazurhfa unying anying,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imang uazurhfa unying ha iwu imang afɛ̃ɛ̃ ataar.</char></note> na agɔr umbɔ ikɛi agɛ, &lt;Àka akũ imang hã adzipa utsɛku umum iki iba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr abi utepunga akpɛ̃mbɔ unga, umbɔ adene itser umbɔ azĩ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Umɛn isi ibemumɛn ungo uwu uyɛrhamɛn.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>&lt;&lt;Umbɔ aka atsĩme iyɛrhanga, unga abvui aba ri iya. Unga atsu umbɔ ayisuwe agãrhãnga hã, unga aka adzowe imang hã. Abee inyã angwĩkɛ umbɔ aka akpo atoma ri idzidzipambɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>&lt;&lt;Uwu inggbaashia aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asunga na agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, imang uazurhfango hã ikũwã umum uazurhfa usɔka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>&lt;&lt;Uteiyanga agɛ, &lt;Ĩhĩĩ, ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃, ugãrhũ uwuku uze, ubinkutsu ungo uweɔ ri idzidzɛrhe ru ubin ukpuku uci, umum iwuri ĩdzaamum ijee itepa usɔka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>&lt;&lt;Uwu uvaa aba agɛ, &lt;A uteiya imang uazurhfango hã ikũwã umum uazurhfa atɔ̃ɔ̃.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>&lt;&lt;Uteiyanga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Ĩhĩĩ, ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃, ugãrhũ uwuku uze, ubinkutsu ungo uweɔ ri idzidzɛrhe ru ubin ukpuku uci, umum iwuri ĩdzaamum ungo iyɛrhe itepa itɔ̃ɔ̃.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ ugãrhũ uwɔɔ aba agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, imang uazurhfango hã iyɛ, umum iwɔke ru utatorho. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Umum igũ iwei ungo, ungo ughong ikorhi ifɛrhɛ. Nu ubema abinkɛ ungo uku usi ingwɛ̃ɔ, nu ugbɛrɔ ubinkpi ungo uku usi idosɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Ungo ugãrhã uwuku utãrhã, umum ikũ arherhe angwĩngo itsu ungo uvau. Ungo uhwɛngngo umum ighong ikorhi ifɛrhɛ, ni ibee abinkɛ umum iki isi ingwɛ̃mum, ni ĩgbɛtũ abinkɛ umum iki isi idoimum? <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Awu use utsu ungo isi itsukukɔ imangmum ru ubanki, umum iki iba icɛrɛ iyɛi ngge nggu angwĩngge?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ unga agɔr abika adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ agɛ, &lt;Àka ayɛise imang uazurhfamum unying hã ru unga, àka adzowe ru uwɔrɔ uwu uazurhfa usɔka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>&lt;&lt;Umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;A uteiya, awea ra uazurhfa usɔka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>&lt;&lt;Unga agɛ, &lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi, uwuruwi aka awe ru ihwihwɛng awuri itomuwe unga akpo arhɛrhɛ. Uwuruwi aka ashia, awuri iyɛse ungwɛ̃rhĩ ihwihwɛng ha unga aka awerangge. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Icɛrɛ, anggamtsakmum aka asi ibemumbɔ umum iki iwu uyɛrhambɔ, àka akũna umbɔ aba nggɛɛ na afɛre umbɔ ra asumum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu atsĩ ru Urusharhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Umat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Umar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Uyoh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Uyesu aka arherhe akɛrɛ amaa, unga agbaashia azĩã ufã Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Unga aka ayoka uteu iyiki ici iyi Ubetafaji nu Ubetani udiki igũ iyɔrɔ umbɔ iki iyisa agɛ Igũ Acucii Uzaitun, unga adene angwɛ̃ imesanga avaa agɔr umbɔ agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>&lt;&lt;Àka atsĩ ru uteu ukpuku uci nggɔɔ ra asumbi, ubɛn itsitsĩmbi, umbi awuri inyãmbi ungwɛ̃ uzhika aka abow adɛ̃ɛ̃, uwuruwi unera anasi ifũã umgbɔ. Aka agarha umgbɔ akũ aba nggɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Unera aba arhusunga umbi agɛ, &lt;Awu use utsu umbi agarha umgbɔ?&gt; Àka adɛyiwe unga ugɛ, &lt;Awu Uteijee abeea umgbɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Abɔrɔ unga aka adene umbɔ agbaashia, azĩ anyã umgbɔ ru nyaka unga aka adɛyiwe umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ igarhu ungwɛ̃ uzhika ha, abi uzhika ha arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi anu igarhu ungwɛ̃ uzhika ha?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee unga abeea umgbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Umbɔ akũ umgbɔ aba ru Uyesu, abɛtuwe atorhambɔ nu undzingmgbɔ, Uyesu afũ asei nu umgbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Unga awu ru uzãrhã, anera abɛtuwe atorhambɔ nu utsĩndĩã.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka aba akhapa ri icipa ri Igũ Acucii Uzaitun, kishoo ikikɔng angwɛ̃ imesa atsĩmbɔ anggɔm, akpoi Unum nggu irhɛm ikerketangge ra abin idzeu kishoo umbɔ aka anyã.<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Idorh iwe nggu uyɛrhe uwi aka aba ri itsok Uteijee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Ididɔɔr ra afã, nu ikpikpoi afafã!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Amb 118.26</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Bɔr abi Ufarisi abɔɔ ri ikikɔnga agɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, utsɛrha angwɛ̃ imesango!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa umbi, abɛrɛ ha aba anukutata, atarh awuri idze aciuke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Unga aka ayoka Urusharhima na anyã utepa, unga aciu akpe uteu ha. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uda umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi abinkɛ aki ikũwã ididɔɔr! Bɔr nggayɛ umbi asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãmbi. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Inuma niyɔ ibarɔ anggamtsakmbi awuri idzin ufɔm adzipa umbi. Abi iwa awuri ikena umbi amaa inanga, na ayɔm umbi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Awuri ikwɛr umbi atar nu abĩ, umbi nggu awɛkaci ra abangdzinmbi. Asi ínekukumbɔ utarh unying nu undɔkakpɔ, ubinkutsu umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ivang ibiba Unum ru umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ri Iya-Num</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Umat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Umar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Uyoh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Mɔcɛ unga atsĩ ru ufɔm Iya-Num, na awayiwe abika agoyiwe abin. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Atsɛngmbɔ agɛ, &lt;Iyamum iwu iya iki ifɛn-Num,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Uish 56.7</ref></char>.</note>&gt; bɔr umbi atsu ike iwe anang awoi avɛu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Uiri 7.11</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Ubɛn unuma unga amesuwe ru ufɔm Iya-Num. Bɔr ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num, nu abika amesuwe Ikpem nu anggbaashi anera abee ifɛr unga. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Rimi hã asi ikpombɔ udĩkpi umbɔ aka ikorhe, ubinkutsu anera kishoo ayurhi ra arherhanga.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Acang ijee Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Umat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Umar 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Unuma nukpɔ unga aka anu imesuwe anera ru ufɔm Iya-Num, unga aka adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize, ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num na abika amesuwe Ikpem Umusa nu akakũmbɔ, aba agɔr unga agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>&lt;&lt;Udɛyiwa umɛn ungo ukũ ijee iyikisong ukorhi ifɛrha iyɛrɛ ha? Ungamɔ adzaa ungo ijeea?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum ibee irhusa umbi, àka adɛyiwa umum. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Ubɔtisima Uyohana udzeka afã use udzeka anera?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Umbɔ akɛki itsũwã nggu adɔkambɔ, agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn iba igɔr ugɛ, &lt;Udzek ra afã,&gt; unga awuri irhusa umɛn agɛ, &lt;Awu use utsu umbi ashimbi ri imangmang ru unga?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Bɔr umɛn iba igɔr ugɛ, &lt;Udzek ra anera,&gt; umɛn igũ iwei anera abɛrɛ, ubinkutsu, umbɔ anyangu Uyohana awu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Nggee umbɔ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn isi ihwɛngmɛn anangkɛ umgbɔ uku udze.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum igamum isi ídɛyiwamum umbi umum ikũ ijee iyikisong ikorha abin hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unyaka arherhe ri itsi abi irham imang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Umat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Umar 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Uyesu arherhuwe anera unyaka arherhe ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Unera nuwɔ akau icang irham inebi, na adzowuka abi irham imang, na azĩã uteu ukpɔɔ azĩ adãrhũnga. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Ivang inebi ha iki ibĩ, unga adene agãrhãnga ra abi irham imang hã agɛ, umbɔ adzowe ikpũrhã inebi ha ri icangnga, bɔr abi irham imang hã akwɛr ugãrhã hã na adene unga azĩã abok aka atãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Unga adene ugãrhũ uwu uvaa, uwu ha ikɛi umbɔ akwɛr na atsuyiwe unga atsa na awayiwe unga azĩã abok aka atãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Unga ana adene uwu untaar ikɛi, uwu ha umbɔ atsuyiwe unga isɔɔ na atare unga adzeka.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>&lt;&lt;Mɔcɛ uner icang hã agɛ, &lt;Umum ikorhi iguse ucɛ? Umum iwuri idene ungwɛ̃mum uwuruwi umum iki ibema, use umbɔ awuri idzowukumbɔ imor unga.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr ivangyɛ abi irham imang hã aka anyã unga, umbɔ akɛki itsũwã nggu adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;Uwɛrɛ unga awu uner ukam hã. Umɛn ifɛre unga nu ukam hã uwu ukpumɛn.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Nggee umbɔ atare unga ru undzing ufɔm icang hã, na afɛre unga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">&lt;&lt;Ude icɛ, uner icang irham hã awuri ikorha aguse nggu umbɔ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Unga awuri iba atsĩme abi irham imang hã, na adzowe icanga ru aner abɔɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ivangyɛ anera aka agũ rimi, umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ ama aneke iwe rimi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Uyesu arhi umbɔ, na arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use uwu agben itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt; &lt;Utarhkpi abi idzin aka akpɛ̃mbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ukpu ha uwu utarh angboki idzina&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Amb 118.22</ref></char>.</note>?<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka igba ni itsi utarh ha, akpurha ashaka. Nu uwuruwi utarh ha uku igba nú unga, ukpurhu ugɔke unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhusu ifai ikirbi abĩ ru Ukaisar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Umat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Umar 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Abika amesuwe Ikpem Umusa nu ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num abee utsĩndĩwi umbɔ aka idzur unga kanying, umbɔ ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ arherhe unyaka arherhe akɛrɛ ri itsimbɔ. Bɔr umbɔ anu igũ iwei anera.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Adene anera azĩ akhapa ru unga, na akpeta agɛ umbɔ arhika. Abee idzur Uyesu ri irhɛm arherhanga na atsuke unga ru ubok ijee ugomna. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Nggee aner ha umbɔ aka adene arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, umɛn ihwɛngmɛn arherhango nu imesango irhika, ungo ushiɔ ri itɛngasu, ikɛi ungo umesuwe anera idzidzɛrhe ru utsĩndĩ Unum uku urhirhiki. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Irhikungge umɛn ifai ikirbi abĩ ru Ukaisar use isi irhikungge?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Bɔr unga anyã ikoiambɔ unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>&lt;&lt;Àka adɛyiwa ishaa imang hã. Awu uzirhzĩ ungaa, nu itsok ungamɔ iwu umɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukaisar.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:25">Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka adzowe Ukaisar ubin ukpu Ukaisar, na adzowe Unum ubin ukpu Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Umbɔ afɔr idzur unga adambɔ ra arherhakɛ unga aka arherhe ra asu anera. Adzeidzeu ri idzipa arherhanga na akpurha anukutata.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhusa arherhe isoku udzak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Umat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Umar 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Icɛ abi Usaduki agɔr agɛ isok ra akpe ishingge. Abɔɔ aba ru Uyesu arhusa agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>&lt;&lt;A umarhem, Umusa atsɛnga umɛn agɛ, unera aba akpea na abɔruka utsɛ̃nga ashia ru ungwɛ̃, awu ufang ungwɛ̃mbɔ anyangu ukam utsɛrh ha na amare awɛkaci ru ungwɛ̃mbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Akatsak abɔɔ rabɔ utɔɔva anambɔ awu unying. Uwu inggbaashia apfunu utsɛrh, ashia ru ungwɛ̃ na akpea. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Uwu uvaa anyangu ukam utsɛrh ha na akpea rimi hã. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Mɔcɛ uwu untaar apfuna unga. Ikɛi ru nyaka ha, uwu utɔɔva apfunu utsɛrh ha na akpe asi ibɔruka ungwɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ri imimasha utsɛrh ha akpea. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ru unum isok ra akpe, awuri iwu utsɛ̃ ungaa ru umbɔ? Ubinkutsu umbɔ utɔɔva ha apfunumbɔ unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anera ru upfung ukpirɛ apfuna na apfunuwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>bɔr abirabɛ aka imɛ̃ɛ̃ isok ra akpe ikɛi, asei nggu upfung ukpɔrɔ uku iba asi ípfunumbɔ, asi ídzowukumbɔ ipfuna. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Umbɔ asi íbvui akpembɔ, umbɔ awu ru nyaka ípfu itser-Num. Awu angwɛ̃ Unum, umbɔ aka asok ra akpe. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Ikɛi Umusa adɛyika ugɛ abika akpe awuri isokmbɔ. Ra arherhakɛ unga aka arherhe ru ufum uku ugar urha, unga aka ayisu Uteijee, Unum uwu Uibrahim, nu Unum uwu Uishaku, nu Unum uwu Uyakubu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Idzi 3.6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Unga asi iwea Unum uwu ikom, bɔr awu Unum uwu abi urhɛ, ru unga kishoo awu ru urhɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Abɔɔ abika amesuwe Ikpem agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ungo urherhe mɔnɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ ashimbɔ ri ikeramɛn iyiki irhusa unga arherhe akɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukiristo awu Ungwɛ̃ ungaa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Umat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Umar 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awuri ikorha aguse na agɔr agɛ, Ukiristo awu ungwɛ̃ Udauda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Udauda nibikanga agɔr ru Ubvur Ambom agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt; &lt;Uteijee agɔr Uteijeemum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Usei ru ubok ughamum,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>utsɛku umum iki itsu anggamtsakngo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">ru andaidakngo.&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Amb 110.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Udauda ayisa unga agɛ, &lt;Uteijee&gt;. Ude awuri ikorha aguse na awu ungwɛ̃nga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ayare igoi abika amesuwe <optbreak/> Íkpem Umusa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Umat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Umar 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Ivang anera aka anu ikpeto, Uyesu agɔr angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>&lt;&lt;Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn nggu abika amesuwe Ikpem. Umbɔ abee itsim atorho akagɔng azɛ̃rhã, abee anera aghwe umbɔ ri inang izɛɛ, ikɛi umbɔ abee anera adzise umbɔ anang isei aka aze ra abã ifɛn-Num, nu anang isei aka aze ra anang irhowa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Umbɔ awu abika aghawe abin atsɛ̃rhãpfu na avur ayambɔ, na adarhi ider ifɛn-Num iyi igbana. Ikpũ umbɔ awuri itsu umbɔ ufai akarhãrhã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Izũwũ utsɛ̃rhãpfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Umar 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Uyesu aka abera arhi anyã, abi ubin aka atsuyi izũwãmbɔ ri ijara izũwã ru ufɔm Iya-Num. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Unga ikɛi anyã utsũwũ utsɛ̃rhãpfu iganga aka atsuke ungwɛ̃rhĩ íshaa imang ivaa umɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, utsũwũ utsɛ̃rhãpfu uwurɛ atsu ananga abɔɔ kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Kishoo adzowe izũwãmbɔ ri iwu ru ubinmbɔ. Bɔr unga ri itsũwãnga, unga adzowe kishoo ubinkpi unga aka awu ra ukpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsar imimaa upfung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-35">Umat 24.1-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-31">Umar 13.1-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga abɔɔ anu irherhe arherhe ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka akũ agbishu Iya-Num, nggu atarh aka aze nu izũwãyɛ umbɔ aka adzise ru Unum, bɔr Uyesu agɛ, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>&lt;&lt;Aba awu abin hã umbi aka azɛrhe, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ utarh unying umbɔ asi íneke ukpɔɔ utsorhukpɔ nu undɔkakpɔ, awuri isituwe ake kishoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A umarhem, ifɛrhɛ ha iwu ukang? Utsar ukpukusong ikɛi umbɔ aka inyã ri ivangyɛ ngge iki iyok?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn utsur umbɔ arhɛmmbɔ umbi. Ubinkutsu anera arhɛrhɛ aka iba ri itsokmum, umbɔ awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;Umum iwu unga,&gt; nu &lt;Ivanga iki iyongge.&gt; Niba adɔsumbi umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Umbi aba agũmbi isarhe iwa nu isoyi anang, niba agũmbi iwei. Awu ufang ifɛrhi iyɛrɛ ha igbaashia ikorhe, bɔr isok upfung isi íwengge kata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abĩ nggu abĩ akase awuri itang iwa nggu adɔkake. Iyɛrha abĩ nggu iyɛrha abĩ akase awuri itang iwa nggu adɔkake. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Umɔ awuri izusu upfunga akarhãrhã, ikɛi imerh nggu ikpo ri inanga irhɛirhɛ. Abin iwei ikɛi nu atsar agɔgɔngake aki idzeka afã.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umbɔ awuri idzaa umbi uver, na adzowe umbi ra anang aka avarha arherhe aki abi Uyahuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abã ifɛn-Num awu anang aka avarha arherhe abi Uyahuda.</char></note> na atsuke umbi ra abã ifɛn-Num nu ra agborzĩ, na atsu arherhe ri itsimbi ikɛi ra ayɛrhe nu agomna, ubinkutsu umbi awu abimum kata. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Akɛrɛ ha awuri iwu atsĩndĩkɛ umbi aka idɛyiwe umbɔ isarhe ri itsimum. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Bɔr àka atsu amɛnmbi, niba agũmbi ighong ubin umbi aka irherhe akaa atsimbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Ubinkutsu umum iwuri idzaamum umbi irhɛm nu itsoi arherhe akirakɛ anggamtsakmbi asi íwembɔ ru uning na akpɛ̃mbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Ateimbi, angwɛ̃mbi, abi ubãmbi, nu awɛrhambi awuri ighambɔ adakmbi. Awuri ifɛrukumbɔ abɔɔ ru umbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Anera kishoo awuri ikpɛ̃mbɔ umbi ri itsimum. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Bɔr igwar itsimbi unying isi ígwirngge. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Awu ibibimambi iwuri ĩdzaa umbi urhɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ umbi aba anyã abi iwa akan adziir Urusharhima, umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ itsitsimngge iki iyongge. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Mɔcɛ abirabɛ aka awu ru Uyahudiya atĩ afũ ra akpowa. Abirabɛ aka awu ru utepa atĩ adzeka. Nu abika awu ra awiya niba atsĩmbɔ utepa. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Ubinkutsu ivang iyiki itsu ufai riyɛ, iki itsuifɛr kishoo abinkɛ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num aka atsɛng. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Atorhmbi akatsɛrh abika awu ra ana nu abika akpɔm awɛkaci ri ivang hã! Uver akarhãrhã uwuri icipuwakpɔ nu abĩ, nu avɔm ikɛi iwuri igba ra anera. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Awuri ifɛre abɔɔ nggu akon aka ader, ikɛi awuri idzui abɔɔ akũ azĩ igãrhã ra abĩã kishoo. Atsen abi Uyahuda aba avur Urusharhima ukpɔ uwe ukpumbɔ utsɛki ivangmbɔ iki iba itsuifɛr.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>&lt;&lt;Awuri inyãmbɔ atsar ri ishaa unum, ufɛ̃ nu idzɛɛr. Nu abĩã ikɛi, anera kishoo amɛnmbɔ awuri ida, umbɔ awuri igũ ighong akarhãrhã, ru ubvun nu ighwighwii ukau ukugɔng. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Anera awuri igbiwa uvermbɔ uzĩkpɔ iwei ra abin hã aka ikorhe ru upfung, na awuri izusa abin akagɔng afafã. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Ri ivang hã umbɔ aka inyã Ungwɛ̃-Ner iki iba ra amɛɛ nggu ijee ri ikpikpoi akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Ifɛrhɛ iyɛrɛ iba itirhugge, àka agbisha adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker, ubinkutsu ivang ififɔrhmbi iki iyongge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Uyesu arherhuwe umbɔ unyaka arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka arhi ucucii uvorhvo nggu acucii akɔɔ kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Umbi aba anyã umgbɔ utirhi izɛɛ ayerhe aka afa, umbi nibikambi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ ikpũrhũnga isi idãrhũngge ni iba. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Rimi hã ikɛi, umbi aba anyã ifɛrhɛ iyɛrɛ ikorhungge, umbi ahwɛng agɛ Iyɛrhe Unum iki iyongge.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>&lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa umbi idzidzɛrhe, udan ukpirɛ usi ítɔngkpɔ utsɛku ifɛrhɛ ha kishoo iki ikorhe. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Afã nggu abĩ awuri itɔngke, bɔr arherhamum asi ítɔngke.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arherhe isei idzɛu ivang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>&lt;&lt;Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn, utsur amɛnmbi ayana atsĩke ri ihwihwa nu amɛn akatãrhã nu ifɛrhkɔ ibee abin upfung. Unum hã uba udzur umbi ru nyaku unggurhi. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Ubinkutsu iwuri iba ra atsi anera kishoo abika awu ru upfung. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Aka adzɛu ubɛn unuma na afɛn-Num agɛ umbi ama akpo iker iyiki ishɔɔr ri kishoo abin hã aka ikorhe, umbi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃mbi ra asu Ungwɛ̃-Ner.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Ubɛn unuma Uyesu amesuwe ru ufɔm Iya-Num, nu untsuuka unga aka isaka adzeku utepa amaa utsuu ni igũyɛ umbɔ iki iyisa Igũ Acucii Uzaitun. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ubɛn igɔ̃kpeka anera kishoo aka isaka azĩ ru ufɔm Iya-Num agũsha arherhanga.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyahuda abemunga ighadak Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Umat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Umar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Uyoh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Irhowu Uborodi ukpuku Usheru Uga iki iyongge. Umbɔ aki iyisa Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abika amesuwe Ikpem agũ iwei anera, nggee umbɔ abee udĩ ukpuku ufɛr Uyesu ri iwɔk. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Mɔcɛ Ushaitan atsĩ ru Uyahuda, uwu umbɔ aki iyisa Uiskariyoti, unying ra angwɛ̃ imesanga ha usɔkdũmɛn. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Uyahuda azĩ ra ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu anggbaashi abika adzɛu ufɔm Iya-Num akɛka arherhe nggu umbɔ ubinkpi unga aka ikorhe na adzowe Uyesu ru ubokmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Umbɔ agɔm na abemi ifai unga uhwɛk. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Unga abemuwe na abee ugarha unga aka idzowe Uyesu ri ivangyɛ anera aka asi íhwɛngmbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubin igha Irhowu iyiki Igar Utɔng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Umat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Umar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Uyoh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Unum Irhowa Uborodi ukpuku isheru uga uku uba uwe, unumkpi umbɔ aka ingwã ungwɛ̃ itsurhi iyi Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng adzowe idɛm-Num. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Uyesu adene Ubitru nggu Uyohana agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka azĩ akorhuwa ubingha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng umɛn iki igha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo ubee umɛn ikorhe rinɛɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi aba atsĩmbi ru utepa, umbi awuri igbopumbi unera aka atsã idzum amɛ̃. Àka adɔsa unga azĩ ri iyakɛ unga aka itsĩ, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>àka adɛyiwe uteiya iyaa ugɛ, &lt;Umarhem agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubãã ungwɛ̃kpɔ umum iki igha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng nggu angwɛ̃ imesamum?&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Unga awuri idɛyiwanga nggaa ubã ri ubã afã nggu abina ru unɔrkang. Umɔ umbi aka ikorhuwa abina kishoo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Umbɔ azĩmbɔ azĩ anyã abina kishoo ru nyaka Uyesu aka adɛyiwe umbɔ. Nggee umbɔ akorhu ubingha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubingha Uteijee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Umat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Umar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Uko 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Ivanga iki iwe, Uyesu nggu abi itsernga asei ra anang ubingha. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iki ĩmɛni ikponi igha ubingha Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng iyɛrɛ nggu umbi ni ĩdɔrhi ihwa ayetnum. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umum isi íbvui ighamum ngge utsɛku unumkpi ngge iki itsuifɛr ri Iyɛrhe Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Unga anyangu ukpɛwa ha, atar uwɛɛ ru Unum na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka ayɛi agasha kishookambi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Umum idɛyiwa umbi, umum isi íbvui ihwamum amɛ̃ inebi utsɛku Iyɛrhe Unum iki iba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Na anyangu uborodi, atar uwɛɛ na atsɔka ukpɔ adzowe umbɔ, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukpɛrɛ awu iyormum umbɔ aka adzaa ru umbi. Àka akorhe rimi hã na ayita umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Ru nyaka ha, umbɔ aka amaa igha ubingha, unga anyangu ukpɛwa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukpɛwa uwurɛ awu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa iki itsuifɛr ra adzirhmum, aka idzek agba ru umbi. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Bɔr aka anyã ubok unerwi aka igha adakmum usei igha ubingha nggu umum nu utebur. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ungwɛ̃-Ner awuri ikpe ru nyaku Unum aka abee, bɔr atorh uner ha aka agha adaknga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Mɔcɛ angwɛ̃ imesa atirhi irhusa adɔkambɔ agɛ awu ungamɔ ru umbɔ awuri ikorhe akɛrɛ ha.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Ikɛi uning usomgbɔ ru umbɔ agɛ awu ungamɔ awuri iwu uwuku ugɔngmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Uyesu agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ayɛrhe atsen abi Uyahuda aka isaka adɛyiwe iyɛrhe ra anermbɔ. Anggbaashimbɔ ikɛi aka isaka ayisa atsimbɔ ugɛ umbɔ awu &lt;abika ayike anermbɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Bɔr umbi, ishingge rimi. Uwuku ugɔnga ru umbi unga awu uwɛkucia, uyɛrhe ikɛi awu ufang unga awe ugãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Awu ungamɔ awu uwuku ugɔnga, uwuku usei na agha use ugãrhã? Asi iwea uwuku usei na agha? Bɔr umum uwe ru umbi ru nyaku ugãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Awu umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum ri kishoo ivang iyiki ivarha arherhamum. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Umum itsima umbi iyɛrhe, ru nyaku Utɛmum aka atsima umum iyɛrhe. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Ngge itsú umbi ama agha na ahwa nggu umum nú uteburmum, ri Iyɛrhamum, na asei ra anang isei Iyɛrhamum na avarhuwe arherhe anang usɔkdũmɛn aki Uisrairha.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>&lt;&lt;A Usiman, a Usiman, Ushaitan aka arhusa abee itsitsɛka umbi ru nyaka umbɔ iki itsɛki itsem. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Bɔr umum iki ifɛn-Num ru ungo Usiman ugɛ, imangmango niba igbangge. Ri ivangyɛ ungo iki idzipa, ungo ufituwe angwɛ̃mbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Bɔr unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umum iwuri izĩ ugborzĩ nggu ungo ni ikpe nggu ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwa ungo Ubitru, ungo uwuri itsɛyingo ihwɛng umum idiki itaar irherɛ ni ikɔ idɔrhi igbɛr ukpee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ umum iki idena umbi adzek, umbi asi inyãngumbi imang, ukpoka, nu abadak, umbi asheru use?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubin shikpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɔr icɛrɛ ungo uba uweɔ ru ukpoki imang, unyanga nu ibɛi ikɛi, ungo uba ushiɔ ri ikon ikider, ugoshe atorhango nu ugoi unying. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num hã iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;Avarha unga ra abi uvau,&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Uish 53.12</ref></char>.</note> awu ufang ngge itsuifɛr ri itsimum. Ĩĩ, ubinkpi umbɔ aka atsɛng ri itsimum, awu ufang ngge itsuifɛr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Angwɛ̃ imesanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, unyã akon aka aderkɛ avaa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu mɔnɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu afɛn-Num ni Igũ Acucii Uzaitun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Umat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Umar 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Uyesu adzek azĩ afũã Igũ Acucii Uzaitun ru nyaka unga aka abayi, angwɛ̃ imesanga asok adɔsa unga. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Unga aka azĩ atsĩ ra anang hã, unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka afɛn-Num, utsur umbi agbambi ru undeya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Unga abɔre umbɔ na agɔpa azĩa anang aka ader ru nyaki itang utarh. Unga atararhu na afɛn-Num. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Utɛ, ungo uba ubeengo, ungo uma unyanguwa ayetnum akɛrɛ. Rimi hã, asi iwea ibibeea umum bɔr ibibeea ungo ikorhe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Nu ipfu itser-Num idzeka afã akapɛng ru unga ifituwe unga. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Awu ru uver akarhãrhã, na amina asunga na afɛn-Num. Izipunga idzek irhong nu abĩ ru nyaka adzirh.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Unga aka amaa ifɛn-Num na azĩ ra angwɛ̃ imesanga, unga akpo umbɔ awu ru urhɔ, azhe ida amɛn. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi arharhɔ? Àka asisok afɛn-Num utsur umbi agbambi ru undeya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idzidzur Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Umat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Umar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Uyoh 18.2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Anasi ibvura angwĩnga, ikikɔng anera iba, nu uner ha umbɔ iki iyisa Uyahuda, unying ru umbɔ usɔkdũmɛn hã, agbaashia ru umbɔ adɔsa. Unga aba awumu Uyesu na ashor atamnga. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Bɔr Uyesu arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uyahuda, ungo uwuri ighadak Ungwɛ̃-Ner nggu ishor atam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Ivangyɛ abika adɔsu Uyesu aka anyã ifɛrhɛ ha iki iwuri ikikorhe, umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee, umɛn ikũ akon aka adermɛn ingbɛya umbɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Unying ru umbɔ atsũ ikon iyiki idernga agbɛr ugãrhũ Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num, azharhuwe uto ubok ughanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Bɔr Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ àka aneke umbɔ rimi!&gt;&gt; Na abangu uto ugãrhã hã akerhuwe ukpɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Mɔcɛ Uyesu agɔr ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num, nu anggbaashi abika adzɛu Iya-Num, nu akakũ aka aba ru unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi adzeka nggu akon aka ader nu igbong ugɛɛ umbi aba idzur uvɛu? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Ubɛn unuma umum iwu nggu umbi ru ufɔm Iya-Num, umbi asi iberu ubokmbi adzurmbi umum. Bɔr awu ivangmbi riyɛ ri iyɛrhe uzĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubitru atsɛyinga ihwɛng Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Umat 26.57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Umar 14.53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Uyoh 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ adzur unga, akũna unga azĩmbɔ ri iya Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num. Ubitru azɛ̃rhã uku ukaa adɔsa umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Bɔr umbɔ aka atai urha ra ateu ufɔm iya na akana asei umɔ, Ubitru asei nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Una igãrhã nuwɔ asei umɔ akhapa ru irhirhang urha, arhi Ubitru, na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uner uwurɛ awu nggu unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Bɔr unga atsɛyi agɛ, &lt;&lt;A una hã, umum isi ihwɛng unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ivanga ukunjiir iki itɔng, utsa uwɔɔ ikɛi anyã unga na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo igango uwu nggu umbɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsak ha, umum isi iwumum nggu umbɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ukara unying uba utɔng, utsa uwɔɔ ikɛi agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea ubin itsɛi, utsak uwurɛ awu nggu unga, ubinkutsu awu utsa Ugarhirhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Ubitru agɛ, &lt;&lt;A utsa ha, umum isi ihwɛng ubinkpi ungo uku urherhe.&gt;&gt; Unga ana awu ra arherhe nu ikɔ igbɛrngge ukpee. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Uteijee adzipa arhi Ubitru. Mɔcɛ Ubitru ayitu urhɛm Uteijee aka arherhe nggu unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwuri itsɛyingo ihwɛng umum idiki itaar, ni ikɔ idɔrhi igbɛr ukpee irherɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Unga asok adzek ra awiya na aciu na adɔng akarhãrhã.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayɛɛi Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Umat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Umar 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Abirabɛ aka akpɔm Uyesu ayɛia unga na akwɛr unga. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Akũ atorho abope asunga na arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usɔm Arherhu-Num! Ungamɔ akwɛr ungo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Arherhi irhɛm iyiki itãrhã irhɛirhɛ arhena unga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ra ateu anggbaashi abi Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Umat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Umar 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Uyoh 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Ukpee uku usar, ikikɔng akakũ abi Uyahuda, nu ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abika amesuwe Ikpem akɔng nu umbɔ akũ Uyesu azĩ ru umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Umbɔ arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba uwu Ukiristo, usɔma umɛn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Uyesu adzipa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iba isɔma umbi, umbi asi íwembi ri imangmang ru umum. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Umum ĩba irhusa umbi, umbi asi ídzipumbi urhɛm. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Bɔr udzur icɛrɛ uzĩ, Ungwɛ̃-Ner awuri isei ru ubok ugha Unum uwu ukugɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Umbɔ kishoo arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Ungwɛ̃ Unum?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Unga adzipa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu umbi arherhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn ibee ideka iyikisong ikɛi? Umɛn iki igũmɛn ra angwĩnga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ra asu Ubirhatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Umat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Umar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Uyoh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ kishoo asok akũna unga azĩmbɔ ru Ubirhatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Atirhi irhena unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umɛn inyã utsak uwurɛ adɛ̃ɛ̃ idzunuwe abimɛn. Unga agɔr agɛ anera niba afaimbɔ ikirbi abĩ ru Ukaisar, anu igɔr agɛ, unga uwu Ukiristo, uyɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Nggee Ubirhatu arhusu Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungo uwu uyɛrha abi Uyahuda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Uyesu adzipa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, iwu ru nyaka ha ungo uku urherhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Mɔcɛ Ubirhatu agɔr ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu arhɛrha anera kishoo agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum isi ikpomum ubin uvau ru utsak uwurɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Umbɔ ana angipa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga asoyiwe amɛn anera nggu imesanga ru Uyahudiya kishoo. Atirhi ru Ugarhirhi na aba atsĩã nggimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ra asu Uhiridu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Ubirhatu aka agũ rimi, unga arhusa agɛ use awu utsa Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Unga aka agũ agɛ Uyesu awu ri ijee iyɛrhe Uhiridu, unga adene umbɔ akũna unga azĩmbɔ ru Uhiridu, aka awu ru Urusharhima ri ivang hã.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Uhiridu aka anyã Uyesu, unga agɔm akarhãrhã, ubinkutsu aka adãrhũnga unga aka abee inyã unga. Unga aka agũã isarhanga, unga abee inyã abin idzeukɛ Uyesu aka ikorhe ra asunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Unga arhusa unga arherhe arhɛrhɛ, bɔr unga asi idzipunga urhɛm. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu abika amesuwe Ikpem adɛ̃ɛ̃ atsuyi arherhe uvau akeketake nu Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Mɔcɛ Uhiridu nggu abi iwanga anyã Uyesu uku ukwɛɛr na ayɛia unga. Atsime unga atorho iyɛrhe, na adene umbɔ akũna unga azĩmbɔ nu Ubirhatu ikɛi. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Ru unum hã umbɔ Uhiridu nggu Ubirhatu aka awu awɛrhɛ adɔka. Rimɔ̃ɔ̃ umbɔ awe ru igamtsak.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsu ufai akpe ru Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Umat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Umar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Uyoh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Ubirhatu ayisa ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num, nu anggbaashi anera nu anera kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi akũ utsak uwurɛ aba agɛ unga anu idzunuwe anera. Umum irhusa unga ra asumbi isi ikpomum uvau ru unga ru arherhambi aka akũ aba ri itsinga. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Uhiridu ikɛi asi ikpoa uvau ru unga, unga abvui adene unga aba ru umɛn. Umbi anyãmbi, unga asi ikorhunga ubin ukpuku utsu ufai akpe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Nggee, umum ikwɛre unga ugwɛɛ ni itsũwe unga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha agɔrke ikɛi ugɛ, </char><char style="fv" closed="false">17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ri ivang irhowa ha awu ufang Ubirhatu atsũwe umbɔ unera unying ru ugborzĩ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Nggu urhɛma unying umbɔ atsu ivum, anu igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka afɛre utsak uwurɛ, nu atsũwã umɛn Ubaraba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Ubinkpi uku utsu umbɔ atsuke Ubaraba ru ugborzĩ, unga atsu abika abee itsũwe iyɛrha abĩã afɛre anera.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Ubirhatu abee itsũwe Uyesu, nggee unga ashɔ̃rhã umbɔ ikɛi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Bɔr umbɔ abvui atsu ivum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anyapuwe unga! Anyapuwe unga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Unga abvui arherhe ide untaar agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu? Akorhu use iyiki ibewe? Umum isi inyãmum uvau akpe ru unga. Nggee umum iwuri ikwɛre unga ugwɛɛ ni itsũwe unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Bɔr umbɔ atsarhi irhakmbɔ angipa abee umbɔ anyapuwe Uyesu nu igãrhãmau ucucii, ivummbɔ itsu ngge iwe rimi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Nggee Ubirhatu atsukuka ufai akpe ru Uyesu ubinkpi umbɔ aka abee. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Unga atsũwũka uner ha umbɔ aka arhusa, na adzowe Uyesu umbɔ akorhu ubinkpi umbɔ aka abee.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyinyapu Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Umat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Umar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Uyoh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Abi iwa aka akũ Uyesu adzek, umbɔ adzur Usiman utsa Usayirin aka adzeku usi atsĩwã ru utepa, umbɔ atsu unga atsã igãrhãmau ucucii ha adɔsu Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Arhɛrha anera adɔsa unga, nu akatsɛrh abɔɔ atsorha abok nu atsimbɔ aciu akpenga. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Bɔr Uyesu adzipa agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi ana Urusharhima, àka aneke iciupa umum akpe. Àka aciu akpe atsimbi nggu awɛkacimbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Ubinkutsu ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ umbɔ aka igɔr agɛ, &lt;Idorh iwe nggu akatsɛrh abirabɛ aka awu akpirh, abirabɛ aka anasi imarmbɔ imar, nu abirabɛ umbɔ aka anasi iyammbɔ abɛ̃mbɔ!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Mɔcɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt; &lt;umbɔ awuri igɔr ígũ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agba nú umɛn!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">Ikɛi na agɔr ampfũwã akagɔng agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka atsire umɛn!&gt;&gt; &gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Uho 10.8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Anera aba akorhe rimi ri ivangyɛ ucucii ha aka ana awu uku usum, awuri ikorha aguse ri ivangyɛ ngge iki ikoyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Abɔɔ inera ivaa awu avɛu, akũ umbɔ azĩ ifɛre nggu unga. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Umbɔ aka azĩ atsĩ ra anang hã umbɔ iki iyisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Upfupfu Itsia.&gt;&gt; Umɔ umbɔ aka anyapuwe unga nu igãrhãmau ucucii nggu avɛu ha, unying ru ubok ugha, unying ru ubok ufer. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Utɛ, utsũwe umbɔ amɔrmbɔ ubinkpi umbɔ aka akorhe.&gt;&gt; Umbɔ agasha atorhanga nggu itang isɛng.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Anera adesa na azɛrhe, anggbaashi acata unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unga afɔrhuka abɔɔ, uneke unga afɔrhe itsinga unga aba awu Ukiristo, uwuruwi Unum aka asɛng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Abi iwa agɔpa afũ ayɛia unga ikɛi. Azĩ adzowe amɛ̃ inebi akika agbata. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba uwu uyɛrha abi Uyahuda, ufɔrh itsikamngo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Afafã itsinga umbɔ atsɛng itsɛng agɛ, <char style="sc">&lt;&lt;UWƐRƐ AWU UYƐRHA ABI UYAHUDA.&gt;&gt; </char><verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Unying ru umbɔ avɛu ha umbɔ aka anyapuwe arherhe arherhe aka atãrhã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Asi iwea ungo uwu Ukiristo? Ufɔrh itsingo nggu umɛn!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Bɔr uvɛu uwu uvaa atsɛrha unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Hɛ, ungo usi igũo iwei Unum, ufaingo uku uwu ubina unying nggu unga? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Umɛn ihwa uvermɛn mɔnɔ, umɛn ifai ubinkpi umɛn iki ikorhe. Bɔr utsak uwurɛ ashia ru uvau.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyesu, uyita umum ri ivang Iyɛrhango.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Uyesu agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum indɛyiwa ungo idzidzɛrhe, irherɛ ungo uwuri iwu nggu umum ra afã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Umat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Umar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Uyoh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Awu idzingga atenuma, uzĩ udze utsire ananga kishoo utsɛku akara ataar aki urhɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>ishaa unum isi irhangngge. Nu urhaburhe ukpuku uwe ri Iya-Num uvaar agbɛra avaa. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Uyesu atsarhi irhaknga akarhãrhã ayisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Utɛ, umum itsuka ipfumum ru ubokngo.&gt;&gt; Unga aka arherhe rimi amaa, unga akpea.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Uteiya abi iwa ha aka anyã ifɛrhɛ ha iki ikorhe, unga akpoi Unum agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu idzidzɛrhe utsak uwurɛ arhiku uner.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Ri ivang hã umbɔ kishoo aka akɔng umɔ ra anang hã, anyãmbɔ ifɛrhɛ ha iki ikorhe, umbɔ akwɛr ikɔkmbɔ na azĩmbɔ akimbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Bɔr kishoo abika ahwɛng unga, utoma nggu akatsɛrh abirabɛ aka adɔsa unga adzeka abĩ Ugarhirhi, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka, na azɛrhi ifɛrha ha.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igwirhuwe Uyesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Umat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Umar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Uyoh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Unera nuwɔ itsoknga igburh Uyusuf, unying ru umbɔ akakũ abi Uyahuda, bɔr awu ra amɛn na arhiku uner, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>unga asi ibemunga ubinkpi abimbɔ aki ikorhe. Unga adzeka abĩ Uyahuda, uteu Uarimatiya, na adzɛu Iyɛrhe Unum. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Unga asok azĩã ru Ubirhatu arhusa umbɔ adzowe ukom Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Mɔcɛ unga acipuwe ukom hã, na akũ atorho aka aze abɛrh ukpɔ, na atsuke ukpɔ ru udzak. Udzak ha uwe ru utai umbɔ aka asim ni ifa, ukpurukpi umbɔ aka anasi itsumbɔ unera umɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Unum hã uwu unum igbisha abin, unum ukpuku uwosha uku uyokpɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Akatsɛrh ha aka adzeka abĩ Ugarhirhi adɔsu Uyesu, asok adɔsu Uyusuf azĩ anyã udzaka na anyã ininu ukom iyornga uku unu umɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ abvui azĩmbɔ ri iya azĩ agbisha atsei isung na atsei akika adzuka. Ru unum ukpuku uwoshambɔ, umbɔ awosha ri ikpem.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Isisok ra akpe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Umat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Umar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Uyoh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Ru unum inggbaashia ri inuma utɔɔva, ri igɔ̃kpeka, akatsɛrh ha anyanga abinkɛ umbɔ aka agbisha azĩmbɔ ru udzaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Umbɔ akpo utarh ukpuku utsim ru udzaka uku ugɔ̃rhũkpɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Bɔr umbɔ aka atsĩ, umbɔ asi inyãmbɔ ukom Uteijee Uyesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Umbɔ ana awe ri idzeu ifɛrhɛ ha, kanying inera ivaa idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikhapa ru umbɔ, itsim atorho aka aterha ake arhang ru nyaki ishaa unum. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Akatsɛrh ha agũ iwei na asũrhã atsimbɔ ra abĩ, aner ha agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi abee uner urhɛ ra abika akpukpe? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Unga ashia nggimi, unga aka asoka! Aka ayitu ubinkpi unga aka adɛyiwa umbi, unga aka awu nggu umbi ru Ugarhirhi. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Agɛ awu ufang umbɔ aka idzowe Ungwɛ̃-Ner ra abi arhim, umbɔ anyapuwe unga nu igãrhãmau ucucii, ru unum untaar unga awuri isoka ikɛi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ ayitu irhɛmnga.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka apfuri ra anang udzaka abambɔ asɔme abɔrɔ udom hã (11), angwɛ̃ imesanga, nu irhɛ abɔɔ ifɛrha ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Awu umbɔ Umaryamu Umagadarha, nggu Uyowana, nu Umaryamu uyisa Uyaku, nu akatsɛrh abɔɔ aka awu nggu umbɔ, umbɔ asɔme abi itser Uyesu ifɛrha ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Bɔr umbɔ asi ibemumbɔ idzidzɛrhe akatsɛrh ha, ubinkutsu umbɔ anyanga arherhe ha awu isheri itsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Bɔr Ubitru asok atĩ azĩã ru udzaka, agba apfu, na anyã atorho ukpekũ, na abvui azĩã adzeidzeu ifɛrha ha iki iwe.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nú utsĩndĩ Uimawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Umar 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ru unum hã ikɛi inera ivaa abika adɔsu Uyesu aka azɛ̃rhã awuri izĩ ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ukpɔɔ ugburh Uimawu. Iderkpɔ iyongge akirhomita usɔka nu unying uzĩ Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Umbɔ anu irherhe nggu adɔka ru ubɛn ubinkpi uku ukorhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ irherha arherhe ifɛrhɛ ha nggu adɔkambɔ, Uyesu nibikanga adzeka aba azɛ̃rhã nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Bɔr Uyesu asi ibeenga umbɔ ahwɛng ugɛ awu unga.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi azɛ̃rhã na ani irherhu use ikivarhambi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Umbɔ atsurha adɛ̃ɛ̃, unyɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ ughɔrhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Unying itsoka igburh Ukirhiyoba, arhusa unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ungo ikiyikango uwu utsen ru Urusharhima ungo uku usi ihwɛngngo ifɛrha ha iki ikorhe umɔ inum iyɛrɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ifɛrhu use?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Arherhu Uyesu uner Unazarat, uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num, uner ijee ra arherhe nu ikikorhe ra asu Unum na anera kishoo. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Ikɛi ateiya abika adzowe idɛm-Num nu anggbaashi abɔɔ aka adzowe unga ra abi ijee Uroma, umbɔ atsuke unga ufai akpe, na anyapuwe unga nu igãrhãmau ucucii. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Bɔr umɛn ifosa ugɛ unga awuri ifai Uisrairha. Utoma rimi, ifɛrha ha iki ikorhe kishoo unum untaar nukpi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Utoma rimi, akatsɛrhmɛn abɔɔ adzaa umɛn idzeu. Umbɔ azĩmbɔ ru udzaka ri igɔ̃ ukpea ukpirɛ, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>bɔr umbɔ asi ikpombɔ ukom iyornga. Umbɔ asok aba agɔr umɛn ugɛ umbɔ anyãmbɔ irhi, ípfu itser-Num igɔr umbɔ igɛ awu nggu urhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Mɔcɛ abimɛn abɔɔ asok azĩmbɔ ru udzaka azĩ anyã rimi hã ru nyaka akatsɛrh ha aka arherhe, bɔr umbɔ asi inyãmbɔ unga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi adzunu use umbi rimi, amɛnmbi adɔ̃rhũ use rimi, ri iwe ru imangmang abinkɛ kishoo abika asɔm Arherhu-Num aka arherhe! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Asi iwea ufang Ukiristo aka ihwa ayetnum ri ifɛrha ha na atsĩ ri ikpikpoinga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Na atirhi ru imesu Umusa nu iyi abika asɔm Arherhu-Num kishoo, asɔme umbɔ arherhe akirakɛ aka awe ri itsinga ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num kishoo.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Umbɔ aka ayoku ungwɛ̃rhũ uteu ha umbɔ aka izĩ, unga akorhe ugɛɛ unga awuri itɔng. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Umbɔ angipa unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Usei nggu umɛn, unuma aka amaanga.&gt;&gt; Nggee unga azĩ asesa nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka asei igha ubingha nggu umbɔ, unga anyangu uborodi, atar uwɛɛ adzowe Unum, na atsɔka adzowe umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Mɔcɛ asumbɔ ayanga, umbɔ ahwɛng unga ikɛi, nu unga agwira ri inyĩnyãmbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Umbɔ arhusa adɔkambɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anggɔm asi itsu amɛnmɛn ayiruke ri ivangyɛ unga aka arherhe arherhe nggu umɛn ru utsĩndĩ na amesuwa umɛn itsɛng Arherhu-Num?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Kanying umbɔ asok azĩmbɔ Urusharhima, umbɔ azĩ akpo abɔrɔ udom hã (11) ananga unying na abirabɛ aka awu nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Anu igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu idzidzɛrhe! Uteijee aka asoka, adzekanga ru Usiman!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ ikivarhambɔ adzowe isarhe ubinkpi uku ukorhe ru utsĩndĩ, ru nyaka umbɔ aka ahwɛng Uyesu ri itsɔku uborodi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu adzeka ra angwɛ̃ imesanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Umat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Umar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Uyoh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Aiy 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ irherha arherhe ifɛrha ha, akpurha anyã Uyesu akapɛng adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra ateumbɔ, na agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ididɔɔr iwe nggu umbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Bɔr umbɔ agbipa iwei ifɛr umbɔ, umbɔ akaifɛrhkɔ agɛ umbɔ anyã imãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu umbi agũ iwei, awu use umbi anu icang ikɛi ra amɛnmbi? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Àka arhi abokmum, nu adakmum. Awu umum nibikami! Àka abanga umum agũ. Imãrhã ishingge ri ijuɛ nggu apfupfu ru nyaka umbi aka agũ ru umum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka arherhe rimi, unga adɛyiwe umbɔ aboknga nu adaknga. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bɔr umbɔ ana acang ra amɛnmbɔ, ri itsi anggɔm nu idzeu akarhãrhã, unga arhusa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi awembi ru ubingha ri nggimi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Umbɔ adzowe unga awushu ubɛrh uwuku uvum. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Unga ayɛi atãi ra asumbɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Arherhamum ha rakɛ, umum iki idɛyiwa umbi rimɔ̃ɔ̃ umum iki iwu nggu umbi. Ugɛ awu ufang abina kishoo aka itsuafɛr ri itsimum umbɔ aka atsɛng ri Íkpem Umusa, nu abvur abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, nu Ambom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Mɔcɛ unga ayanguwe amɛnmbɔ umbɔ ahwɛng itsɛng Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Unga agɔr umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Itsɛng hã iyɛ iki itsɛng igɛ awu ufang Ukiristo aka ihwa ayetnum na asoka ra akpe ru unum untaar. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Ni igɛ idzidzipa nu itsũwe arhim awuri idzowe isarhangge ri itsoknga, ra abĩã kishoo, awuri itirhi ru Urusharhima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Awu umbi awuri idekuwe anera ifɛrha iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Umum iwuri idenukũ ubinkpi Utɛmum aka abemuwa, bɔr aka adãrhã ru utepa utsɛku umbi aka iyɛi ijee iyiki idzeka afã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ififũ Uyesu ra afã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Umar 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Aiy 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka akũna umbɔ adzek azĩ akhapa ru Ubetani, unga abera aboka atsuke idorh ru umbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ itsuke umbɔ idorh, umɔ unga abɔruka umbɔ, ashupa unga afũmbɔ ra afã. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ adzowe unga igɔng na apfuri azĩmbɔ Urusharhima nggu anggɔm akarhãrhã. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Ubɛn unuma ikɛi umbɔ akɔng ru ufɔm Iya-Num anu ikpoi Unum.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
